window.TMD=window.TMD||{};TMD["S09"]=[{"z":"致老师","t":"To The Teachers","k":"text","p":[2,3],"b":[["h2","To The Teachers","致老师",0],["p","You're probably wondering whether or not you need to use this book. If you are going to be teaching S9, then the answer is \"Yes!\" If you are a new teacher, you should read the first portion of this book very carefully. If you have been teaching for a while, it 's a useful tool for you to brush up on your teaching practices, so a quick review will sharpen your skills.","你可能在想自己是否需要用这本书。如果你要教 S9，答案是“需要！”如果你是新老师，请非常仔细地阅读本书的前半部分。如果你已经教了一段时间，这本书是帮你温习教学方法的好工具，快速浏览一遍就能让你的技巧更纯熟。",0],["h2","How To Teach S9","如何教 S9",0],["h3","● Teaching Materials: Introduction","● 教材介绍",0],["p","There are two series, which are S series(See It & Say It) and EEC series(Easy English Conversation) , for students learning English more confidently. Here are the introductions of teaching materials for S9 students:","我们有两个系列，S 系列（See It & Say It）和 EEC 系列（Easy English Conversation），帮助学生更有自信地学英语。以下是 S9 学生教材的介绍：",0],["h2","S Series","S 系列",0],["h3","● Student's Books","● 学生用书",0],["p","Classroom Readers 9 Classroom Activities 9A and 9B Homework Exercises 9A and 9B","Classroom Readers 9（课堂读本）　Classroom Activities 9A、9B（课堂活动）　Homework Exercises 9A、9B（家庭作业）",0],["h3","● Progress Report Book","● 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["p","Today's Lesson Evaluation Sheet","今日课程（Today's Lesson）、评估表（Evaluation Sheet）",0],["h3","● VCD/MP3",null,0],["p","S SeriesClassroom Readers, Classroom Activities, Homework Exercises,","S 系列 Classroom Readers、Classroom Activities、Homework Exercises",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["h3","● Evaluation Sheets","● 评估本",0],["p","Listening labs Quizzes Tests Activity Sheets S series, which have twelve levels, consist of five books:","听力练习、小测验、考试、活动单　S 系列共有十二级，每级包含五本书：",0],["p","Classroom Readers 9 , Classroom Activities 9A and 9B, (used in the classroom), and Homework Exercises 9A and 9B, (intended for home use). These sets have a three-month (24 session) time span in which to be completed. There are fifteen lessons, three test days, three game/activity days and three review days. This teacher's manual gives teachers a clear presentation for each lesson and informs teachers of the pace, grammar, communication and phonetic objectives. Each lesson, time permitting, should include some type of game/exercise based on that day's lesson or as a review of previous lessons. It is important to read this section of the book thoroughly before teaching Lesson 1. Methods of teaching the alphabet, phonics, classroom activities, songs and games are explained to supplement the lesson presentations, which follow.","Classroom Readers 9、Classroom Activities 9A 和 9B（课堂使用），以及 Homework Exercises 9A 和 9B（回家使用）。这套教材要在三个月（24 堂课）内完成，包含十五课、三次考试日、三次游戏／活动日和三次复习日。这本教师手册为每一课提供清楚的教学呈现，并告诉老师进度、语法、沟通与发音目标。时间许可的话，每一课都应包含根据当天课程或复习前几课所设计的游戏／练习。在教第 1 课之前，务必详读本书这一部分。字母、自然拼读、课堂活动、歌曲和游戏的教法都在这里说明，作为后面各课教学的补充。",0],["h3","● Classroom Readers: CR","● Classroom Readers：CR",0],["p","The teaching focus of the book is grammar, vocabulary and dialog/conversation. It is an extremely important stage for the students. If they could not learn well, they would feel frustrated and give up learning for the following classes. Of course, you can see all the content on Jordan's Web Site, which is a good resource for teaching and a fun way of learning English.","这本书的教学重点是语法、单词和对话／会话，对学生来说是非常重要的阶段。如果学不好，他们会感到挫折，之后的课程就放弃学习。当然，你也可以在乔登网站上看到所有内容，那是很好的教学资源，也是学英语的有趣方式。",0],["h3","● Classroom Activities: CA","● Classroom Activities：CA",0],["p","There are a total of two books for the Classroom Activities 9A and 9B, which provide a variety of activities and exercises to strengthen conversation skills and reinforce grammar patterns. There is also a strong emphasis on dialog and grammar to help students develop good writing and speaking habits. With the exception of matching exercises, puzzles or phonetic activities, this book should be used as an ORAL guide to stimulate English communication. It is NOT intended as a reader or a workbook. The blank portions are necessary for the activities so that the language is produced orally and not simply read by the students. The exercises are also intended as a guide for teachers to emphasize key grammar/sentence/question patterns.","课堂活动共有 9A 和 9B 两本，提供各种活动和练习，加强会话能力并巩固语法句型，也非常重视对话和语法，帮助学生养成良好的写作和口语习惯。除了配对练习、拼图或音标活动之外，这本书应作为“口语”引导来促进英语沟通，不是读本也不是作业本。空白部分是活动所需，让学生用口语说出来，而不只是照着念。这些练习也是老师强调重点语法／句型／问句的指引。",0],["h3","● Homework Exercises: HE","● Homework Exercises：HE",0],["p","It is extremely convenient way to have 9A and 9B Homework Exercises for each teacher and student, because teachers need a reasonable time to correct the homework. Hence, students can do one of the books while the teachers are correcting another one. Moreover, students have a great chance to practice what they have learned form school by writing in these books, and also teachers can easily understand their students' learning results.","每位老师和学生都有 9A、9B 两本家庭作业非常方便，因为老师需要合理的时间批改作业。学生可以写其中一本，老师同时批改另一本。此外，学生写这些作业能好好练习在学校学到的内容，老师也能轻松了解学生的学习成果。",0],["h2","Progress Report Book: PRB","学习进度手册：PRB",0],["h3","● Today's Lesson","● 今天的课程",0],["p","There are totally twenty-four times for students and teachers to record the rate of progress for each class. The teacher is responsible for filling out a Daily Progress Report Form. These forms are located in the Class Progress Report Book that each student should have. Check each student's book after they have already finished filling out the form, and record their performances in class.","师生共有二十四次记录每堂课的学习进度。老师负责填写每日进度报告表，这些表格在每位学生都应该有的 Class Progress Report Book（课堂进度报告本）里。学生填完表格后检查每个人的本子，并记录他们的课堂表现。",0],["h3","● Performance","● 学习表现",0],["p","Some specific items of learning contents are listed in this area for the teacher to check and it is also for parents to know clearly what their kids have learned from the class. The teacher can note supplementary items used, or homework assigned, in the space marked \"Others.\" Put a tick in the squares for \"Excellent, \" \"Good\" or \"Try Harder,\" according to their performance. \"Excellent\" means students understand all the content and are able to use it; \"Good\" means students understand most of the material but aren't good at applying it. \"Try Harder\" means students need more help with the lesson, and the parents should pay more attention to their kids.","这一区列出一些具体的学习内容项目，方便老师检查教学重点，也让家长清楚知道孩子在课堂上学了什么。老师可在“Others”栏注记使用的补充教材或指派的作业。依学生表现在“Excellent”、“Good”或“Try Harder”的方格打钩。“Excellent”表示学生理解所有内容并能运用；“Good”表示学生理解大部分内容，但不太会应用；“Try Harder”表示学生需要更多协助，也请家长多关注孩子。",0],["h3","● Teacher's and Parent's Comments","● 老师与家长意见",0],["p","This section is for the teacher and parents to communicate with each other. The teacher may also use this space for recording the date, time, and content of make-up classes.","这一栏让老师和家长互相沟通。老师也可以在这里记录补课的日期、时间和内容。",0],["h3","● Quiz Grade","● 小测验成绩",0],["p","The teacher may do the spelling quiz for the students from the last class and write quiz grades in this space.","老师可以为学生考上一堂课的拼写小测验，并把成绩写在这一栏。",0],["h3","● Evaluation Sheets","● 评估本",0],["p","There are totally three evaluation sheets, which should be recorded in Class 9, Class 16, and Class 24 in this term. These evaluation sheets, which are for students to evaluate by themselves, will help the parents to understand how much the students have learned from the English course and also their participation in class. Before they start to do it, explain the sheet as clearly as possible. After finishing the explanation, students should check the appropriate space according to their perception of their performances. Example: Good Fair Try Harder","本学期共有三张评估表，分别在第 9 课、第 16 课和第 24 课填写。这些评估表是让学生自我评估用的，可以帮助家长了解孩子在英语课学到多少，以及上课的参与情况。开始填写前，请尽量清楚地说明表格内容。说明完后，学生依照自己对表现的感受，在适当的栏打钩。例如：好（Good）、普通（Fair）、再加油（Try Harder）",0],["h2","VCD/MP3",null,0],["h3","Here are the contents of the S9 MP3","以下是 S9 MP3 的内容",0],["h3","Animation","动画",0],["li","● Classroom Readers 9","● Classroom Readers 9（课堂读本 9）",0],["li","● Classroom Activities 9A and 9B","● Classroom Activities 9A、9B（课堂活动 9A、9B）",0],["h3","Sounds","音档",0],["h3","S Series","S 系列",0],["li","● Classroom Readers 9","● Classroom Readers 9（课堂读本 9）",0],["li","● Classroom Activities 9A and 9B","● Classroom Activities 9A、9B（课堂活动 9A、9B）",0],["li","● Homework Exercises 9A and 9B","● Homework Exercises 9A、9B（家庭作业 9A、9B）",0],["li","● EEC Book 5 Lesson 1-Lesson 6 Teacher should introduce the new lesson or review the lesson, which has been taught by using the cassettes/CD/MP3. This will help students to be familiar with different learning experiences . Moreover, please encourage students to review or preview the lesson from listening to the cassettes/CD/MP3, and also on the touchscreen all-in-ones.","● EEC 第 5 册 第 1 课－第 6 课　老师应使用录音带／CD／MP3 介绍新课或复习教过的课，帮助学生熟悉不同的学习经验。此外，请鼓励学生听录音带／CD／MP3，也用触控一体机来复习或预习课程。",0],["h2","Evaluation Volume","评估本",0],["h3","● Quiz","● 小测验",0],["p","There are totally three quizzes on Class 6, Class 14 and Class 22 in this term. This is the preparation for the coming test. Students can find their mistakes from their own learning and have a chance to improve. And as well, teachers can realize the weakest learning area of each student and strengthen it.","本学期共有三次小测验，分别在第 6 课、第 14 课和第 22 课。这是为之后的测验做准备。学生可以从中找出自己的错误，有机会进步；老师也能了解每位学生最弱的学习部分，并加强它。",0],["h3","● Listening Lab","● 听力练习（Listening Lab）",0],["p","There are three listening lab tests in this term, which always come on the formal quiz days of Class 6, Class 14, and Class","本学期共有三次听力测验，都在正式小测验日，也就是第 6 课、第 14 课和第",0],["li","22. It's a great chance to improve the students' listening comprehension using the Listening Lab Tape. Please notice your students' reaction while taking this test. If they have difficulty understanding the questions, please play it again. Don't let your students feel frustrated and inadequate. Building their confidence is the most important mission.","22 课进行。这是运用听力练习录音带提升学生听力理解的好机会。测验时请留意学生的反应；如果他们听不懂题目，请再播放一次。不要让学生感到挫折或失败。建立他们的自信是最重要的任务。",0],["h3","● Test","● 测验",0],["p","There are totally three tests in Class 7, Class 15 and Class 23 in this term. The teacher can see students' achievements from the tests. This is one of the most important evaluation for students to see if they can be promoted to the higher level or not.","本学期共有三次考试，在第 7、15、23 堂课。老师可以从考试看出学生的学习成果，这是判断学生能否升到更高级别最重要的评估之一。",0],["h3","● Activity Sheet","● 活动单",0],["p","These are a good resource for teachers. Students can do games or activities using these sheets, and practice what they have learned from today's lesson as well. Furthermore, parents can easily know more about the students' performances in class.","这些是老师很好的资源。学生可以用这些单张玩游戏或做活动，练习当天所学。此外，家长也能轻松了解学生的课堂表现。",0],["h2","Spelling Quiz:","拼写小测验：",0],["p","Give a spelling quiz covering the words taught in previous lessons during warm-ups. Have the students write the quiz","在热身时考前几课教过的拼写小测验。让学生把小测验的",0],["h3","words in their notebooks or Progress Report Books. Before","单词写在笔记本或进度报告本上。小测验",0],["p","the quiz, the teacher may review the vocabulary that the quiz will cover.","之前，老师可以先复习小测验范围的单词。",0],["h2","EEC Series","EEC 系列",0],["p","Book 5 Easy English Conversation Book 5 Lesson 1- 6 MP3 Basically, there are six books in the EEC series. The idea of using these series with S series is to enhance students' speaking and listening abilities. Indeed, they are the useful and worthy conversation books. Easy English Conversation (EEC) Book Five is focused on teaching children a very basic level of English. For each lesson, there is a detailed explanation about how to teach dialogues, vocabulary and activities. The daily dialogues are designed to teach English conversation and speech in an easy way.","第 5 册 Easy English Conversation 第 5 册 第 1–6 课 MP3　EEC 系列基本上共有六本。搭配 S 系列使用，是为了加强学生的口语和听力能力，确实是实用又有价值的会话书。Easy English Conversation（EEC）第五册着重教孩子非常基础的英语。每一课都详细说明如何教对话、单词和活动。日常对话的设计是要用简单的方式教英语会话和说话方式。",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"教学技巧","t":"Teaching Skills","k":"text","p":[4,5,6,7],"b":[["p","EEC Book five contains three sections: Let's See and Say, Let's Check, What Can I do? Each section has specific learning objectives.","EEC 第五册包含三个部分：Let's See and Say、Let's Check、What Can I do?，每个部分都有特定的学习目标。",0],["h3","● Let's See And Say",null,0],["p","This section contains a dialogue and a main picture to let students know what they are going to learn from it. The picture presents the meaning of the situation, which will help them understand the roles and stories well. There are simple and short sentences in each dialogue. Teachers should explain a situation by showing the main picture to help students understand what kind of situation it is.","这个部分包含一段对话和一张主图，让学生知道接下来要学什么。图片呈现情境的意思，能帮助学生了解角色和故事。每段对话都是简单的短句。老师应展示主图说明情境，帮助学生了解这是什么样的情境。",0],["h3","● Let's Check",null,0],["p","In this section, there are listening comprehension and writing activities for students to practice, which are designed to show what was learned from the unit. The exercise of listening comprehension is for reviewing the dialogue and sequence of each unit .The writing exercises enhance the students' ability to learn vocabulary. What Can I Do?","这个部分有听力理解和书写活动让学生练习，目的是呈现学生在这个单元学到了什么。听力理解练习用来复习每个单元的对话和顺序；书写练习则加强学生学习单词的能力。",0],["h3","● What Can I Do?",null,0],["p","This section is the student's self-evaluation. Before the end of the class, teachers should tell the students to open their books and to finish this evaluation. The teacher should read each item for students and explain the meaning. After finishing the explanation, students should check the appropriate space according to their perception of their performances. Also they can explain the meaning of the list to their parents. Example: Good Fair Try Harder What Can I Do? (From Lesson 2) Try I CAN Good Fair Harder I can start a conversation I can ask \"Do you play bastball?\" I can say \"That's cool!\" I can be nice to my friends I can invite friends to join the team","这一部分是学生的自我评估。下课前，老师应让学生打开书完成这份评估。老师逐项念给学生听并解释意思。解释完后，学生依自己对表现的感受在适当的栏打钩。他们也可以向父母解释清单的意思。范例：Good Fair Try Harder What Can I Do?（取自第 2 课）Try I CAN Good Fair Harder I can start a conversation. I can ask \"Do you play basketball?\" I can say \"That's cool!\" I can be nice to my friends. I can invite friends to join the team.",0],["h2","Teaching Skills","教学技巧",0],["h3","● Storytelling","● 说故事",0],["p","Storytelling is a good way to get your students involved in learning. Especially when using the Classroom readers, consider these suggestions:","说故事是让学生投入学习的好方法，特别是使用 Classroom Readers 时，可以参考以下建议：",0],["li","1. Introduce the story. Show the cover of the book and teach key words in the title of the story.","1. 介绍故事：展示书的封面，教故事标题中的关键字。",0],["li","2. Tell the story using mime and gesture. Since the students are medium-level learners, they will follow demonstration as well as language","2. 用默剧和手势讲故事。学生是中级程度的学习者，他们会跟着示范和语言理解。",0],["li","3. A picture is worth a thousand words. Let the pictures help you to communicate. After the story, do some activity to reinforce learning. Make use of drawing, role-play, etc.","3. 一张图胜过千言万语，让图片帮你沟通。讲完故事后，做一些活动来加强学习，例如画画、角色扮演等。",0],["li","4. Use \"finger reading\" to help students learn the vocabulary and to focus on the story.","4. 用“手指指读”帮助学生学单词并专注于故事。",0],["li","5. When you read or tell the story, always refer to the written text in the book.","5. 念或说故事时，一定要对照书中的文字。",0],["li","6. Read the story more than once. If you repeat the story, the children will always hear exactly the same text. This will help them to predict what is to come.","6. 故事要念不只一次。如果是照书念，孩子每次都会听到完全相同的文字，这能帮助他们预测接下来的内容。",0],["li","7. The teacher must be careful not to read too quickly. Written text is usually very precise, economical, and unrepeatable. That means listening is a fairly demanding task.","7. 老师要注意不要念得太快。书面文字通常非常精确、精简、不重复，这表示聆听是相当吃力的任务。",0],["li","8. The story will probably contain grammar or vocabulary that we are studying. Seeing this material in context will help the students to understand and use it.","8. 故事中可能会出现我们正在学的语法或单词。在上下文中看到这些内容，能帮助学生理解并运用。",0],["h3","● IPA Symbols (Phonetic Symbols)","● 国际音标（音标符号）",0],["p","Tell the students learning IPA symbols provides the way to pronounce a new word correctly. Let Ss know why they should learn IPA symbols. Teachers can follow these steps while teaching IPA symbols:","告诉学生，学国际音标能让他们正确念出新单词，让学生知道为什么要学国际音标。老师教国际音标时可以照下列步骤：",0],["li","1. Tell Ss the phonetic rules, ex.: i-e [aɪ]","1. 告诉学生发音规则，例如：i-e [aɪ]",0],["li","2. Take some examples, ex.: kite, rice, tiger, mice. To be done by the teacher or students.","2. 举一些例子，例如：kite、rice、tiger、mice。由老师或学生来举。",0],["li","3. Do some group/individual practice of IPA symbols by listening practice below:","3. 用以下听力练习进行国际音标的分组／个别练习：",0],["p","Listen and check: Listen to the word and check if it has the sound of a certain IPA symbol. Listen and fill in the blanks: Give Ss a word in IPA spelling with blanks, pronounce the word. Have Ss listen to the sound and fill in the blank with the missing IPA symbols.","听一听并勾选：听单词，勾选它是否有某个国际音标的音。听一听并填空：给学生一个有空格的用国际音标拼写的单词，念出这个字，请学生听音，在空格中填入缺少的国际音标。",0],["h3","● Spelling","● 拼写",0],["p","Teaching the children how to spell in S9 is mandatory. There really isn't any way to learn spelling other than constant repetition and drilling. Ask the students to practice spelling/studying the new words at home. Call out individual students to spell the review words as you take attendance. A good method to teach it is to follow these procedures EACH time a new word is introduced:","在 S9 一定要教孩子拼写。除了不断反复练习，真的没有别的方法学拼写。请学生在家练习拼写／学新单词。点名时叫个别学生拼复习单词。好方法是每次介绍新单词时都照下列步骤进行：",0],["li","1. Say the word and spell it, with the students repeating. Do this several times.","1. 念出单词并拼出来，让学生跟着复诵。重复几次。",0],["li","2. Write the word on the board. Introduce it phonetically. Point to a student to say the first letter. Point to another student to say the next letter. Point to students randomly, not in seating order. Keep them on their toes. Spell out the word this way, and start over again. Keep going until everyone has said a letter. This should be done very fast almost as if you are spelling the word yourself. Point to the student rather than calling him/her by name. It is faster and you aren't interrupting the spelling.","2. 把单词写在黑板上，用自然拼读介绍它。指一位学生说出第一个字母，再指另一位学生说下一个字母。随机指学生，不要照座位顺序，让大家随时保持专注。用这种方式拼完整个字，再从头开始，直到每个人都说过一个字母。速度要非常快，就像您自己在拼写一样。用手指学生而不是叫名字，这样比较快，也不会打断拼写。",0],["h3","● Vocabulary","● 单词",0],["li","1. Say the word to the students, let them repeat it after you.","1. 念出单词，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","2. Phonetic Spelling: See also \"How to teach spelling\"","2. 用自然拼读拼写：请参考“如何教拼写”。",0],["li","3. Explain the meaning to the students by using V.A.C. (from digital material) or situational stories. For example: When teaching \"believe\"","3. 用 V.A.C.（数字教材）或情境故事向学生解释意思。例如教 \"believe\" 时：",0],["d","(Point to S1) He says he is Spiderman. I don't believe it.","T",0],["p","Do you believe it?","Do you believe it?（你相信吗？）",0],["li","4. Make sentences using the vocabulary.","4. 用单词造句。",0],["h3","● Songs","● 歌曲",0],["p","Songs should be taught the last 5-10 minutes of class.","歌曲应在下课前最后 5–10 分钟教。",0],["li","1. Get students familiar with the song before you teach it. Tell them what the song is about, preferably in English. Use dramatic visuals and gestures.","1. 教歌之前先让学生熟悉这首歌，最好用英语告诉他们这首歌在讲什么，搭配生动的视觉辅助和手势。",0],["li","2. Go through the words. It is important that the Ss understand them, or at least the key words necessary for singing the song meaningfully.","2. 看一遍歌词。学生理解歌词很重要，至少要懂得有意义地唱这首歌所需的关键字。",0],["li","3. Have students pay attention to any vocabulary they might have had before and ask them to recall the context and illustrate with gestures and visuals.","3. 请学生注意之前学过的单词，请他们回想当时的情境，并用手势和图像说明。",0],["li","4. Speak the song line by line. Have students repeat the words.","4. 一行一行念出歌词，让学生跟着念。",0],["li","5. Sing a line at a time. Teach the refrain at first.","5. 一次唱一句，先教副歌。",0],["h3","● Eclectic Teaching For S9","● S9 的综合教学法",0],["li","1. T.P.R. (Total Physical Response) The teacher says the commands and the students show their actions by following them. Those commands are all from the classroom languages. For example: Stand up、Sit down、Go to...、Raise your hand...etc. Or teach students different vocabulary. For example: Point to the bathroom/ the bedroom.. etc. Show me \"call\"/ \"scared\"...","1. T.P.R.（全身反应教学法）老师说出指令，学生照着做动作。这些指令都来自课堂用语，例如：Stand up、Sit down、Go to...、Raise your hand... 等。或教学生不同的单词，例如：Point to the bathroom / the bedroom... 等。Show me \"call\" / \"scared\"...",0],["li","2. V.A.C. (Visual Aids Concept) The best way to help students to understand the meaning of English is to use pictures, flashcards, real objects, gestures, and other tools to teach in class. These teaching methods will heighten students' interest in English learning.","2. V.A.C.（视觉辅助概念）帮助学生理解英语意思最好的方法，是在课堂上用图片、单词卡、实物、手势和其他工具教学。这些教学方法能提高学生学英语的兴趣。",0],["h3","3. Repetition","3. 重复练习",0],["p","This is a common way for teaching in class, but it's very useful.","这是课堂上常用的教学方式，但非常有用。",0],["d","everything","T",0],["d","everything","Ss",0],["d","everything, everything, everything.","T",0],["d","everything, everything, everything.","Ss",0],["d","Everything is ok.","T",0],["d","Everything is ok.","Ss",0],["h3","4. Chain Drill","4. 接龙练习",0],["p","Have students to practice the certain sentence pattern in turns. For example:","让学生轮流练习某个句型。例如：",0],["d","Where were you?","S1",0],["d","I was in the kitchen . Where were you ?","S2",0],["d","I was in the living room.","S3",0],["p","( and continue the drill until all the students have done it)","（持续进行，直到所有学生都练习过）",0],["h3","5. Ball Drill","5. 传球练习",0],["p","There are varied ways to play with a ball for practicing English in the teacher's manual. Here is one of the ways below:","教师手册中有各种用球练习英语的方式，以下是其中一种：",0],["p","Teacher throws a ball to an unsuspecting student and asks a question. The student should answer the question right away and then throw the ball either back to the teacher or to one of their classmates.","老师把球丢给一位没有预期的学生并问一个问题，学生要马上回答，再把球丢回给老师或丢给其中一位同学。",0],["d","What did you do yesterday morning?","T",0],["p","(throw the ball to S1)","（把球丢给 S1）",0],["d","I played baseball yesterday morning. What did you do yesterday afternoon? (S1 throw the ball to S2)","S1",0],["d","I studied English yesterday afternoon.","S2",0],["h3","6. Chart Drill","6. 图表练习",0],["p","There are varied ways to play Chart Drill for practicing English in the Teacher's Manual. Here is one of the ways below:","教师手册中有许多用图表练习英语的玩法，以下是其中一种：",0],["p","yesterday today tomorrow bake cake ● cook soup watch TV go shopping",null,0],["d","(put a magnet on one of the squares and have S1 make a sentence)","T",0],["d","I baked cake yesterday..","S1",0],["h3","7. Substitution Drill","7. 替换练习",0],["p","Write down a sentence pattern on the board. For example:","在黑板上写一个句型。例如：",0],["p","She took some medicine last ... .","She took some medicine last ... .（她上……吃了药。）",0],["d","(show one of the flashcards: month, and have S1 finish the complete sentence)","T",0],["d","She took some medicine last month.","S1",0],["h3","8. Role Play","8. 角色扮演",0],["li","-Pair students up and have them practice the dialogue or conversation.","- 让学生两两一组练习对话。",0],["li","-Have students come up to the front and act the dialogue out in pairs.","- 请学生两人一组到台前演出对话。",0],["h3","9. Cloze","9. 克漏字",0],["p","Eliminate some key words from the sentences and have students to fill in the blanks.","把句子中的一些关键字去掉，请学生填空。",0],["h3","10. Question & Answer","10. 问与答",0],["p","The best time to carry out \"Question & Answer\" is at the beginning of each class for 5-10 minutes. Teacher asks questions from the previous lessons to enhance students' learning results.","进行“问与答”最好的时机是每堂课开始的 5–10 分钟。老师问之前课程的问题，加强学生的学习成果。",0],["h3","11. Matching","11. 配对",0],["p","It is good for practicing vocabulary and IPA symbols. For example:","这很适合练习单词和国际音标。例如：",0],["p","Prepare vocabulary cards and IPA symbol cards.","准备单词卡和国际音标卡。",0],["d","(show the vocabulary \"medicine\")","T",0],["d","(find the vocabulary card \"medicine\") medicine.","S1",0],["p","The doctor gave Andy some medicine. Or T.: (Write the word on the board \"bedroom\".) S1.: (Find the IPA symbol card \"[uː]\".)","The doctor gave Andy some medicine.（医生给了 Andy 一些药。）或 T.：（在白板上写 \"bedroom\"。）S1.：（找出国际音标卡 \"[uː]\"。）",0],["h3","12. Expansion Drill","12. 扩展练习",0],["p","It is an effective way to practice English. For example:","这是练习英语的有效方法。例如：",0],["p","Have students sit around a circle and start this drill.","请学生围成一圈坐好，开始这个练习。",0],["d","I had spaghetti for dinner yesterday.","S1",0],["d","He had spaghetti for dinner yesterday. I had noodles for dinner yesterday.","S2",0],["d","He had spaghetti for dinner yesterday. She had noodles for dinner yesterday. I had a hamburger for dinner yesterday.","S3",0],["p","(Continue this drill until all the students have done it)","（持续进行，直到所有学生都练习过）",0],["h3","13. Transformation","13. 句型转换",0],["p","Teacher writes down a sentence, such as \"This is my bicycle. \" Ask one student to change the sentence into another form, \"This bicycle is mine\". This is useful to practice grammar and sentence structures. For example:","老师写一个句子，例如 \"This is my bicycle.\"，请一位学生把句子改成另一种形式：\"This bicycle is mine.\"。这很适合练习语法和句子结构。例如：",0],["d","This is my bicycle, \"mine\".","T",0],["d","This bicycle is mine.","S1",0],["d","He","T",0],["d","This bicycle is his.","S2",0],["h3","14. Situational Practice","14. 情境练习",0],["p","Create different kinds of situations depending on the contents of the lessons. It helps students to understand the meaning of English exactly and also to enjoy lessons.","依课程内容设计不同的情境，帮助学生准确理解英语的意思，也能享受上课。",0],["h3","● Suggested Games and Ways of Scoring","● 建议的游戏与计分方式",0],["h3","1. Ghostbusters","1. 捉鬼敢死队",0],["p","Have students form a circle. Choose a student to be \"it\" and give him/her a newspaper stick. When the teacher calls student A, it has to hit student A on his/her desk with the newspaper before student A calls another student.","请学生围成一圈，选一位学生当“鬼”，给他一根报纸棒。老师叫 A 同学时，A 同学要在叫出另一位同学之前，“鬼”就要用报纸棒打到 A 同学的桌子。",0],["h3","2. Blind Man's Bluff","2. 蒙眼抓人",0],["p","Have a student wear a blindfold and walk around in the classroom to grab a student. When he/she has someone, ask a question to the student caught by the blind man. The blind man has to guess who he/she is according to the voice of the answer.","让一位学生戴上眼罩，在教室里走动去抓一位学生。抓到人时，问被抓到的学生一个问题，蒙眼的人要根据回答的声音猜出他／她是谁。",0],["h3","3. IPA translation relay","3. 国际音标翻译接力",0],["p","Divide students into groups and mark them with numbers. Say a word and let students spell it in IPA phonetic symbols. The teacher can let them finish the spelling in the relay way by calling the initial number.","把学生分组并标上号码。说一个字，让学生用国际音标拼出来。老师可以叫号码，让他们用接力的方式完成拼写。",0],["h3","4. Odd one out","4. 找出不同类",0],["p","Call out a series of words that have something in common except one, like doll, ball, chair, kite. Students must identify the word that doesn't fit in, in this case, \"chair\" is not a kind of toy. The activity can be also used with identifying phonetics in words.","念出一串除了一个以外都有共同点的字，例如 doll、ball、chair、kite。学生要找出不属于同类的字，在这个例子中，\"chair\" 不是一种玩具。这个活动也可以用来辨识字中的音。",0],["h3","5. Search","5. 寻宝",0],["p","The teacher determines a topic ex.: \"What will you do tomorrow?\" Each student writes something on a piece of paper. The paper are collected and redistributed to students. Students must use the dialogue provided by the teacher to find the owner of the paper.","老师选一个主题，例如 \"What will you do tomorrow?\"，每位学生在纸上写一些东西，收回后再重新发给学生，学生要用老师提供的对话找出纸条的主人。",0],["h3","6. Find Someone Who...","6. 找到某个……的人",0],["p","Divide students into groups. Write a list on the board, ex:","把学生分组，在黑板上写一张清单，例如：",0],["p","Who Does something play ball yesterday has a birthday party in June ....... Each group select a runner to ask other students the questions. The first team to find someone for each item on the list wins.","找到做过某件事的人：昨天打过球的、六月办生日派对的……　每组选一位跑者去问其他学生问题。最先为清单上每一项都找到人的队伍获胜。",0],["h3","7. Forgetful Teacher","7. 健忘的老师",0],["p","After covering the lesson in the reader, ask students to close their books. Read one of the sentences, pretending that you have forgotten how to read one of the words. Students must tell you the word you have forgotten.","教完读本的课文后，请学生合上课本。念其中一个句子，假装忘了怎么念其中一个字，学生要告诉您忘记的字。",0],["h3","8. What's missing","8. 少了哪一个",0],["p","Write some letters, words, numbers, or draw some pictures on the whiteboard. Divide the class into teams Have Ss put their heads down. Erase one thing off the board. Tell Ss to look. Ask, \"What's missing?\" to choose a student to tell you the answer. This way, everyone will have a chance to participate.","在白板上写一些字母、单词、数字或画一些图。把全班分队，让学生趴下，擦掉白板上的一样东西，再叫学生看，问 \"What's missing?\" 并选一位学生回答。这样每个人都有机会参与。",0],["h3","9. Sentence Building","9. 造句",0],["p","Choose five words that are not really related. Ask students to make a sentence or short story using these words. Ex: went/ movies/ friends","选五个彼此不太相关的单词，请学生用这些字造句或编一个小故事。例如：went / movies / friends",0],["d","I went to the movies with my friends.","S",0],["h3","10. Phonics Tic-Tac-Toe","10. 发音圈圈叉叉",0],["p","Draw a Tic-Tac-Toe grid on the board. Write different IPA symbols in each space. Divide the class into teams. The first player chooses a space by saying a word with the initial/middle/final sound of the IPA symbol in the space.","在黑板上画井字格，每格写不同的国际音标，把全班分队。第一位玩家说出一个词首／词中／词尾有该格国际音标的单词，就能选那一格。",0],["h3","11. Spelling phonics","11. 拼写发音",0],["p","Divide the students into teams. The students have their numbers. The teacher says a word and calls a number to spell the word in phonetic symbols or alphabets on the board.","把学生分队，每位学生有自己的号码。老师说一个字并叫一个号码，让学生到白板用音标或字母拼出那个字。",0],["h3","12. Phonics switch","12. 发音变变变",0],["p","Write a word they know on the board, ex.: boy. Have students pronounce it chorally. Then change one of the letters in the word by other letters. For example, boy→ Roy. The first student to pronounce the word correctly wins a point.","在黑板上写一个学生认识的字，例如 boy，请学生一起念出来，再把其中一个字母换成另一个字母，例如 boy → Roy，最先念对的学生得一分。",0],["h3","13. Crosswords","13. 填字游戏",0],["p","Draw a big grid on the board. The teacher begins by writing a word such as notebook. The student makes a word that has a letter of notebook. The words can be written forwards, backwards and diagonally. The students get points by the amount of letters in the words they make.","在白板上画一个大格子。老师先写一个字，例如 notebook。学生组成一个含有 notebook 中某个字母的字，字可以正写、倒写或斜写。学生依组成的字的字母数得分。",0],["h3","14. Paper airplane game","14. 纸飞机游戏",0],["p","Divide students into groups. Each group has to make their own paper airplane. Give them a minute to test their planes. Set the score for each target. For instance, 10 for landing on the chairs, 50 for landing on the desks, etc. After answering questions correctly, they can shoot their airplanes and get points according to the target on which they landed.","把学生分组，每组做一架纸飞机，给他们一分钟试飞。为每个目标设定分数，例如降落在椅子上 10 分、降落在桌上 50 分等。答对问题后就可以射出纸飞机，依降落的目标得分。",0],["h3","15. Frog","15. 青蛙",0],["p","Divide students into groups. Each group has to make their own paper frogs. Give them a minute to test their frogs. Draw two parallel lines on the floor. Put the frogs right behind the starting line. After answering questions correctly, they can propel their frogs once. The frog that goes the longest distance is the winner.","把学生分组，每组自己折一只纸青蛙，给他们一分钟试跳。在地上画两条平行线，把青蛙放在起跑线后面。学生答对问题就可以弹青蛙一次，跳得最远的青蛙获胜。",0],["h3","16. My name is John","16. 我的名字是 John",0],["p","Divide students into teams. Take turns to come out and make sentences such as \"My name is John. I am twelve years old. I live in Beijing. Each sentence is worth a point. Students have to make the next sentence within ten seconds or the teacher should say, \"Stop!\".","把学生分队，轮流出来造句，例如 \"My name is John. I am twelve years old. I live in Beijing.\"。每句得一分。学生要在十秒内说出下一句，否则老师要喊 \"Stop!\"。",0],["h3","17. Hot Rock","17. 烫手石头",0],["p","Have students make a circle. The ones in even numbers are in a team while the ones in odd numbers are in the other. Make a paper ball or any thing that could be passed by students safely as the hot rock. Have students pass the hot rock when the teacher asks a question. The student who has the hot rock in hands when the question goes to the last word must answer it correctly. If he/she failed, the team will get a sad face. The team that gets the most sad faces in the end is the loser.","让学生围成一圈，单号一队、双号一队。做一个纸球或任何能安全传递的东西当烫手山芋。老师说一个问题时让学生传烫手山芋，问题说到最后一个字时，拿着烫手山芋的学生必须答对。答错的话，他的队伍得一个哭脸。最后哭脸比较多的队伍输。",0],["h3","18. Monster face","18. 怪兽脸",0],["p","Draw a big monster face (the crazier the better) on the board. For different areas of the face -the eyes, the nose, the mouth, etc., assign different point values. (The smaller the area, the bigger the point value.) The S does what T asks him/her to do correctly can throw the sticky ball to the monster face. Wherever it hits determines how many points the S gets.","在白板上画一张大怪物脸（越疯狂越好），为脸上不同区域——眼睛、鼻子、嘴巴等——设定不同的分数（区域越小分数越高）。正确做到老师要求的学生可以把黏黏球丢向怪物脸，打中哪里就决定得几分。",0],["h3","19. Spy Code","19. 密码游戏",0],["p","Assign each alphabet a number, for example a=1, b=2.etc. Write a series of codes on the board \"1,16,16,12,5\". Students must translate the code into letters/words: \"apple\" as fast as they can.","为每个字母设定一个数字，例如 a=1、b=2 等。在白板上写一串密码 \"1,16,16,12,5\"，学生要尽快把密码翻成字母／单词：\"apple\"。",0],["h3","20. Scramble words","20. 单词重组",0],["p","Write the word in a scrambled fashion-\"oyb\" for \"boy\". Have students unscramble it on the board.","写一个字母打乱的单词，例如用 \"oyb\" 代表 \"boy\"，请学生在黑板上重组。",0],["h3","21. Simple scoring (short)","21. 简单计分（快速）",0],["p","Give the winner a point.","给获胜者一分。",0],["h3","22. Die score","22. 骰子计分",0],["p","Throw the die to get points. It can be extended to many ways like '-1,3,5/+2,4,6'.The teacher can be creative and make it different every time.","掷骰子得分。可以延伸出很多玩法，例如“1、3、5 扣分／2、4、6 加分”，老师可以发挥创意，每次都不一样。",0],["d","The teacher can draw a railroad, an apple tree, stone steps to a treasure island, etc. The students go the number of steps that the dice show. Some traps or lucky things can be added to the game above in order to make it exciting.","Extend",0],["d","#22-A parts collection If the die goes to 1 or 4 points ,they can get eyes; if 2 or 5 points, they can get a mouth; if 3 or 6 points ,they can get a face.","Extend",0],["p","The team that collects eyes, a mouth, and a face can form a smiling face and win a point. Teachers can change the parts into many other things.","集满眼睛、嘴巴和脸的队伍可以拼成一张笑脸并得一分。老师可以把这些部位换成很多其他东西。",0],["h3","23. Sticky ball score","23. 黏黏球计分",0],["p","Throw the sticky ball to get points. The teacher can draw different kinds of targets on the board.","丢黏黏球得分，老师在黑板上画各种目标。",0],["d","The teacher can put some letters, IPA symbols or words in the target, then ask the students to spell a word initial with the alphabet, pronounce the symbols or make a sentence with the word to get points..","Extend",0],["h3","24. Bingo","24. 宾果",0],["p","Draw a 3 by 3 grid on the board. Each team has its own mark. The first team that has three marks in a row is the winner.","在黑板上画 3×3 的格子，每队有自己的记号，最先连成一线的队伍获胜。",0],["d","chess board--Make the grids into 4 by 4, 5 by 5 or even larger. Have the students put 3,4 or more marks in a row.","Extend",0],["li","25. Maze:","25. 迷宫：",0],["p","There are several ways the students can choose at the beginning. After starting, the students have to change","一开始学生有几条路可以选。出发后，学生每到一个转角都要",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"班级管理","t":"Classroom Management","k":"text","p":[8,9,10],"b":[["p","direction at every corner, then get an unknown reward at the end.","改变方向，最后在终点得到未知的奖励。",0],["h3","26. Matching and memorization","26. 配对记忆",0],["p","Draw a concealed grid on the board. The teacher can write words, IPA symbols, or anything else in the squares. Have the students choose any two squares. If they match, the student gets a point. If they don't, the teacher erases them. The students try to memorize the location, and try it next time.","在白板上画一个盖起来的格子。老师可以在方格里写单词、国际音标或任何东西。让学生选任两格，配对成功就得一分；不成功的话老师把它们擦掉（盖回去）。学生要试着记住位置再试一次。",0],["h3","27. Big or Small","27. 比大小",0],["p","Students choose \"big\" or \"small\", the teacher throws the die to determine the standard number, and have students throw the die to get the final number.","学生选“大”或“小”。老师掷骰子决定标准数字，再请学生掷骰子得到最后的数字。",0],["d","Big!","S1",0],["p","T.:(throw the die)The standard number is 3!","T：（掷骰子）The standard number is 3!",0],["d","(throw the die)The final number is 6!","S1",0],["p","T.:S1 can get a point!","T.：S1 得一分！",0],["h3","● Digital Teaching: www.jordan.com.tw","● 数字教学：www.jordan.com.tw",0],["p","All the contents of S9 are on Jordan's Web Site, which includes Classroom Readers, Classroom Activities, and Easy English Conversation Book5. Students will have a lot of fun in learning English by watching and practicing animated pictures from this web site. The teacher can teach well through this fashionable and interesting teaching idea. The teaching steps of digital teaching are found in the teacher's manual for each class. And also, please encourage students to practice English with this web site on the touchscreen all-in-one in class as well as at home. Preview, Assist, Review are the three important steps for teachers. Students and parents should make use of it, too. It is a high-technology multimedia, but it is easy to operate.","S9 的所有内容都在乔登网站上，包括课堂读本、课堂活动和 Easy English Conversation 第 5 册。学生在网站上看动画、做练习，会学得很开心，老师也能用这种新潮有趣的方式好好教学。数字教学的步骤都在教师手册每堂课中。也请鼓励学生在课堂上和家里用触控一体机上这个网站练习英语。预习、辅助、复习是老师的三个重要步骤，学生和家长也应该多加利用。它是高科技的多媒体，但很容易操作。",0],["h3","● How to visit Jordan's Website","● 如何进入乔登网站",0],["p","www.jordan.com.tw ↓ 乔登美语教学网 ↓ e-Learning ↓ e-Learning白金会员 ↓ Enter the password ↓ Big Kid大儿童学习区 ↓ Lesson V儿童高阶 ↓ Book 9",null,0],["h2","Classroom Language","课堂用语",0],["h3","1. Classroom Commands","1. 课堂指令",0],["p","Stand up. Sit down Say _______. Close your books. Turn around. Again. Look at _______. Count the _______. Stop. No Chinese! No eating! Put it away! Come here. Open/Close your eyes. Open your books to page ______ Great job! Excellent! Well done! I knew you could do it! Yippee! All right! Hand in your homework, please! Are you sure? Be careful! Notice your spelling! Notice the tense!","Say _______. Close your books. Turn around. Again. Look at _______. Count the _______. Stop. No Chinese! No eating! Put it away! Come here. Open/Close your eyes. Open your books to page ______ Great job! Excellent! Well done! I knew you could do it! Yippee! All right! Hand in your homework, please! Are you sure? Be careful! Notice your spelling! Notice the tense!",0],["h3","2. Classroom Interaction","2. 课堂互动用语",0],["p","How do you say.......? What's the past tense of...? Make a sentence with..... Make a question. Who can correct the error? What does ..... mean? How do you spell... in alphabets? How do you spell .... in IPA symbols? Am I clear? Do you understand? Pardon me. How do you pronounce the word? Don't give up! You can do it! That's OK. Take it easy. Try it again! Give me five! Go! Good Luck!! Mary, Mary, go, go, go!","How do you say.......? What's the past tense of...? Make a sentence with..... Make a question. Who can correct the error? What does ..... mean? How do you spell... ? How do you spell .... in 国际音标 symbols? Am I clear? Do you understand? Pardon me. How do you pronounce this word? Don't give up! You can do it! That's OK. Take it easy. Try it again! Give me five! Go! Good Luck!! Mary, Mary, go, go, go!",0],["li","● The following phrases and expressions should be used to encourage future success and accomplishment:","● 下列短语和说法能鼓励学生日后的成功与成就：",0],["h2","How To Manage","班级管理",0],["h3","Class Preparation","课前准备",0],["li","(1) Please arrive at School thirty minutes earlier to do class preparation.","(1) 请提早三十分钟到学校做课前准备。",0],["li","-Fill out Teacher's Handbook","- 填写教师手册（Teacher's Handbook）",0],["li","-Prepare Teaching Materials","- 准备教材",0],["li","-Log on Jordan's Web Site and get familiar with today's lesson by operating the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 登录乔登网站，操作触控一体机熟悉今天的课程。",0],["li","-Help the absent students make up the missing class","- 协助缺席的学生补课",0],["li","(2) Please go into the classroom five minutes earlier to get everything done, and also interact with students.","(2) 请提早五分钟进教室把一切准备好，并和学生互动。",0],["li","-Check the touchscreen all-in-one to be ready for the coming class.","- 检查触控一体机，为下一堂课准备好。",0],["h2","Discipline","秩序管理",0],["p","The teacher should maintain proper discipline at all times. Swearing, spitting, throwing objects, standing on chairs/desks, hitting others, kicking walls, etc. ... are prohibited. Eating and drinking during class time will be left up to the individual schools/teachers, but these actions should be discouraged. A simple, common sense approach to discipline is usually best. Discipline involves keeping everyone happy. Even the students who are disciplined should end up happy. The student should understand that it is not them the teacher is unhappy with, just their behaviors. Discipline should never be a personal criticism. The students should know that the teacher likes them, but only wants their behaviors to be improved. Some basic things to remember about classroom behaviors:","- 确认触控一体机已为接下来的课程准备就绪。秩序管理：老师应随时维持良好的课堂秩序。禁止骂脏话、吐口水、丢东西、站在椅子／桌子上、打人、踢墙壁等行为。上课时间是否可以吃喝由各分校／老师决定，但应尽量避免。简单、合乎常理的管理方式通常最好。秩序管理是要让每个人都开心，即使是被管教的学生，最后也应该开心。学生应该明白，老师不高兴的不是他这个人，而是他的行为。管教绝不应是对人的批评；学生应该知道老师喜欢他，只是希望他的行为能改进。关于课堂行为，有几点基本原则要记住：",0],["li","-A misbehaving class is usually a bored class. A quick pace will help to ensure the students maintain attention.","- 秩序不好的班级通常是无聊的班级。快速的节奏有助于让学生保持专注。",0],["li","-Have your teaching aids and materials at hand to avoid lengthy delays, which give the students the opportunity to start misbehaving.","- 把教具和教材准备在手边，避免拖延太久，让学生有机会开始捣蛋。",0],["li","-Call on students in a random order. If a student doesn't know when it is his/her turn they will pay closer attention.","- 随机点学生。如果学生不知道什么时候轮到自己，就会更专心。",0],["li","-Mix choral work with pair work and individual practice. If possible, switch from one type of practice to another often to help keep interest and variety. Finally, return to group work to follow-up/reinforce the lesson. Minimize individual work if time is short. If a student is creating a problem in class, give him/her a long stare or a tap on the shoulder to let him/her know you disapprove. If the student persists, tell him/her to stop the disruptive behavior. If the problem continues, take away reward cards or have him/her stand up. Finally, if the student won't stop, send him/her out of the classroom to see the secretary. The student's parents should be notified of the behavior. You should treat the student well after each of these steps. You must show the individual that you are still friends, but you don't approve of the actions.","- 全班齐声练习、两人练习和个别练习交替进行。可能的话，经常变换练习方式，保持新鲜感和变化。最后回到全班练习，延伸／巩固本课内容。时间不够时，尽量减少个别练习。如果有学生在课堂上制造问题，先盯着他看久一点，或拍拍他的肩膀，让他知道您不认同。如果学生仍然继续，请他停止干扰行为。问题若持续，就收回奖励卡或请他站起来。最后，如果学生还是不停止，请他到教室外找行政人员，并通知家长学生的行为。每一步之后都要好好对待这位学生，让他知道你们还是朋友，只是您不认同他的行为。",0],["h3","Introduce Your New student","介绍新同学",0],["p","Sometimes there will be new students in your class. You should introduce the new students to your class and give everyone a chance to introduce themselves. The teacher should help the new students to join the class smoothly by giving them some extra help and explaining the class rules clearly. In some cases, giving the new student a chance to prove his English ability is a good way to get the class to accept him. It's also a chance to reduce his anxiety about being in a new class.","班上有时会有新同学。您应该向全班介绍新同学，并让每个人都有机会自我介绍。老师应给新同学额外的协助，并清楚说明班规，帮助他们顺利融入班级。有时给新同学一个展现英语能力的机会，是让全班接纳他的好方法，也能消除他对新班级的焦虑。",0],["h3","● Homework And Grading","● 作业与评分",0],["p","Establish from the first day of class that students need to turn in homework in a timely fashion. You must let students know you want their homework EVERY time the class meets. The homework helps to reinforce key lesson concepts and without completing it prior to the next class the student may begin to fall behind. Be very firm about making sure they turn it in on time! Correct the homework exercises carefully, this is a very important process for the very beginner. Be strict! That will help them in cultivating a good habit to write clearly and neatly. How to help the beginners doing homework successfully, here are some tips:","● 作业与评分：从第一天上课就要让学生知道，作业必须准时缴交。您要让学生知道，“每次”上课都要交作业。作业能帮助巩固课程的重要观念，如果下次上课前没有完成，学生可能会开始落后。务必坚持要求准时交作业！仔细批改作业，这对初学者是非常重要的过程。要严格！这能帮助他们养成书写清楚整齐的好习惯。以下是帮助初学者顺利完成作业的一些秘诀：",0],["li","1. Make full use of the \"Reinforcement\" section of the lesson plan in each class. Have students open the Homework Exercises to preview all the items about today's lesson.","1. 充分利用每堂课教案中的“Reinforcement（加强复习）”部分。请学生打开 Homework Exercises，预习今天课程的所有题目。",0],["li","2. Make a clear explanation for them to understand the content of today's Homework Exercises. And ask them to practice some exercises to make sure they understand. 90-100 A 70-80 C 80-90 B 60-70 D Grading of homework and tests should be consistent between the FT and the CT.A good rule of thumb to follow when grading homework is to subtract two points for a missing or incorrect word and one point for a missing or incorrect letter. If you are using letter grades (A, B, C, etc.) convert the number total to a letter grade as follows:","2. 清楚说明今天家庭作业的内容让他们理解，并请他们练习几题确定都懂。90-100 A　70-80 C　80-90 B　60-70 D　外籍老师和中文老师批改作业和考试的标准应一致。批改作业的一个好原则是：漏写或写错一个字扣两分，漏写或写错一个字母扣一分。如果用等第（A、B、C 等），请依下列方式把总分换算成等第：",0],["h3","Quizzes And Tests","小测验与测验",0],["p","Review lessons will always precede test days. The reviews are designed to cover key grammar and communication points as well as vocabulary to be tested. Always follow the exercise with a game/activity of your own (see games/ activities section for suggestions) that addresses the material you want to emphasize. Quizzes should be given after attendance taking. It is up to the teacher to decide whether or not the students will need a quick review before a quiz. If a student scores less than 80% on a test or quiz, he/she will be required to take it again after class.","测验日之前一定会有复习课。复习课的设计涵盖重要的语法和沟通重点，以及要考的单词。练习之后，一定要接着进行您自己设计、针对想强调内容的游戏／活动。小测验应在点名后进行。是否需要在小测验前快速复习，由老师决定。学生测验或小测验分数低于 80% 时，必须在下课后重考。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching","电话教学",0],["p","As teachers, we are not only concerned with students' achievements in class, but also concerned with their study habits while they are at home. Therefore, we've designed \"Telephone Teaching Material (TTM)\" to help students review English at home by answering some questions on the phone and let the parents know about their kids' ability in speaking English. The teacher should grade students' responses by using the \"ABC\" scoring system, write comments in the \"Teacher's Handbook\", and, for en couragement, give them reward cards according to their performance during the following class. For doing well on telephone teaching, the teacher may lead students to prepare those questions in class and give students 2 or 3 attempts to answer each question. In addition, while doing Telephone Teaching, be sure to greet students at the beginning of a conversation and give students some encouragement after they answer each question. Procedures:","身为老师，我们不只关心学生在课堂上的表现，也关心他们在家的学习习惯。因此我们设计了电话教学教材（TTM），让学生在电话中回答问题，在家复习英语，也让家长了解孩子的英语口语能力。老师应用等第（A、B、C 或 D）为学生的回答评分，把评语写在“教师手册（Teacher's Handbook）”中，并在下次上课时依照表现给予奖励卡作为鼓励。为了让电话教学顺利，老师可以在课堂上带学生准备这些问题，每题给学生 2 到 3 次回答机会。此外，进行电话教学时，对话开始时一定要先问候学生，学生每回答一题后也要给予鼓励。步骤：",0],["p","1.Greetings: Say hello to students or their family. Let them know you want to talk to the student.","1. 问候：向学生或家人问好，让他们知道您想跟学生说话。",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) Good afternoon, good evening.",null,0],["li","(2) Hello! (Student's name), this is (teacher's name). How are you today? 2.Questions and Answers: Try to encourage students to answer with complete sentences.","(2) Hello!（学生名字），this is（老师名字）. How are you today?（你好！……，我是……。你今天好吗？）2. 问答：尽量鼓励学生用完整的句子回答。",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) I know you knew that, try again!",null,0],["li","(2) Good! Very good! You did a good job! Wonderful! Very nice! Good boy! Good girl! 3.Ending: Continue to encourage the students again and remind them of something if needed:","(2) Good! Very good! You did a good job! Wonderful! Very nice! Good boy! Good girl! 3. 结尾：再次鼓励学生，需要的话提醒他们一些事情：",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) You are very good. Please finish your homework.",null,0],["li","(2) Don't forget to let your parent sign the \"Progress Report Book.\"",null,0],["li","(3) You are a good boy/girl. Did you prepare for the quiz/test next class?",null,0],["li","(4) You always do a great job! Is your daddy or mommy home? Please ask him/her to come to the phone, thank you.",null,0],["li","(5) How was school today?",null,0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"课程大纲","t":"Syllabus","k":"img","p":[11],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"学习目标","t":"Learning Goals","k":"text","p":[12],"b":[["h2","Learning Goals","学习目标",0],["h2","A) Grammar Goals","A) 语法目标",0],["li","1. Functional use of the tense structures: present, present progressive, and past tense.","1. 时态结构的实际运用：现在时、现在进行时和过去时。",0],["li","2. Formulating and answering questions correctly.","2. 正确地提出和回答问题。",0],["li","3. The use of conjunctions \"so\" and \"because\" to join two sentences.","3. 使用连词 \"so\" 和 \"because\" 连接两个句子。",0],["li","4. The use of the imperative for the giving of commands in the classroom. 5 The use of the future tense to communicate future plans.","4. 在课堂上使用祈使句下指令。5. 使用将来时表达未来的计划。",0],["li","6. Understanding and using cardinal and ordinal numbers in conveying information.","6. 理解并使用基数和序数来传达信息。",0],["li","7. Interpretation of information and dates according to the modern system; the solar calendar.","7. 依现代历法（阳历）解读信息和日期。",0],["li","8. The proper and correct use of prepositions \"in\", \"on\" and \"at\".","8. 正确使用介词 \"in\"、\"on\" 和 \"at\"。",0],["li","9. The use of adjectives to describe people or situations/events. 10.The use of \"either\" and \"neither\" to indicate a positive or negative reply. Also the use of \"some\", \"none\", \"all\", and \"both\", etc. in sentences to indicate quantity.","9. 用形容词描述人或情况／事件。10. 用 \"either\" 和 \"neither\" 表示肯定或否定的回答；也在句子中用 \"some\"、\"none\"、\"all\"、\"both\" 等表示数量。",0],["h2","B) Communicative Goals","B) 沟通目标",0],["li","1. To make comparisons between the actions and habits or appearance of different people.","1. 比较不同人的行为、习惯或外表。",0],["li","2. Be able to recognize opposite meanings in sentences and words.","2. 能辨识句子和单词中相反的意思。",0],["li","3. To indicate the time and place of an event or action.","3. 说明事件或动作的时间和地点。",0],["li","4. To talk about the time periods on the calendar and seasonal changes.","4. 谈论月历上的时间区段和季节变化。",0],["li","5. Be able to convey information about important holidays during the year.","5. 能说明一年中重要节日的相关信息。",0],["li","6. Knowing how to give simple commands.","6. 知道如何下简单的指令。",0],["li","7. Talk about the weather and saying what the date is.","7. 谈论天气并说出日期。",0],["li","8. Talking about the school and expressing dislike or like for subjects.","8. 谈论学校，表达喜欢或不喜欢哪些科目。",0],["li","9. The student can confirm or deny when being asked a question.","9. 被问问题时能确认或否认。",0],["h2","C) Vocabulary Goals","C) 单词目标",0],["p","Class 1: None Class 2: cub, greedy, trip, sell, librarian, pilot, lawyer, farmer, writer Class 3: jeep, remember, alone, enjoy, city, country, mountain, lake, weekend. Class 4: true, reply, protect, government, restaurant, order, cardinal numbers Class 5: forest, rare, follow, America, China, Germany, Japan, England Class 9: holiday, Christmas, favorite, Dragon Boat Festival, Mid-Autumn Festival, lunar calendar Class 10: None Class 11: through, surprised, cage, tusk, matter, anything, someone, somebody, something, somewhere, anything, find. Class 12: closer, everything, nothing, happen, all, each, both, none of them. Class 13: may, either, neither, subject, math, science, history, pass Class 17: edge, set, kind, geography, interesting, fail, report card, boring. Class 18: matter, give up, hard, easy, problem, thousand, try. Class 19: None Class 20: during, except, carry, weather, rain/rainy, snow/snowy, cloudy, windy, warm, cool. Class 21: stomach, empty, wise, owl, embarrassed, once, twice.",null,0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"第 1 课","t":"Class 1","k":"class","p":[13,14,15,16],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","C.A.",null,1],["p","To review comparatives and adverbs To review \"How,\" \"Who\" and \"Which\" questions To review Tenses: Present, Present Participle and past","复习比较级和副词；复习 \"How\"、\"Who\" 和 \"Which\" 问句；复习时态：现在时、现在分词和过去时",1],["h3","EEC5 lesson1","EEC5 第 1 课",1],["li","- Planning to have good times with friends.","- 计划和朋友共度美好时光。",1],["li","- Arranging stuff","- 安排东西",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 1","课堂活动第 1 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Review","复习",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Review","复习",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 1","EEC 5 第 1 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","snack (sandwich, cookie, grocery) friend (relative, classmate) soft drink (juice, tea, milk) great (nice, pleasant ) game (cards)",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","What are your plans for this afternoon?","A",1],["d","Let me think...I have to buy some snacks.","B",1],["d","What for?","A",1],["d","I will go on a picnic with my friends.","B",1],["d","Sounds good! Would you mind if I go with you?.","A",1],["d","Of course not! That will be great! Can you bring some soft drinks or something like that?","B",1],["d","For sure. And some games as well.","A",1],["d","Great. We'll have a good time.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Introduce the new students to the class; have them say some words according to your hints. For example: I am ... . I am from... I like ... better than ..... You can introduce yourself using those sentence patterns first.","(1) 向全班介绍新同学，让他们依你的提示说几句话。例如：I am ... . I am from... I like ... better than .....。你可以先用这些句型自我介绍。",0],["li","(2) Review the comparative from S8 using the digital teaching.","(2) 用数字教学复习 S8 的比较级。",0],["li","(3) Do \"Q&A\" after reviewing the story. Are lions bigger than elephants? Are giraffes taller than rabbits? Are the lions smaller than tigers? Which animals do you like most?","(3) 复习故事后做问答：Are lions bigger than elephants? Are giraffes taller than rabbits? Are the lions smaller than tigers? Which animals do you like most?",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 1 I'm Happier than","课堂活动（35 分钟）第 1 课 I'm Happier than",0],["h2","You Are","You Are（我比你开心）",0],["h3","1.1",null,0],["li","1. Review the comparisons by writing the adjectives on the board then have students transfer them and make sentences following \"I am... than you.\"","1. 把形容词写在白板上复习比较级，让学生转换形式并照 \"I am... than you.\" 造句。",0],["li","2. T( write down happy) I am happier than you. Everybody, go!","2. T（写下 happy）I am happier than you. 大家一起，开始！",0],["d","I am happier than you.","Ss",0],["li","2. Change the persons and the adjectives according to the book while doing the sentence pattern.","2. 练习句型时，依课本更换人物和形容词。",0],["li","3. . Complete exercice1.1.","3. 完成练习 1.1。",0],["h3","1.2",null,0],["li","(1) Have the students make three questions for each set of pictures and then make three sentences to describe the situation. For example: Show them pictures 1-3: \"Joey eats very .,\" \"Joey eats than Sarah,\" and \"Sarah eats more than Joey.\"","(1) 让学生为每组图提出三个问题，再造三个句子描述情况。例如给他们看图 1–3：\"Joey eats very ....\"、\"Joey eats ... than Sarah.\" 和 \"Sarah eats more than Joey.\"",0],["li","(2) Pair the students up, and give every group a question. (1-4) Have them think of three sentences according to the hints on the monitor and write down on the paper.","(2) 让学生两两一组，每组一题（1–4），让他们依屏幕上的提示想出三个句子并写在纸上。",0],["li","(3) Let each group stand up and say their sentences, discuss the different answers with the class.","(3) 让各组站起来说出他们的句子，和全班讨论不同的答案。",0],["h3","1.3",null,0],["li","(1) Review the usage of \"who,\" \"which\" and \"how.\" Use the first two examples.","(1) 用前两个例子复习 \"who\"、\"which\" 和 \"how\" 的用法。",0],["li","(2) Use \"Quiz\" drill to let the students complete the questions. Write \"Q&A\" on the board. For example: Q: ..... , Billy or Ann? A: Ann is taller than Billy. Let the students open their books and fill in the blanks after the oral practice.","(2) 用“问答”操练让学生完成问题。在白板上写“Q&A”，例如：Q：.....，Billy or Ann?　A：Ann is taller than Billy.　口头练习后，让学生打开书填空。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 1 I'm Happier than","课堂活动（35 分钟）第 1 课 I'm Happier than",0],["h2","You Are","You Are（我比你开心）",0],["h3","1.4",null,0],["li","(1) Lead the students to read each word on the monitor and think of the opposite meaning.","(1) 带学生念屏幕上的每个字，并想出相反的意思。",0],["li","(2) Divide them into two teams and number them. Write the word list on page 7 on the one side and the antonyms on the other side.","(2) 把学生分成两队并编号。把第 7 页的单词表写在一边，相反词写在另一边。",0],["li","(3) Call a number, have the two students take turns saying any word from the opponent's side and say the opposite meaning as well.","(3) 叫一个号码，让两位学生轮流说出对方那边的任一个字，并说出它的相反词。",0],["li","(4) See which team can complete the questions quickly and correctly. That team will be the winner.","(4) 看哪一队能又快又正确地完成，那一队获胜。",0],["h3","1.5",null,0],["li","(1) Practice the three different tenses by making sentences. For example: I close my book. I am closing my book. I closed my book that morning. Choose some of the different tenses of the words and have each student get one to make a sentence using the tense. Let the students come to the front and say their sentences. The rest of the students have to stand up and repeat if they hear any \"Past Tense\" sentence. If someone stands slowly, then he/ she will be the next one to say.","(1) 用造句练习三种时态。例如：I close my book. I am closing my book. I closed my book that morning.　选一些字的不同时态，每位学生拿一个用那个时态造句。让学生到前面说出句子，其他学生听到“过去时”的句子就要站起来重复。站得慢的人就是下一个说的人。",0],["h3","1.6",null,0],["p","Play \"The Bear Went Over the Mountain\" on the touchscreen all-in-one and have the students sing to the music.","在触控一体机上播放 \"The Bear Went Over the Mountain\"，让学生跟着音乐唱。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["h3","Context Introduction","情境介绍",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monologue of \"Let's See and Say\" section in lesson one. The teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See And Say:","老师让学生听第 2 课“Let's See And Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See And Say 独白：",0],["p","What are your plans for this weekend? How about going on a picnic with your family or friends? The little girl is going on a picnic with her friends and the boy is joining them too. Let's listen to their plan about going on a picnic this afternoon.","你这个周末有什么计划？和家人或朋友去野餐怎么样？小女孩要和朋友去野餐，男孩也要一起去。我们来听听他们今天下午去野餐的计划。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have just practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialogue and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons that students have learned today by reading the books.","(1) 看课本复习学生今天学过的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","(1) Take this time to preview their homework. Pick some examples for the students to practice answering.","(1) 利用这段时间预习家庭作业，挑一些例子让学生练习回答。",0],["li","(2) Explain the mistakes they've made","(2) 解释他们犯的错误。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning/homework items on the board and have students write down on their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check the progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Have the students bring two pictures about occupations that they like for the next class.","(3) 请学生下堂课带两张他们喜欢的职业图片。",0]],"g":[[26,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activiti","Lesson 15","15.3"]],[31,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1","1. 1","1. 2","1. 3","1. 4","1. 5","1. 6"]],[78,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["I'm Happier than"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 2 课","t":"Class 2","k":"class","p":[17,18,19,20],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","C.A.",null,1],["p","To talk about future goals (using future tense) To talk about more occupations To know the conjunctives: so, because","谈论未来的目标（使用将来时）；谈论更多职业；认识连词：so、because",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 1","EEC 5 第 1 课",1],["li","- Planning to have good times with friends.","- 计划和朋友共度美好时光。",1],["li","- Arranging stuff","- 安排东西",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 1","Classroom Readers 第 1 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","cub, greedy, trip, sell",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 2","课堂活动第 2 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","librarian, pilot, lawyer, farmer, writer",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","I/ You/ He/ She will be a/an (occupation)","I / You / He / She will be a/an（职业）（我／你／他／她将来会是……）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","snack (sandwich, cookie, grocery) friend (relative, classmate) soft drink (juice, tea, milk) great (nice, pleasant ) game (cards",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","What are your plans for this afternoon?","A",1],["d","Let me think...I have to buy some snacks.","B",1],["d","What for?","A",1],["d","I will go on a picnic with my friends.","B",1],["d","Sounds good! Would you mind if I go with you?.","A",1],["d","Of course not! That will be great! Can you bring some soft drinks or something like that?","B",1],["d","For sure. And some games as well.","A",1],["d","Great..We'll have a good time.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use the digital teaching to review S9 Classroom Activities P.5.","(1) 用数字教学复习 S9 课堂活动第 5 页。",0],["li","(2) Have all the students stand up and raise their hands to answer the questions then sit down.","(2) 让所有学生站起来，举手回答问题后坐下。",0],["d","Who studies more carefully than the other?","T",0],["d","Joey studies more carefully than Billy.","Ss",0],["li","(3) The student who is the last one to answer has to sing \"The Bear Went Over the Mountain.\"","(3) 最后一个回答的学生要唱 \"The Bear Went Over the Mountain\"。",0],["li","(4) Do pop quiz about 1.2:","(4) 针对 1.2 做随堂测验：",0],["p","Show them pictures on the touchscreen all-in-one and have them write down the answers.","在触控一体机上给他们看图，让他们写下答案。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (15 mins) Lesson 1 Pete and Tony","课堂读本（15 分钟）第 1 课 Pete and Tony（Pete 和 Tony）",0],["li","(1) Introduce the story to the students:","(1) 向学生介绍故事：",0],["p","Sarah and Joey are going to see two baby animals in the story, let's see what two animals they will see.","故事中 Sarah 和 Joey 要去看两只动物宝宝，我们来看看他们会看到哪两种动物。",0],["li","(2) Let the students see the story on the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 让学生在触控一体机上看故事。",0],["li","(3) Teach new words explaining in English then using the touchscreen all-in-one. For example: cub. A cub is a baby animal Have the students open the books and read through the text chorally and individually. Then assign the roles of Joey, Sarah, Ann and Billy. Teacher takes the role of narrator. Pay attention to their pronunciation, if someone has a mistake during the individual reading, Teacher has to read the word/ sentence again to the class and have them repeat right away.","(3) 先用英语解释再用触控一体机教新单词。例如：cub. A cub is a baby animal.　让学生打开书齐声和个别念课文，再分配 Joey、Sarah、Ann 和 Billy 的角色，老师担任旁白。注意他们的发音，个别念时有人念错，老师要再为全班念一次那个字／句子，让他们马上跟着念。",0],["li","(4) Reinforce the \"future tense\" in this story then move on to the Classroom Activities.","(4) 加强这个故事中的“将来时”，再进到课堂活动。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 2 When They Grow","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 2 课 When They Grow",0],["h2","Up","Up（他们长大以后）",0],["h3","2.1",null,0],["li","(1) Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one to recognize the occupations then make sentences using those vocabulary words. For example: My sister is a librarian.","(1) 让学生看触控一体机认识这些职业，再用这些单词造句。例如：My sister is a librarian.",0],["li","(2) Play the touchscreen all-in-one again, show them the five occupations. After that, ask the students what they saw on the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 再播一次触控一体机，给他们看五种职业，然后问学生在触控一体机上看到什么。",0],["li","(3) Let the students say and spell the words on the board.","(3) 让学生在白板上说出并拼出这些字。",0],["h3","2.2",null,0],["li","(1) Use the pictures to introduce what the characters will be when they grow up. Ask the students, \"What will Sarah be when she grows up?\" Lead the students to answer so that they will be familiar with the sentence pattern.","(1) 用图片介绍角色长大后会做什么。问学生：\"What will Sarah be when she grows up?\"，引导学生回答，让他们熟悉句型。",0],["h3","2.3",null,0],["li","(1) Show the class the first impression of each character and let the students guess if it is right or not. Then show the answer finally.","(1) 给全班看每个角色的第一印象，让学生猜对不对，最后再揭晓答案。",0],["li","(2) Pick some students to be \"Billy,\" \"Ann, \" \"Kiku, \" \"Sarah\" and \"Joey.\"","(2) 挑几位学生扮演 \"Billy\"、\"Ann\"、\"Kiku\"、\"Sarah\" 和 \"Joey\"。",0],["li","(3) After the whole class says the first sentence of each picture, the character must stand up and respond to the class. For example:","(3) 全班说出每张图的第一句后，那个角色要站起来回应全班。例如：",0],["d","Sarah likes airplanes! She will be a stewardess.","The Class",0],["d","No! I won't be a stewardess. I will be a pilot.","Sarah",0],["li","(4) Have the students open their books and fill in the blanks on page 12.","(4) 让学生打开书填第 12 页的空格。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 2 When They Grow","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 2 课 When They Grow",0],["h2","Up","Up（他们长大以后）",0],["h3","2.4",null,0],["li","(1) Use a simple sentence to introduce \"so\" and \"because.\"","(1) 用简单的句子介绍 \"so\" 和 \"because\"。",0],["d","I like to eat sweets so I will be very fat.","T",0],["p","I will be very fat because I like to eat sweets.","I will be very fat because I like to eat sweets.（我会变得很胖，因为我喜欢吃甜食。）",0],["li","(2) Show the pictures one by one on the touchscreen all-in-one and have the students try to use \"so\" and \"because\" to connect the two sentences.","(2) 在触控一体机上逐一展示图片，让学生试着用 \"so\" 和 \"because\" 连接两个句子。",0],["li","(3) Students get Activity Sheet 1","(3) 学生拿到活动单 1",0],["li","1. Have the students take out two pictures of occupations that they like, one is for","1. 让学生拿出两张他们喜欢的职业图片，一张",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","sticking on the sheet and the other is for their classmate.","贴在单子上，另一张给同学。",0],["li","2. Have the students fill in the blanks after putting the picture on the square and then take the sheet talking to a classmate:","2. 让学生把图贴在方格后填空，再拿着单子和同学对话：",0],["d","I will be a/a ... , because.... . And you? What will you be?","S",0],["li","3. After the dialogue, they have to give their occupation pictures to each other and stick the classmate's picture on the square then finish the blanks II.","3. 对话后，他们要交换职业图片，把同学的图贴在方格上，再完成空格 II。",0],["h3","2.5",null,0],["li","(1) Have the students repeat sentence Number 1 and 2 on the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 让学生跟着触控一体机念第 1 和第 2 句。",0],["li","(2) Divide the classroom into three sections: one is \"present tense\" the other is \"past tense\" another is \"future tense.\"","(2) 把教室分成三区：一区是“现在时”，一区是“过去时”，一区是“将来时”。",0],["li","(3) Play the song \"The Bear Went Over the Mountain\" and let the students walk around the classroom. Stop the song any time and the students have to stop walking.","(3) 播放歌曲 \"The Bear Went Over the Mountain\"，让学生在教室里走动。随时暂停歌曲，学生就要停下脚步。",0],["li","(4) Give them a sentence and have them say the other two tenses.","(4) 给他们一个句子，让他们说出另外两种时态。",0],["d","I am thirsty.","T",0],["p","Ss(past tense): I was thirsty. Ss(future tense): I will be thirsty.","Ss（过去时）：I was thirsty.　Ss（将来时）：I will be thirsty.",0],["li","2.6 Show the content on the touchscreen all-in-one and have one student come to the touchscreen all-in-one to click the right answer after the class say the first sentence.","2.6 在触控一体机上展示内容，全班说出第一句后，请一位学生到触控一体机前点击正确的答案。",0],["d","Don't be so sad!","The Class",0],["p","(S1 comes to the board): clicks \"Be happy.\"","（S1 到白板前）：点 \"Be happy.\"",0],["d","Everybody, say \"Don't be so sad! Be happy.\"","T",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Second Class","第二节课",0],["p","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","To start the class","开始上课",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles. Listening Exercise:","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["p","Nancy and Peter are preparing their baskets to go on a picnic. Nancy's basket has salty food and Peter's has sweet food. Listen and write the type of food they have in the right basket.","Nancy 和 Peter 正在准备野餐篮。Nancy 的篮子装咸的食物，Peter 的装甜的食物。听一听，把他们的食物类别写进正确的篮子。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","What kinds of food will you prepare for a picnic? Will you bring noodles, candy, chicken legs, pineapples, hot dogs and oranges? Please turn to page 6. Let's Check. Nancy and Peter are preparing their baskets to go on a picnic. Nancy's basket has salty food and Peter's has sweet food. Listen and write the type of food they have in the right basket.","野餐你会准备什么食物？你会带面、糖果、鸡腿、菠萝、热狗和橙子吗？请翻到第 6 页。Let's Check。Nancy 和 Peter 正在准备野餐篮。Nancy 的篮子装咸的食物，Peter 的装甜的食物。听一听，把他们的食物类别写进正确的篮子。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["li","- Review / point out the key words to the class in the listening exercise.","- 向全班复习／指出听力练习中的关键字。",0],["li","- Explain the exercise to the students and make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","- 向学生说明练习方式，确定说明够清楚，让学生能一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons that students have learned today by reading the books.","(1) 看课本复习学生今天学过的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","(1) Take this time to preview their homework. Pick some examples for the students to practice answering.","(1) 利用这段时间预习家庭作业，挑一些例子让学生练习回答。",0],["li","(2) Explain the mistakes they've made","(2) 解释他们犯的错误。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning/homework items on the board and have students to write down in their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind them today is telephone teaching day and quickly preview the questions.","(3) 提醒他们今天是电话教学日，快速预习问题。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 1","电话教学教材 1",0],["li","1. Make a sentence using \"quickly.\"","1. 用 \"quickly\" 造一个句子。",0],["li","2. Make a sentence using \"writing\" According to Classroom Activities Lesson 2,","2. 用 \"writing\" 造一个句子。根据课堂活动第 2 课，",0],["li","3. What does Ann like to do? Will she be a librarian?","3. What does Ann like to do? Will she be a librarian?（Ann 喜欢做什么？她将来会当图书馆员吗？）",0],["li","4. Which is the biggest animal of all?","4. Which is the biggest animal of all?（哪种动物最大？）",0],["li","5. What will you be when you grow up?","5. What will you be when you grow up?（你长大后要做什么？）",0]],"g":[[29,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1","1.2"]],[38,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Reader","Lesson 1","Leaning＆Playing","New Words","大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activiti","2.1","2.2","2.3","2.4","2.5","2.6"]],[104,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Pete and Tony","When They Grow"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 3 课","t":"Class 3","k":"class","p":[21,22,23],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","C.A.",null,1],["p","To ask about future plans To talk about excursions To use \"will be\" and \"going to be\" interchangeably","询问未来的计划；谈论出游；交替使用 \"will be\" 和 \"going to be\"",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 1","EEC 5 第 1 课",1],["li","- Planning to have good times with friends.","- 计划和朋友共度美好时光。",1],["li","- Arranging stuff","- 安排东西",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment, some slips for writing sentences","数字设备、一些写句子用的纸条",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 2","Classroom Readers 第 2 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Jeep, country, remember, alone, enjoy(ed)",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 3","课堂活动第 3 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","city, country, mountain(s), lake, weekend",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Are you going to......., Will you.... / Yes/No, I am/am not going to... , Yes/No, I will/ won't.....","Are you going to......., Will you.... / Yes/No, I am/am not going to... , Yes/No, I will/won't.....（你要……吗？是／不是，我要／不要……）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","snack (sandwich, cookie, grocery) friend (relative, classmate) soft drink (juice, tea, milk) great (nice, pleasant ) game (cards)",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","What are your plans for this afternoon?","A",1],["d","Let me think...I have to buy some snacks.","B",1],["d","What for?","A",1],["d","I will go on a picnic with my friends.","B",1],["d","Sounds good! Would you mind if I go with you?.","A",1],["d","Of course not! That will be great! Can you bring some soft drinks or something like that?","B",1],["d","For sure. And some games as well.","A",1],["d","Great..We'll have a good time.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use the digital teaching to review Classroom Activities 2.5.","(1) 用数字教学复习课堂活动 2.5。",0],["li","(2) Pop quiz:","(2) 随堂测验：",0],["p","Show the students two pictures and have them write down the other two tenses. For example:","给学生看两张图，让他们写出另外两种时态。例如：",0],["p","Picture 1: He is thirsty. Students have to write down: \"He was thirsty.\" and \"He will be thirsty.\"","图 1：He is thirsty.　学生要写出：\"He was thirsty.\" 和 \"He will be thirsty.\"",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (15 mins) Lesson 2 A Beautiful Country","课堂读本（15 分钟）第 2 课 A Beautiful Country（美丽的国家）",0],["li","(1) Introduce the story to the students:","(1) 向学生介绍故事：",0],["p","Did Sarah and Joey like the life in Kenya? Today, they went sight seeing around the country. Let's take a look at what they met there.","Sarah 和 Joey 喜欢在肯尼亚的生活吗？今天他们在这个国家四处观光。我们来看看他们在那里遇到了什么。",0],["li","(2) Let the students see the story on the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 让学生在触控一体机上看故事。",0],["li","(3) Teach new words explaining in English then using the touchscreen all-in-one. For example: jeep. Jeep is a car for outdoors touring or traveling. By the way, introduce the animals living in Africa while they are reading the story on the touchscreen all-in-one. For example: rhinoceros. Have the students open the books and read through the text chorally and individually.","(3) 先用英语解释再用触控一体机教新单词。例如：jeep. Jeep is a car for outdoors touring or traveling.　学生在触控一体机上读故事时，顺便介绍住在非洲的动物，例如 rhinoceros（犀牛）。让学生打开书齐声和个别念课文。",0],["li","(4) Ask them questions any time about the story.","(4) 随时问他们关于故事的问题。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 3 Weekend Plans","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 3 课 Weekend Plans（周末计划）",0],["h3","3.1",null,0],["li","(1) Have the students consult the touchscreen all-in-one to know where they can go during the weekends. let them read every word.","(1) 让学生看触控一体机了解周末可以去哪里，让他们念出每个字。",0],["li","(2) Talk about where they like /dislike to stay.","(2) 谈谈他们喜欢／不喜欢待在哪里。",0],["h3","3.2",null,0],["li","(1) Use the pictures to discuss where they will go during the weekends. For example: Dr. Taylor and Sarah will go to the country.","(1) 用图片讨论他们周末要去哪里。例如：Dr. Taylor and Sarah will go to the country.",0],["h3","3.3",null,0],["li","(1) Lead the students to read about the weekend plans.","(1) 带学生念周末计划的内容。",0],["li","(2) Hand out the slips on which are written the Questions and corresponding answers. For example:","(2) 发下写有问题和对应答案的纸条。例如：",0],["p","Slip 1: Are you going to be in the city this weekend? Slip 2: I am going to be in the city. Let the students ask \"Are you going to be in the city this weekend?\" to find who hold the \"I am going to be in the city\" slip. They can sit together if they're matched. Have the pairs stand up and practice Q&A.","纸条 1：Are you going to be in the city this weekend?　纸条 2：I am going to be in the city.　让学生问 \"Are you going to be in the city this weekend?\" 来找到拿着 \"I am going to be in the city\" 纸条的人，配对成功就坐在一起。让各组站起来练习问答。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 2 When They Grow","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 2 课 When They Grow",0],["h2","Up","Up（他们长大以后）",0],["h3","3.4",null,0],["p","Lead the students to read the passage. Move to the touchscreen all-in-one, help the students check the right answers. Hand out","带学生念短文。到触控一体机前帮学生核对正确答案。发下",0],["h3","Activity Sheet 2","活动单 2",0],["p","Let the students rewrite a story making use of all the phrases and pictures.","让学生运用所有短语和图片改写一个故事。",0],["h3","3.5",null,0],["li","(1) Let the students practice the first two examples.","(1) 让学生练习前两个例子。",0],["li","(2) Divide them into two teams. Call a student from each team to the front and let them read different sentences from No. 3 to No. 10 for their teammates.","(2) 把他们分成两队，每队叫一位学生到前面，为队友念第 3 到第 10 题中不同的句子。",0],["li","(3) The teammates have to listen to what sentence they hear from their partner and change it into the other future tense form.","(3) 队友要听队员念的是哪一句，并改成另一种将来时形式。",0],["li","(4) The team that transforms the sentences correctly and quickly can get a point.","(4) 又正确又快转换句子的队伍得一分。",0],["h3","3.6",null,0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Have the students complete the exercise by themselves. Pick questions that may pose problems (on the board) and have the students answer.","让学生自己完成练习。挑出可能有问题的题目（写在白板上）让学生回答。",0],["h3","3.7",null,0],["p","Have the students read after the touchscreen all-in-one then write down the vocabulary. Call several students to the board writing down the words.","让学生跟着触控一体机念，再写下单词。叫几位学生到白板写出这些字。",0],["h3","3.8",null,0],["p","Let the students read (exaggerate the syllables) each word, the teacher may use gestures and let the students follow him/her to help them understand.","让学生念每个字（夸张地念出音节），老师可以用手势让学生跟着做，帮助他们理解。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Third Class","第三堂课",0],["p","What Can I do? (15 mins)","What Can I Do?（15 mins）",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation. Note Please refer to the appendix for the MP3 script and answers of \"Let's Check\" section.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。注意：“Let's Check”部分的 MP3 对话稿和答案请参考附录。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons that students have learned today by reading the books.","(1) 看课本复习学生今天学过的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","(1) Take this time to preview their homework. Pick some examples for the students to practice answering.","(1) 利用这段时间预习家庭作业，挑一些例子让学生练习回答。",0],["li","(2) Explain the mistakes they've made","(2) 解释他们犯的错误。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning/homework items on the board and have students to write it down on their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[29,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activities","Lesson 2","2.5"]],[35,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Readers","Lesson 2","Learning","大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activiti","3.1","3.2","3.3","3.4","3.5","3.6","3.7","3.8"]],[79,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["A Beautiful Country","Weekend Plans","When They Grow"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 4 课","t":"Class 4","k":"class","p":[24,25,26,27],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A. To know ordinal numbers from 1st to 30th To talk about the order of the days and months","课堂读本／课堂活动：认识第 1 到第 30 的序数；谈论星期和月份的顺序",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 2","EEC 5 第 2 课",1],["li","- Looking for something lost","- 寻找遗失的东西",1],["li","- Helping a friend","- 帮助朋友",1],["li","- Pointing to some places","- 指出一些地方",1],["h3","Suggesting places to search","建议可以找的地方",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment, six paper balls with each having any unrepeated numbers from 15-30","数字设备、六颗纸球，每颗写有 15–30 之间不重复的数字",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 3","Classroom Readers 第 3 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","true, reply, protect, government, restaurant, order(ed), fifth",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 4","Classroom Activities 第 4 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","ordinal numbers","序数",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Wednesday is the fourth day of the week. October is the tenth month of the year.","Wednesday is the fourth day of the week.（星期三是一周的第四天。）October is the tenth month of the year.（十月是一年的第十个月。）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Vocabulary everybody (the team, the group) table(curtain, table) roller-skates (skateboard, ball, kite) shelves (carpet, chair)",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Hey Tina! Everybody is waiting for you outside.","A",1],["d","I know, but I'm busy now.","B",1],["d","What are you doing under the table?","A",1],["d","I am trying to find my roller skates.","B",1],["d","Take a look on the shelves.","A",1],["d","Oh! They're not there.","B",1],["d","Maybe they're in your bedroom. I'll look for you.","A",1],["d","Thank you. But don't be shocked, OK?","B",1],["d","Shocked? Why? Uh-oh! What a mess.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use the digital teaching to review S9 Classroom Readers Lesson 1-Lesson 2.","(1) 用数字教学复习 S9 课堂读本第 1 课到第 2 课。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students some questions about the story:","(2) 问学生一些关于故事的问题：",0],["p","Who was Tony? Why did the bad men take Tony's mother? What must the children never do alone?","Who was Tony?（Tony 是谁？）Why did the bad men take Tony's mother?（坏人为什么带走 Tony 的妈妈？）What must the children never do alone?（孩子们绝对不能单独做什么？）",0],["li","(3) Do a vocabulary quiz about Readers Lesson 1-Lesson 2.","(3) 做读本第 1 课到第 2 课的单词小测验。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (15 mins) Lesson 3 Trouble At The","课堂读本（15 分钟）第 3 课 Trouble At The",0],["h2","Restaurant","Restaurant（餐厅里的麻烦）",0],["li","(1) Introduce the story to the students:","(1) 向学生介绍故事：",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","After the sight seeing, they had lunch at a restaurant, whom did they meet at the restaurant? We can log onto the story on the website and find out!","观光后，他们在一家餐厅吃午餐。他们在餐厅遇到了谁？我们可以上网站看故事找出答案！",0],["li","(2) Let the students see the story on the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 让学生在触控一体机上看故事。",0],["li","(3) Teach new words explaining in English then using the touchscreen all-in-one. For example: true. True means real. Have the students open books and read through the text group by group. And tell them not to be as rude as the bad men in public.","(3) 先用英语解释再用触控一体机教新单词。例如：true. True means real.　让学生打开书分组念课文，并告诉他们在公共场所不要像坏人那样没礼貌。",0],["li","(4) Ask them some questions from page 44.","(4) 问他们第 44 页的一些问题。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 4","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 4 课",0],["p","The First Day Of The Week Is Sunday","The First Day Of The Week Is Sunday（一周的第一天是星期日）",0],["h3","4.1",null,0],["p","First, show them the cardinal numbers on the board from 1- 13 then 14-30, tell the students they are going to learn the order of these numbers. Basically, tell the students to add \"th\" to the end of cardinal numbers and make it into ordinal numbers. For \"fifth, eighth, ninth, twelfth, thirtieth.\", pay attention to their pronunciation of the \"th\" sound. Remind the students that the numbers after the twentieth must be hyphenated (twenty-first, twenty- second, etc.) Hand out the Activity Sheet 3 Help the students pick six numbers from 15-30 and write them in the circles, meanwhile, mark the ordinal numbers (first- sixth) beside the circles. Teacher opens the paper balls and show them the numbers one by one, let the students repeat, \"The first number is....., \" \"The second is.......\" And write down the ordinal and cardinal numbers on their Activity Sheets.","先在白板上给他们看 1–13、再看 14–30 的基数，告诉学生要学这些数字的顺序。基本上告诉学生在基数后加 \"th\" 就变成序数。\"fifth、eighth、ninth、twelfth、thirtieth\" 要注意 \"th\" 音的发音。提醒学生第二十之后的数字要加连字号（twenty-first、twenty-second 等）。发下活动单 3，帮学生从 15–30 中挑六个数字写在圆圈里，同时在圆圈旁标上序数（first–sixth）。老师逐一打开纸球给他们看数字，让学生跟着说 \"The first number is.....,\"、\"The second is.......\"，并在活动单上写下序数和基数。",0],["h3","4.2 A",null,0],["p","Lead the students to read the months of the year. And introduce the famous holidays of the months.","带学生念一年的月份，并介绍各月份的着名节日。",0],["h3","4.2 B",null,0],["p","Show the students the pictures and the sounds on the touchscreen all-in-one then have them write down the answer immediately after each description.","在触控一体机上给学生看图并播放声音，每段描述后让他们立刻写下答案。",0],["h3","4.3",null,0],["li","(1) Help the students fill in the blanks and then see the touchscreen all-in-one for correction.","(1) 帮学生填空，再看触控一体机订正。",0],["li","(2) Then pick some students to read the completed sentences.","(2) 然后挑几位学生念出完成的句子。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 4 The First Day Of","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 4 课 The First Day Of",0],["h2","The Week Is Sunday","The Week Is Sunday（一周的第一天是星期日）",0],["h3","4.4",null,0],["p","Divide the students up. Turn to page 28, have each group figure one answer out. Set a time limit for thirty seconds. Let them write the answers on the board. Look at the touchscreen all-in-one for the answers.","把学生分组，翻到第 28 页，让每组想出一个答案，限时三十秒。让他们把答案写在白板上，再看触控一体机核对答案。",0],["h3","4.5",null,0],["p","Have the students cover page 31. Ask them Questions 1-8 and have them answer together.","让学生盖住第 31 页，问他们第 1–8 题，让他们一起回答。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Have the volunteers come to the board and write down the right answers. Take a look at the touchscreen all-in-one and find out the results.","让志愿者到白板写出正确答案，再看触控一体机找出结果。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monolog of \"Let's See And Say\" section in lesson two. The teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See And Say:","老师让学生听第 2 课“Let's See And Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See And Say 独白：",0],["p","Tina can't find her roller skates. She is looking everywhere for them. Do you know where her roller skates are? Let's help her find them.","Tina 找不到她的轮滑鞋，她到处找。你知道她的轮滑鞋在哪里吗？我们来帮她找。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have just listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, Teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the ordinal numbers that students have learned today by reading the books.","(1) 看课本复习学生今天学过的序数。",0],["li","(2) Review the ordinal numbers that students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学过的序数。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","(1) Take this time to preview their homework. Pick some examples for the students to practice answering.","(1) 利用这段时间预习家庭作业，挑一些例子让学生练习回答。",0],["li","(2) Explain the mistakes they've made","(2) 解释他们犯的错误。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning/homework items on the board and have students to write down on the progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(3) Check the progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today.","(3) 逐一检查进度报告本，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依学生今天的表现给予反馈的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind them today is telephone teaching day and quickly preview the questions.","(3) 提醒他们今天是电话教学日，快速预习问题。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 2","电话教学教材 2",0],["li","1. Will you be a doctor?","1. Will you be a doctor?（你将来会当医生吗？）",0],["li","2. Are you going to be in the mountains this weekend?","2. Are you going to be in the mountains this weekend?（你这个周末要去山上吗？）",0],["li","3. What can you do in the mountains?","3. What can you do in the mountains?（你在山上可以做什么？）",0],["li","4. What is the third day of the week?","4. What is the third day of the week?（一周的第三天是星期几？）",0],["li","5. What is the seventh month of the year?","5. What is the seventh month of the year?（一年的第七个月是几月？）",0]],"g":[[36,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶"]],[36,["Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Readers","Lesson 3","New words","leaning"]],[43,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book9","Classroom Activities","Lesson 4","4.1-4.5"]],[54,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activities","Lesson 4","4.1"]],[79,["● Follow the same","steps above"]]],"tp":["Trouble At The","The First Day Of"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 5 课","t":"Class 5","k":"class","p":[28,29,30,31],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A. To talk about countries To express dates To practice/ review the prepositions that precede time and date phrases","课堂读本／课堂活动：谈论国家；表达日期；练习／复习时间和日期短语前的介词",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 2","EEC 5 第 2 课",1],["li","- Looking for something lost","- 寻找遗失的东西",1],["li","- Helping a friend","- 帮助朋友",1],["li","- Pointing to some places Suggesting places to search","- 指出一些地方　建议可以找的地方",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment, Enlarge two copies of C.A. page 36.","数字设备，课堂活动第 36 页放大复印两份。",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 4","Classroom Readers 第 4 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","forest, rare, follow",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 5","课堂活动第 5 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","America, China, Germany, Japan, England",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","When were you in America?","When were you in America?（你什么时候在美国？）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","everybody (the team, the group) table (curtain, table) roller-skates (skateboard, ball, kite) shelves (carpet, chair)",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Hey Tina! Everybody is waiting for you outside.","A",1],["d","I know, but I'm busy now.","B",1],["d","What are you doing under the table?","A",1],["d","I am trying to find my roller skates.","B",1],["d","Take a look on the shelves.","A",1],["d","Oh! They're not there.","B",1],["d","Maybe they're in your bedroom. I'll look for you.","A",1],["d","Thank you. But don't be shocked, OK?","B",1],["d","Shocked? Why? Uh-oh! What a mess.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Quickly review the ordinal numbers via digital teaching.","(1) 用数字教学快速复习序数。",0],["li","(2) Have all the students stand up.","(2) 让所有学生站起来。",0],["li","(3) Point to the students randomly, and ask them to take turns saying the ordinal numbers.","(3) 随机指学生，让他们轮流说出序数。",0],["li","(4) Pop quiz:","(4) 随堂测验：",0],["li","1. Have the students answer the complete sentences in the notebooks. What is the first day of the week? What is the last day of the week? Is February the third month in the year? Write down the ordinal numbers of 1-5.","1. 让学生在笔记本上用完整的句子回答：What is the first day of the week? What is the last day of the week? Is February the third month in the year? 写出 1–5 的序数。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (15 mins) Lesson 4 In The Forest","课堂读本（15 分钟）第 4 课 In The Forest（在森林里）",0],["li","(1) Introduce the story to the students:","(1) 向学生介绍故事：",0],["p","On their way home, Joey, Sarah, Ann and Billy had an exciting adventure in a forest with Kiku, what did they find? Let's go to the touchscreen all-in-one, seeing is believing!","回家路上，Joey、Sarah、Ann 和 Billy 和 Kiku 在森林里有一段刺激的冒险。他们发现了什么？我们到触控一体机前看看，眼见为凭！",0],["li","(2) Let the students see the story on the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 让学生在触控一体机上看故事。",0],["li","(3) Teach new words explaining in English, then using the touchscreen all-in-one. For example: forest. Forest is a place that has many trees and animals. Have the students open books and read through the text chorally and individually. Furthermore, tell the students we're used to saying dates using ordinal numbers and ask them what do they think will happen with the kids in the forest.","(3) 先用英语解释再用触控一体机教新单词。例如：forest. Forest is a place that has many trees and animals.　让学生打开书齐声和个别念课文。此外，告诉学生我们习惯用序数说日期，并问他们认为孩子们在森林里会发生什么事。",0],["li","(4) Ask them about the story.(See page 45. )","(4) 问他们关于故事的问题。（见第 45 页）",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 5 When Were You There?","课堂活动第 5 课 When Were You There?（你什么时候在那里？）",0],["h3","(30mins)","（30 分钟）",0],["h3","5.1",null,0],["li","(1) Have the students see the touchscreen all-in-one to know the people from different countries.","(1) 让学生看触控一体机认识来自不同国家的人。",0],["li","(2) Talk about the most famous things in those countries. For example:","(2) 谈谈这些国家最有名的东西。例如：",0],["d","The U.S.A is a multiracial country.","America",0],["d","China is a country that has been there for more than 5,000- years.","China",0],["d","Germany is famous for its beer.","Germany",0],["d","Kimono is a traditional costume for women in Japan.","Japan",0],["d","England is a country famous for its royalty.","England",0],["li","(3) Ask the students how many countries they have been to and let them share the experience with each other.","(3) 问学生去过几个国家，让他们互相分享经验。",0],["h3","5.2",null,0],["li","(1) Teach the students to say the dates using ordinal numbers and practice saying them several times.","(1) 教学生用序数说日期，并练习说几次。",0],["li","(2) Divide the class into five groups; each group stands for a nationality.","(2) 把全班分成五组，每组代表一个国籍。",0],["li","(3) Show them the pictures on the monitor; the groups have to stand up answering questions according to their nationalities. T (Shows the picture of England): When were you there? Group of England: I was there on December 16th, 1972.","(3) 在屏幕上给他们看图片，各组要依自己的国籍站起来回答问题。T（展示英国的图）：When were you there?　英国组：I was there on December 16th, 1972.",0],["h3","5.3",null,0],["li","(1) Pair the students up, have them practice the questions and answers","(1) 让学生两两一组练习问答。",0],["li","(2) Divide the class into two teams and number them. Show a picture on the touchscreen all-in-one, have two students from each team come to the front.","(2) 把全班分成两队并编号。在触控一体机上展示一张图，每队派两位学生到前面。",0],["li","(3) After doing \"Paper, Scissors, Stone,\" one of the winners has to ask according to the picture on the monitor, \"When were you there?\" Contrarily, the losers have to take turns answering, \"I was there in ,\" and \" I arrived there on .\"","(3) 猜拳后，其中一位赢家要依屏幕上的图问 \"When were you there?\"，输的人则轮流回答 \"I was there in ....\" 和 \"I arrived there on ....\"",0],["li","(4) Losers will win the points for their team with answering correctly.","(4) 输的人答对就能为队伍得分。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 5 When Were You","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 5 课 When Were You",0],["h2","There?","There?（你什么时候在那里？）",0],["h3","5.4",null,0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","(1) Have the students take out their notebooks and translate the Arabic Numbers in to English spelling.","(1) 让学生拿出笔记本，把阿拉伯数字写成英文拼法。",0],["li","(2) Game for practicing:","(2) 练习游戏：",0],["li","1. Then have the teams compete with each other saying the dates on the touchscreen all-in-one and then clicking the correct answers.","1. 让两队比赛说出触控一体机上的日期，再点击正确答案。",0],["li","2. Have the students in the first team take turns following the step 1 then the other team.","2. 让第一队的学生轮流照步骤 1 做，再换另一队。",0],["li","3. The Teacher counts the time and writes down how long it has taken to complete all the questions.","3. 老师计时，记下完成所有题目花了多久。",0],["li","4. See which team completes them more quickly and correctly.","4. 看哪一队完成得又快又正确。",0],["h3","5.5",null,0],["li","(1) Enlarge two copies of this page and stick them on the board.","(1) 把这一页放大复印两份贴在白板上。",0],["li","(2) Have the students from two teams taking turns filling in the blanks.","(2) 让两队学生轮流填空。",0],["li","(3) Correct the answers using the touchscreen all-in-one and have the class repeat.","(3) 用触控一体机订正答案，让全班跟着念。",0],["h3","5.6",null,0],["li","(1) Write down the IPA phonetic symbols of the vocabulary on the board and have the students say what words they are by spelling the IPA symbols.","(1) 把单词的国际音标写在白板上，让学生依国际音标拼出是什么字。",0],["li","(2) Move to the touchscreen all-in-one, check the vocabulary by pointing out the words and listening to the sounds.","(2) 到触控一体机前指出单词并听声音来核对。",0],["li","(3) Open the book, let the students finish the exercise.","(3) 打开书，让学生完成练习。",0],["h3","5.7",null,0],["p","The teacher reads the vocabulary and let the students write the number of the stressed syllable. Pick some students to read the words.","老师念单词，让学生写出重音所在的音节号码。挑几位学生念这些字。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Second Class","第二节课",0],["p","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","To start the class","开始上课",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Lisa is looking for her toys. She wants to play with her friends. Listen and connect","Lisa 在找她的玩具，她想和朋友一起玩。听一听，把玩具和地点连起来，",0],["h3","the toys to the places so she can find each one.","让她能找到每一样。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","Where do you usually keep your things? Can you always find them easily? Please turn to page 10. Let's Check. Lisa is looking for her toys. She wants to play with her friends. Listen and connect the toys to the places so she can find each one. head.","你通常把东西放在哪里？总是能轻松找到吗？请翻到第 10 页。Let's Check。Lisa 在找她的玩具，她想和朋友一起玩。听一听，把玩具和地点连起来，让她能找到每一样。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["li","- Review / point out the key words to the class in the listening exercise.","- 向全班复习／指出听力练习中的关键字。",0],["li","- Explain the exercise to the students and make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","- 向学生说明练习方式，确定说明够清楚，让学生能一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the dates and prepositions by reading Classroom Activities page 36.","(1) 念课堂活动第 36 页，复习日期和介词。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","(1) Take this time to preview their homework. Pick some examples for the students to practice.","(1) 利用这段时间预习家庭作业，挑一些例子让学生练习。",0],["li","(2) Explain the mistakes they've made","(2) 解释他们犯的错误。",0],["li","(3) Extra exercise: Have the students choose a country and find out its famous thing, report to the class next time.","(3) 额外练习：让学生选一个国家，找出它有名的东西，下次向全班报告。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning/homework items on the board and have students to write down on their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check the progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[30,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activities","Lesson 5"]],[37,["Classroom reader9","Lesson 4","New words","Translation"]],[43,["Classroom Activities 9A","Lesson 5","5.1-5.7"]],[43,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V"]],[64,["Book 9","Classroom Activities","Lesson 5","5.1"]],[83,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["In The Forest","When Were You There?","When Were You"],"bd":"","m":80},{"z":"第 6 课","t":"Class 6","k":"class","p":[32,33],"b":[["h3","Review Day 1","复习日 1",1],["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A. Review Quiz 1, Listening Lab 1","课堂读本／课堂活动　复习　第 1 次小测验、第 1 次听力测验",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 2","EEC 5 第 2 课",1],["li","- Looking for something lost","- 寻找遗失的东西",1],["li","- Helping a friend","- 帮助朋友",1],["li","- Pointing to some places Suggesting places to search","- 指出一些地方　建议可以找的地方",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment, a world map","数字设备、一张世界地图",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 1-4","课堂读本第 1–4 课",1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 1-5","课堂活动第 1–5 课",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","everybody (the team, the group) table (curtain, table) roller-skates (skateboard, ball, kite) shelves (carpet, chair)",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Hey Tina! Everybody is waiting for you outside.","A",1],["d","I know, but I'm busy now.","B",1],["d","What are you doing under the table?","A",1],["d","I am trying to find my roller skates.","B",1],["d","Take a look on the shelves.","A",1],["d","Oh! They're not there.","B",1],["d","Maybe they're in your bedroom. I'll look for you.","A",1],["d","Thank you. But don't be shocked, OK?","B",1],["d","Shocked? Why? Uh-oh! What a mess.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Review (20 mins)","复习 Review（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use the digital teaching to review the lessons that the students have learned from Class 1 to Class 5.","(1) 用数字教学复习学生第 1 堂到第 5 堂课学过的课程。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to spell the vocabulary and answer some questions to review the sentence patterns.","(2) 请学生拼单词并回答一些问题来复习句型。",0],["li","(3) Lead the students to read C.A. page 11 and have them respond to your questions. For example: T: Will Sarah be a pilot?","(3) 带学生念课堂活动第 11 页，让他们回答你的问题。例如：T：Will Sarah be a pilot?",0],["li","(4) Review the ordinal numbers.","(4) 复习序数。",0],["h2","Quiz (20 mins)","小测验（20 分钟）",0],["p","Hand out the quiz; explain to the students if they do not understand the instructions.","发下小测验卷，如果学生看不懂说明就向他们解释。",0],["h2","Listening Lab (10 mins)","听力测验（10 分钟）",0],["p","Play the listening tape to the students; have them answer the questions according to the tape. For part 1, please pause 10 seconds between each question.","为学生播放听力录音带，让他们依录音回答问题。第 1 部分每题之间请暂停 10 秒。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Talking About The Countries (30 mins)","谈论各国（30 分钟）",0],["li","(1) Show them a world map and introduce some countries to the students.","(1) 给他们看世界地图，向学生介绍一些国家。",0],["li","(2) Lead the students to talk about what is a country famous for.","(2) 带学生谈谈某个国家以什么闻名。",0],["li","(3) Let them report to the class.","(3) 让他们向全班报告。",0],["li","(4) Have some students who have been to other countries talk about the famous things there.","(4) 请一些去过其他国家的学生谈谈那里有名的东西。",0],["li","(5) Give the students some supplementary information.","(5) 给学生一些补充信息。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report in their self-evaluation about what they can do in the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Have the students write the review items on the board.","(1) 让学生把复习项目写在白板上。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their discussion and report today.","(2) 逐一检查进度报告本，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依学生今天的讨论和报告给予反馈的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students there is going to be a test next time.","(3) 提醒学生下次要考试。",0],["li","(4) Remind them today is telephone teaching day and quickly preview the questions.","(4) 提醒他们今天是电话教学日，快速预习问题。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 3","电话教学教材 3",0],["li","1. Who is older, you or your mother?","1. Who is older, you or your mother?（你和你妈妈谁年纪比较大？）",0],["li","2. Will you go to any foreign country this summer/ winter vacation?","2. Will you go to any foreign country this summer/winter vacation?（你这个暑假／寒假会出国吗？）",0],["li","3. Is your family going to be at the beach this weekend?","3. Is your family going to be at the beach this weekend?（你家人这个周末要去海边吗？）",0],["li","4. What is the fourth day of the week?","4. What is the fourth day of the week?（一周的第四天是星期几？）",0],["li","5. What is the ninth month of the year?","5. What is the ninth month of the year?（一年的第九个月是几月？）",0]],"g":[[25,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 9","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1- Lesson 4","None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":105},{"z":"第 7 课","t":"Class 7","k":"class","p":[34],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A. Review Test 1","课堂读本／课堂活动　复习　第 1 次考试",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment Classroom Readers Lesson 1-4 Classroom Activities Lesson 1-5","数字设备　课堂读本第 1–4 课　课堂活动第 1–5 课",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Review (30 mins)","复习 Review（30 mins）",0],["p","Write the mistakes students made in Quiz 1 on the board and pick some students to correct the mistakes. Use the digital teaching to reinforce the vocabulary or the sentence patterns. Have the students view the text on the touchscreen all-in-one to understand the use of the vocabulary and the grammar structures.","把学生在第 1 次小测验犯的错误写在白板上，挑几位学生改正。用数字教学加强单词或句型，让学生在触控一体机上看课文，理解单词的用法和语法结构。",0],["h2","Test (40 min)","考试（40 分钟）",0],["p","Hand out the test; explain to the students if necessary, because it differs from the previous Quiz, please pay attention to their writing, in case they get confused.","发下考卷，必要时向学生解释。因为和之前的小测验不同，请注意他们的作答，以免他们搞混。",0],["h2","Oral Test (30 mins)","口试（30 分钟）",0],["p","The teacher should conduct the following oral test outside the classroom, individually, with the students. Each question is worth four points, one mark for question comprehension, grammar, pronunciation and fluency. Give students the opportunity to correct their own mistakes first. Assign a classroom leader to monitor students' behavior while you are out of the classroom or position yourself so you can observe the class through a window. The oral test is worth 20% of the first test total.","老师应在教室外与学生个别进行下面的口试。每题 4 分，理解问题、语法、发音和流畅度各 1 分。先给学生自己改正错误的机会。你离开教室时指派一位班长维持秩序，或站在能从窗户看到教室的位置。口试占第一次考试总分的 20%。",0],["h2","Oral Test questions:","口试题目：",0],["li","1. Do you do your homework quickly or slowly?","1. Do you do your homework quickly or slowly?（你写作业快还是慢？）",0],["li","2. What do you want to be when you grow up?","2. What do you want to be when you grow up?（你长大后想做什么？）",0],["li","3. Did you go to the mountains last weekend?","3. Did you go to the mountains last weekend?（你上周末有去山上吗？）",0],["li","4. What's the first month of the year?","4. What's the first month of the year?（一年的第一个月是几月？）",0],["li","5. What country do you like? Why?","5. What country do you like? Why?（你喜欢哪个国家？为什么？）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Have the students write the review items on the board.","(1) 让学生把复习项目写在白板上。",0],["li","(2) Check the progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。",0]],"g":[[5,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1- Lesson 4","&","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1- Lesson 5"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":110},{"z":"第 8 课","t":"Class 8","k":"class","p":[35,36],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A. Correct Test 1 Review","课堂读本／课堂活动　订正第 1 次考试　复习",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 1-4","课堂读本第 1–4 课",1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 1-5","课堂活动第 1–5 课",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Test Correction (20 mins)","考卷订正（20 分钟）",0],["li","(1) Hand out the test paper, have the students correct the mistakes themselves.","(1) 发还考卷，让学生自己订正错误。",0],["li","(2) Play the touchscreen all-in-one to show the students the vocabulary or the sentences that they are not very familiar with and let them repeat.","(2) 用触控一体机给学生看他们不太熟悉的单词或句子，让他们跟着念。",0],["li","(3) Write the questions that the students didn't do well in on the board. Have the class answer the questionss together.","(3) 把学生做得不好的题目写在白板上，让全班一起回答。",0],["h2","Activity Time (80 mins)","活动时间（80 分钟）",0],["p","Tense Practicing (Past/ Simple Present/ Present Progressive/ Future Tense):","时态练习（过去时／简单现在时／现在进行时／将来时）：",0],["li","(1) Review the tenses using the Classroom Activities p.8.","(1) 用课堂活动第 8 页复习时态。",0],["li","(2) Divide the class into groups of four, each student stands for a number from 1-4.","(2) 把全班分成四人一组，每位学生代表 1–4 中的一个号码。",0],["li","(3) The Teacher says a sentence and then calls a number, the students have to go to the board and write the sentence in the corresponding column.","(3) 老师说一个句子再叫一个号码，学生要到白板把句子写在对应的栏。",0],["li","(4) When the first one finishes, the rest of the teammates have to take turns completing the other three tenses of the sentence.","(4) 第一个人写完后，其余队友要轮流完成这个句子的另外三种时态。",0],["li","(5) The team finishes writing the four sentences is the winner.","(5) 最先写完四个句子的队伍获胜。",0],["h3","Spelling Bee","拼写比赛",0],["li","(1) Tell the students the vocabulary that you are going to teach. Give them 5 minutes to review.","(1) 告诉学生你要考的单词，给他们 5 分钟复习。",0],["li","(2) Have the students standing in the front to take turns spelling the words the teacher gives to them.","(2) 让学生站在前面，轮流拼出老师给的字。",0],["li","(3) Each of them has three incorrect tries to spell the words, that means the students who are not able to spell any other words should go back to the seats after three incorrect tries with one word or several words.","(3) 每人有三次拼错的机会，也就是说，在一个或几个字上拼错三次的学生要回座位。",0],["li","(4) The student who stands in the front without any competitors is the winner.","(4) 最后站在前面、没有对手的学生获胜。",0],["li","(5) The winner can make a wish to the Teacher.","(5) 获胜者可以向老师许一个愿望。",0],["h3","Critical Friends","挑错好朋友",0],["li","(1) Have the students choose any five words and make sentences with them in the notebooks. After writing the sentences, let all the students stand up and say their sentence to a partner each time and have the partner sign beside the sentence. The students have to get five different signatures during this activity.","(1) 让学生任选五个字，在笔记本上造句。写完后让所有学生站起来，每次对一位伙伴说出自己的句子，并请伙伴在句子旁签名。活动中学生要拿到五个不同的签名。",0],["li","(2) The partner has the right to correct the sentence they hear.","(2) 伙伴有权改正他们听到的句子。",0],["li","(3) Have the students hand in the notebooks at the end of this activity.","(3) 活动结束时让学生交出笔记本。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h3","Recomposing the Song","改编歌曲",0],["li","(1) Divide the class into groups of three.","(1) 把全班分成三人一组。",0],["li","(2) Have the students recompose the song \"The Bear Went Over the Mountain.\"","(2) 让学生改编歌曲 \"The Bear Went Over the Mountain\"。",0],["li","(3) They can replace the lines or make a new tune for this song.","(3) 他们可以换掉歌词，或为这首歌编新的曲调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Have the students write the review items on the board. Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today.","(1) 让学生把复习项目写在白板上。逐一检查进度报告本，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依学生今天的表现给予反馈的好时机。",0],["li","(2) Remind them today is telephone teaching day and quickly preview the questions.","(2) 提醒他们今天是电话教学日，快速预习问题。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 4","电话教学教材 4",0],["li","1. What is the third day of the week?","1. What is the third day of the week?（一周的第三天是星期几？）",0],["li","2. What is the seventh month of the year?","2. What is the seventh month of the year?（一年的第七个月是几月？）",0],["li","3. Are you going to be a policeman?","3. Are you going to be a policeman?（你将来要当警察吗？）",0],["li","4. Will you be at the lake this weekend?","4. Will you be at the lake this weekend?（你这个周末会在湖边吗？）",0],["li","5. What is today's date?","5. What is today's date?（今天几月几号？）",0]],"g":[[7,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Readers","Classroom Activities","None"]],[34,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":110},{"z":"第 9 课","t":"Class 9","k":"class","p":[37,38,39],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","C.A.",null,1],["p","To talk about Chinese and Western holidays To discuss the dates of holidays To express favorites","谈论中西方节日；讨论节日的日期；表达最喜欢的事物",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 3","EEC 5 第 3 课",1],["li","- Answering the phone","- 接电话",1],["li","- Calling -- Being polite","- 打电话——有礼貌",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 6","课堂活动第 6 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","holidays, Christmas, Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving, favorite",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","What's your favorite holiday? When is Christmas?","What's your favorite holiday?（你最喜欢哪个节日？）When is Christmas?（圣诞节是什么时候？）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","pardon (excuse me, sorry) calling (speaking, talking) shower (bath, nap) this ( I am)",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Hello, I'd like to talk to Mary.","A",1],["d","Who's calling?","B",1],["d","This is Simon..","A",1],["d","Hold on a second, please.","B",1],["p","Mary! The phone is for you. C Who is it?","Mary! The phone is for you.（Mary！你的电话。）C：Who is it?（是谁？）",1],["d","It's Si mon.","B",1],["d","I am taking a shower.","C",1],["p","I can't come to the phone right now.","I can't come to the phone right now.（我现在没办法接电话。）",1],["d","I'm sorry, Simon. Mary is a little bit busy.","B",1],["p","Would you like to leave a message?","Would you like to leave a message?（你要留言吗？）",1],["d","OK. Could youplease ask her to call me back?.","A",1],["d","I'll do. Thank you. Bye","B",1],["d","Goodbye.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Ask the students some questions while doing roll call.","(1) 点名时问学生一些问题。",0],["d","When is your birthday?","Example Question",0],["p","Do you like to go to the mountains on the weekends? Be aware of the order of \"date,\" \"month\" and \"year.\"","Do you like to go to the mountains on the weekends?　注意“日”、“月”、“年”的顺序。",0],["li","(2) Pop quiz:","(2) 随堂测验：",0],["li","1. When is your birthday?","1. When is your birthday?（你的生日是什么时候？）",0],["li","2. What do you like to do on your birthday? Let the students write down the answers in the notebooks.","2. What do you like to do on your birthday?（生日时你喜欢做什么？）让学生把答案写在笔记本上。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 6 American and","课堂活动（35 分钟）第 6 课 American and",0],["h2","Chinese Holidays","Chinese Holidays（美国和中国的节日）",0],["h3","6.1",null,0],["p","Talk about the dates and the features of the holidays after introducing the vocabulary.","介绍单词后，谈谈各节日的日期和特色。",0],["h3","6.2",null,0],["p","Lead the students to read once, then do the Activity Sheet 4","带学生念一遍，再做活动单 4。",0],["h3","6.3",null,0],["p","Talk about the dates and the features of Chinese Holidays. For example:","谈谈中国节日的日期和特色。例如：",0],["p","When is Dragon Boat Festival? What do we do on Dragon Boat Festival? Do you like the Dragon Boat Festival? Why or Why not?","When is Dragon Boat Festival?（端午节是什么时候？）What do we do on Dragon Boat Festival?（端午节我们做什么？）Do you like the Dragon Boat Festival? Why or why not?（你喜欢端午节吗？为什么？）",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 6 American and","课堂活动（35 分钟）第 6 课 American and",0],["h2","Chinese Holidays","Chinese Holidays（美国和中国的节日）",0],["h3","6.4",null,0],["p","Lead the students to read in groups or individually. Ask them questions about the essay after reading. Talk about when are \"Teacher's Day,\" \"Mother's Day,\" \"Father's Day\" and \"Children and Women's Day.\"","带学生分组或个别念，念完后问他们关于短文的问题。谈谈“教师节”、“母亲节”、“父亲节”和“儿童节及妇女节”是什么时候。",0],["h3","6.5",null,0],["p","Divide the class into two teams. Have the two teams compete. The Teacher asks questions and the students have to raise their hands to answer for winning points.","把全班分成两队比赛。老师问问题，学生要举手回答来得分。",0],["h3","6.6",null,0],["p","Lead the students to talk about the holidays they have learned, including Valentine's Day, Chinese New Year, Christmas, the Mid Autumn Festival, the Dragon Boat Festival and New Year's Day. The contents are suggested to be the features of the holidays and if they are Chinese or Western holidays.","带学生谈谈学过的节日，包括情人节、农历新年、圣诞节、中秋节、端午节和元旦。建议内容为节日的特色，以及是中国还是西方的节日。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["h3","Context Introduction","情境介绍",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monologue of \"Let's See and Say\" section in lesson three. The teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below.","老师让学生听第七课“Let's See and Say”的独白来引入本课。老师可以念出或用 MP3 播放下面的独白给全班听。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Monolog Of Let's See & Say:","Let's See & Say 独白：",0],["p","Simon is calling Mary on the phone. But she is too busy to come to the phone. Let's listen to what her mother says to Simon.","Simon 打电话给 Mary，但她太忙没办法接电话。我们来听听她妈妈对 Simon 说什么。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teachers also need to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced with the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the dates and the features of the holidays.","(1) 复习节日的日期和特色。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","(1) Take this time to preview their homework. Pick some examples for the students to practice.","(1) 利用这段时间预习家庭作业，挑一些例子让学生练习。",0],["li","(2) Explain the mistakes they've made","(2) 解释他们犯的错误。",0],["li","(3) Extra exercise: Have the students choose a country and find out its famous things, report to the class next time.","(3) 额外练习：让学生选一个国家，找出它有名的东西，下次向全班报告。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning/homework items on the board and have students to write down on their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check the progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today. 39","(2) 逐一检查进度报告本，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依学生今天的表现给予反馈的好时机。39",0]],"g":[[31,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activiti","Lesson 6","大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activiti","Lesson 6","6.1","6.2","6.3","6.4","6.5","6.6"]],[73,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["American and"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 10 课","t":"Class 10","k":"class","p":[40,41,42,43],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","C.A.",null,1],["p","To review future tense and the dates","复习将来时和日期",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 3","EEC 5 第 3 课",1],["li","- Answering the phone","- 接电话",1],["li","- Calling","- 打电话",1],["h3","Being polite","有礼貌",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 7","课堂活动第 7 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","None","无",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","None","无",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","pardon (excuse me, sorry) calling (speaking, talking) shower (bath, nap) this ( I am)",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Hello, I'd like to talk to Mary.","A",1],["d","Who's calling?","B",1],["d","This is Simon..","A",1],["d","Hold on a second, please.","B",1],["p","Mary! The phone is for you. C Who is it?","Mary! The phone is for you.（Mary！你的电话。）C：Who is it?（是谁？）",1],["d","It's Si mon.","B",1],["d","I am taking a shower.","C",1],["p","I can't come to the phone right now.","I can't come to the phone right now.（我现在没办法接电话。）",1],["d","I'm sorry, Simon. Mary is a little bit busy.","B",1],["p","Would you like to leave a message?","Would you like to leave a message?（你要留言吗？）",1],["d","OK. Could youplease ask her to call","A",1],["d","I'll do. Thank you. Bye","B",1],["d","Goodbye.","A",1],["p","me back?.","me back?（……回电给我吗？）",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Write the twelve months in random order on the board. Call two students to the board and give each a magnet. Ask, \"When is Father's Day?\" or some other holiday. The first student to place the magnet on the correct month and say the date is the winner.","(1) 把十二个月份随意写在白板上，叫两位学生到白板前，每人发一个磁铁。问 \"When is Father's Day?\" 或其他节日，最先把磁铁放在正确月份并说出日期的学生获胜。",0],["li","(2) Pop quiz:","(2) 随堂测验：",0],["p","Have the students write down the holidays and their dates in English they've just reviewed.","让学生用英文写下刚复习的节日和日期。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 7 What Will I Be?","课堂活动（35 分钟）第 7 课 What Will I Be?（我将来会是什么？）",0],["h3","7.1",null,0],["li","(1) Use the picture 7.1 in the touchscreen all-in-one, ask the students to describe the situation.","(1) 用触控一体机上的图 7.1，请学生描述情况。",0],["li","(2) And then, give them \"will\" and \"won't\" to be used in sentences.","(2) 然后给他们 \"will\" 和 \"won't\" 用在句子里。",0],["li","(3) Divide them into six groups, each group talks about a picture.","(3) 把他们分成六组，每组谈论一张图。",0],["h3","7.2",null,0],["p","Select six students to read the descriptions and let the rest of the class guess \"What will they be.\"","选六位学生念出描述，让其他同学猜 \"What will they be.\"",0],["h3","7.3",null,0],["li","(1) Get into the digital teaching, let the students operate it by themselves.","(1) 进入数字教学，让学生自己操作。",0],["li","(2) Lead the class to read with each correct sentence.","(2) 每个正确的句子都带全班念。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 7 What Will I Be?","课堂活动（35 分钟）第 7 课 What Will I Be?（我将来会是什么？）",0],["h3","7.4",null,0],["li","(1) Divide the class into 2 teams.","(1) 把全班分成 2 队。",0],["li","(2) Hand out eight cards for each team and let one team write the names of the holidays and the other writes the dates.","(2) 每队发八张卡，让一队写节日名称，另一队写日期。",0],["li","(3) The Teacher says a holiday (the Mid Autumn Festival); the student who holds the holiday and the student who holds its corresponding date have to come to the board together.","(3) 老师说一个节日（中秋节），拿着那个节日和对应日期的两位学生要一起到白板前。",0],["li","(4) Let the class answer the Teacher's question: When is the Mid Autumn Festival?","(4) 让全班回答老师的问题：When is the Mid Autumn Festival?",0],["h3","7.5",null,0],["li","(1) Have the students think about the negative answers and respond with a new sentence first by themselves.","(1) 让学生先自己想否定的回答，再用一个新句子回应。",0],["li","(2) Give them ten minutes to talk to the classmates and write their partners' answers in the blanks. Meanwhile, each response should be shown in different books.","(2) 给他们十分钟和同学对话，把伙伴的答案写在空格里。同时，每个回答要写在不同的书上。",0],["li","(3) The Teacher calls some names and asks the questions about them, and their partners have to answer the questions for them.","(3) 老师叫几个名字并问关于他们的问题，由他们的伙伴代为回答。",0],["d","Is Andy going to be in Germany next summer?","T",0],["p","Joseph (Andy's partner): No, he is going to be in China next summer.","Joseph（Andy 的伙伴）：No, he is going to be in China next summer.（不，他明年夏天会待在中国。）",0],["h3","7.6",null,0],["li","(1) Make use of two tenses. There will be five sets of words.","(1) 运用两种时态。共有五组单词。",0],["li","(2) Divide the students into five groups and each group gets a set of words.","(2) 把学生分成五组，每组拿一组单词。",0],["li","(3) Let the students make a story with 30 words using at least two different tenses and have them tell the story to the class.","(3) 让学生用至少两种不同的时态编一个 30 字的故事，再讲给全班听。",0],["h3","7.7",null,0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Go to the touchscreen all-in-one and lead the students to sing.","到触控一体机前带学生唱歌。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Second Class","第二节课",0],["p","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","To start the class","开始上课",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","The teacher is calling some students. Listen and write their names, how they are","老师正在打电话给几位学生。听一听，在对话框中写下他们的名字、状况",0],["h3","and what they have to do in the speech balloons.","和必须做的事。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","What is the polite way to answer the phone? Please turn to page 14. Let's Check. Listen and check. The teacher is calling some students. Listen and write their names, how they are and what they have to do in the speech balloons.","有礼貌地接电话要怎么说？请翻到第 14 页。Let's Check。听一听并勾选。老师正在打电话给几位学生。听一听，在对话框中写下他们的名字、状况和必须做的事。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["li","- Review / point out the key words to the class in the listening exercise.","- 向全班复习／指出听力练习中的关键字。",0],["li","- Explain the exercise to the students and make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","- 向学生说明练习方式，确定说明够清楚，让学生能一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the ordinal numbers what students have learned today by reading in the books.","(1) 看课本复习学生今天学过的序数。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","(1) Take this time to preview their homework. Pick some examples for the students to practice answering.","(1) 利用这段时间预习家庭作业，挑一些例子让学生练习回答。",0],["li","(2) Explain the mistakes they've made last time.","(2) 解释他们上次犯的错误。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning/homework items on the board and have students to write down on their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","(3) Remind them today is telephone teaching day and quickly preview the questions.","(3) 提醒他们今天是电话教学日，快速预习问题。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 5","电话教学教材 5",0],["li","1. What date is today?","1. What date is today?（今天几月几号？）",0],["li","2. Do you like the Mid Autumn Festival?","2. Do you like the Mid Autumn Festival?（你喜欢中秋节吗？）",0],["li","3. What is your favorite holiday?","3. What is your favorite holiday?（你最喜欢哪个节日？）",0],["li","4. What is the third day of the week?","4. What is the third day of the week?（一周的第三天是星期几？）",0],["li","5. What is the ninth month of the year?","5. What is the ninth month of the year?（一年的第九个月是几月？）",0]],"g":[[33,["None"]],[87,["● Fllow the same st above"]]],"tp":["What Will I Be?"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 11 课","t":"Class 11","k":"class","p":[44,45,46],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A. To discuss indefinite places, people, things or activities To discuss looking for and finding objects","课堂读本／课堂活动：讨论不确定的地点、人、事物或活动；讨论寻找和找到物品",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 3","EEC 5 第 3 课",1],["li","- Answering the phone","- 接电话",1],["li","- Calling Being polite","- 打电话　有礼貌",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 5","Classroom Readers 第 5 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","through, surprised, cage, tusk, matter, anything, someone",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 8","课堂活动第 8 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","someone, somebody, something, somewhere, anyone, anybody,",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","It must be somewhere. I can't find it anywhere","It must be somewhere.（它一定在某个地方。）I can't find it anywhere.（我到处都找不到。）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","pardon (excuse me, sorry) calling (speaking, talking) shower (bath, nap) this ( I am)",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Hello, I'd like to talk to Mary.","A",1],["d","Who's calling?","B",1],["d","This is Simon..","A",1],["d","Hold on a second, please.","B",1],["p","Mary! The phone is for you. C Who is it?","Mary! The phone is for you.（Mary！你的电话。）C：Who is it?（是谁？）",1],["d","It's Si mon.","B",1],["d","I am taking a shower.","C",1],["p","I can't come to the phone right now.","I can't come to the phone right now.（我现在没办法接电话。）",1],["d","I'm sorry, Simon. Mary is a little bit busy.","B",1],["p","Would you like to leave a message?","Would you like to leave a message?（你要留言吗？）",1],["d","OK. Could youplease ask her to call me back?.","A",1],["d","I'll do. Thank you. Bye","B",1],["d","Goodbye. orrow.","A",1],["p","anything, anywhere, find",null,1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Quickly review the last lesson.","(1) 快速复习上一课。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students some questions about the future tense. Will you be at home this weekend? Will your mother go to the supermarket tomorrow? Will you have an English class next Monday?","(2) 问学生一些关于将来时的问题：Will you be at home this weekend? Will your mother go to the supermarket tomorrow? Will you have an English class next Monday?",0],["li","(3) Pop Quiz:","(3) 随堂测验：",0],["p","Have the students make questions according to the hints:","让学生依提示造问句：",0],["p","will, movies; went, shopping; ran, quickly; will, writer",null,0],["h2","Classroom Readers (15 mins) Lesson 5 Following The Bad","课堂读本（15 分钟）第 5 课 Following The Bad",0],["h2","Men","Men（跟踪坏人）",0],["li","(1) Introduce the story to the students:","(1) 向学生介绍故事：",0],["p","On their way home, Joey, Sarah, Ann and Billy saw the bad men and they wanted to follow them, would they be dangerous? Let's listen to the story.","回家路上，Joey、Sarah、Ann 和 Billy 看到坏人，想跟踪他们。会有危险吗？我们来听故事。",0],["li","(2) Let the students see the story on the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 让学生在触控一体机上看故事。",0],["li","(3) Teach new words explaining or making sentences in English then using the touchscreen all-in-one. For example: A cage is made for keeping our pets, for example: birds and dogs. Have the students open books and read through the text chorally and individually.","(3) 先用英语解释或造句，再用触控一体机教新单词。例如：A cage is made for keeping our pets, for example: birds and dogs.　让学生打开书齐声和个别念课文。",0],["li","(4) Ask them about the story.(See page 45. )","(4) 问他们关于故事的问题。（见第 45 页）",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 8. I Can't Find It.","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 8 课 I Can't Find It.（我找不到。）",0],["h3","8.1",null,0],["li","(1) Introduce the vocabulary by making a sentence, for example,","(1) 用造句介绍单词，例如：",0],["d","someone: There is someone in the house. The Teacher pretends tobe a mysterious voice, and explains to the students that we use \"someone\" when we are thinking there must be a person. So do \"something\" and \"somewhere.\" Have the students make sentences so that they can get to use them effectively.","T",0],["li","(2) As to \"any~,\" it is used as a simple way. When we are describing \"negative\" \"question\" sentences, we always use \"anyone,\" \"anything\" and \"anywhere.\" For example,","(2) 至于 \"any~\"，用法很简单：描述“否定句”和“疑问句”时，我们总是用 \"anyone\"、\"anything\" 和 \"anywhere\"。例如：",0],["d","anyone: There isn't anyone in the theater.","T",0],["li","(3) The Teacher can extend the sentence: Why isn't there anyone in the theater? Encourage the students to come up with any possible situation to correspond to this question.","(3) 老师可以延伸句子：Why isn't there anyone in the theater? 鼓励学生想出符合这个问题的各种可能情况。",0],["h3","8.4",null,0],["li","(1) Teach the students this item first.","(1) 先教学生这个项目。",0],["li","(2) Lead them to look at the pictures and read the sentence pattern, the teacher asks and the students answer. Then use the touchscreen all-in-one to reinforce the pattern.","(2) 带他们看图念句型，老师问、学生答，再用触控一体机加强句型。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 8. I Can't Find It.","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 8 课 I Can't Find It.（我找不到。）",0],["h3","8.5",null,0],["p","In almost the same way above, the teacher says the first sentence and the students say the second one in order to get familiar with the sentence pattern.","用和上面几乎相同的方式，老师说第一句、学生说第二句，让他们熟悉句型。",0],["h3","8.2",null,0],["li","(1) Let the students say what are the people doing in this picture. The teacher asks them, \"What is Sarah looking for?\" or \"Who is Joey looking for?\"","(1) 让学生说出图中的人在做什么。老师问：\"What is Sarah looking for?\" 或 \"Who is Joey looking for?\"",0],["li","(2) Encourage the students to say the possible answers.","(2) 鼓励学生说出可能的答案。",0],["h3","8.3",null,0],["li","(1) After \"Q& A\" drill, log onto the exercise on the website and practice this sentence pattern again. The students get Activity Sheet 5.","(1) 问答操练后，上网站进入练习再练一次这个句型。学生拿到活动单 5。",0],["li","(2) Divide the students into five groups, and have them talk about a picture from page 6-10 then write a play according to the situation on the Activity Sheet.","(2) 把学生分成五组，让他们讨论第 6–10 页中的一张图，再依情境在活动单上写一出短剧。",0],["li","(3) When the plays are finished, ask each group to come to the front and act out.","(3) 短剧写好后，请各组到前面演出。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report in their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons by reading Classroom Activities B, page 13.","(1) 念课堂活动 B 册第 13 页复习课程。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","(1) Take this time to preview their homework. Pick some examples for the students to practice.","(1) 利用这段时间预习家庭作业，挑一些例子让学生练习。",0],["li","(2) Explain the mistakes they've made last time.","(2) 解释他们上次犯的错误。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning/homework items on the board and have students to write down on their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check the progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[34,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activiti","Lesson 8"]],[76,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Following The Bad"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 12 课","t":"Class 12","k":"class","p":[47,48,49,50],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A. To talk about groups/ sub-groups","课堂读本／课堂活动：谈论群体／子群体",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 4","EEC 5 第 4 课",1],["li","- Offering a helping hand","- 主动提供帮忙",1],["li","- Refusing a helping hand politely","- 有礼貌地拒绝帮忙",1],["li","- Asking prices","- 询问价格",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 6","Classroom Readers 第 6 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","closer, everything, gun, nothing, happen",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 9","课堂活动第 9 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","each, most, none",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","All of the children have candy. Each of the students has a test.","All of the children have candy.（所有孩子都有糖果。）Each of the students has a test.（每位学生都有一份考卷。）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","chocolate bars pretty (very, really, quite) lollipops fifty ( forty, twenty, thirty- five)",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","May I help you?","A",1],["d","No, thanks. I'm just taking a look.","B",1],["d","OK. Take your time.","A",1],["p","N:(Two minutes later.)","N：（两分钟后。）",1],["d","How much are these lollipops?","B",1],["d","They are five for fifty dollars.","A",1],["d","Pretty cheap! Are they on sale?","B",1],["d","Yes, but just for a while.","A",1],["d","OK. I'll take them.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (20 mins)","热身 Warm Up（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the last lesson by practicing with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 用触控一体机练习来复习上一课。",0],["li","(2) Play 2 questions of 8.3 and have the students write down the conversations in the notebooks.","(2) 播放 8.3 的 2 题，让学生把对话写在笔记本上。",0],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 9","课堂活动第 9 课",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (15 mins) Lesson 6 Help! Help!","课堂读本（15 分钟）第 6 课 Help! Help!（救命！救命！）",0],["li","(1) Introduce the story first:","(1) 先介绍故事：",0],["d","The bad men caught Sarah and Kiku. Will they be dangerous? Let's see!","T",0],["li","(2) Show the students the story from the touchscreen all-in-one and then introduce the vocabulary. For example: gun: We use guns to shoot something.","(2) 用触控一体机给学生看故事，再介绍单词。例如：gun: We use guns to shoot something.",0],["li","(3) Lead the students to read the story and do \"Q&A\" about the content.","(3) 带学生念故事，并针对内容做问答。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 9 When Were You","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 9 课",0],["h2","There?","There?（你什么时候在那里？）",0],["h3","9.1",null,0],["li","(1) Introduce the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 用触控一体机介绍单词。",0],["li","(2) Have the students make sentences for the pictures.","(2) 让学生为图片造句。",0],["h3","9.2",null,0],["li","(1) Divide the students into groups.","(1) 把学生分组。",0],["li","(2) Let the students operate the touchscreen all-in-one and refer to their books pages 16 and 17 to present these 10 pictures.","(2) 让学生操作触控一体机，并参考书上第 16 和 17 页呈现这 10 张图。",0],["h3","9.3",null,0],["li","(1) Have the students do the multiple choices themselves for the first time.","(1) 第一次先让学生自己做选择题。",0],["li","(2) Go to the touchscreen all-in-one and check the answers. Instruct the students that the first word (Many..., Each...., Both....) of a sentence is very important; it is related to what kind of 'be' verbs (single/ plural) they should use. If they see \"Many of ....,\" the verb in this sentence must be plural. Pick some examples to let the students practice the phrases. For example:","(2) 到触控一体机前核对答案。告诉学生句子的第一个字（Many...、Each...、Both...）非常重要，它决定要用哪种 be 动词（单数／复数）。看到 \"Many of ....\" 时，这个句子的动词一定是复数。挑一些例子让学生练习这些短语。例如：",0],["li","(3) The Teacher grabs a number of pens and takes two blue pens out, say, \"Both of the pens are blue.\"","(3) 老师抓起几支笔，拿出两支蓝笔说：\"Both of the pens are blue.\"",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 9 When Were You","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 9 课",0],["h2","There?","There?（你什么时候在那里？）",0],["h3","9.4",null,0],["li","(1) Lead the students to read 9.2 on the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 带学生在触控一体机上念 9.2。",0],["li","(2) Hand out Activity Sheet 6","(2) 发下活动单 6。",0],["li","(3) Have the students study the details on the sheet and make up a story about it.","(3) 让学生研究单子上的细节，并编一个相关的故事。",0],["h3","9.5",null,0],["li","(1) Show the students the combined sentences on the board and let them think of two sentences that haven't been combined but are related to the original one.","(1) 给学生看白板上合并后的句子，让他们想出和原句相关、但还没合并的两个句子。",0],["li","(2) Move to the touchscreen all-in-one to check out the answers.","(2) 到触控一体机前核对答案。",0],["h3","9.6",null,0],["li","(1) Have some students come to the board and write the IPA phonetic symbols as you order.","(1) 请几位学生到白板依你的指示写出国际音标。",0],["li","(2) After that, let the rest of the students write down the Spelling according to the IPA symbols on the board. 48","(2) 之后让其他学生依白板上的国际音标写出拼法。48",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h3","9.7",null,0],["p","The Teacher says the words first and let the students identify the syllables. After that, practice the words again.","老师先念出单词，让学生辨识音节，之后再练习一次这些字。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["h3","Context Introduction","情境介绍",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monologue of \"Let's See And Say\" section in lesson four. Teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See & Say:","老师让学生听第 4 课“Let's See And Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See & Say 独白：",0],["p","The boy is shopping at the convenience store. Do you know what he wants to buy? Let's listen to the conversation below.","男孩在便利店购物。你知道他想买什么吗？我们来听听下面的对话。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teachers also need to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced with the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons by reading Classroom Activities.","(1) 念课堂活动复习课程。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that students have learned today using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","(1) Take this time to preview their homework. Pick some examples for the students to practice.","(1) 利用这段时间预习家庭作业，挑一些例子让学生练习。",0],["li","(2) Explain the mistakes they've made last time.","(2) 解释他们上次犯的错误。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning/homework items on the board and have students write it down on their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check the progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind them today is telephone teaching day and quickly preview the questions.","(3) 提醒他们今天是电话教学日，快速预习问题。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 6","电话教学教材 6",0],["li","1. Who is older, you or your mother?","1. Who is older, you or your mother?（你和你妈妈谁年纪比较大？）",0],["li","2. Will you go to any foreign country this summer/ winter vacation?","2. Will you go to any foreign country this summer/winter vacation?（你这个暑假／寒假会出国吗？）",0],["li","3. Is your family going to be at the beach this weekend?","3. Is your family going to be at the beach this weekend?（你家人这个周末要去海边吗？）",0],["li","4. What is the fourth day of the week?","4. What is the fourth day of the week?（一周的第四天是星期几？）",0],["li","5. What is the ninth month of the year?","5. What is the ninth month of the year?（一年的第九个月是几月？）",0]],"g":[[30,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activities","Lesson 9"]],[89,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Help! Help!","When Were You"],"bd":"","m":120},{"z":"第 13 课","t":"Class 13","k":"class","p":[51,52,53],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A. To discuss school subjects To express agreement To agree with negative statements using \"either/ neither.\"","课堂读本／课堂活动：讨论学校科目；表达同意；用 \"either / neither\" 同意否定的叙述。",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 4","EEC 5 第 4 课",1],["li","- Offering a helping hand","- 主动提供帮忙",1],["li","- Refusing a helping hand politely","- 有礼貌地拒绝帮忙",1],["li","- Asking prices","- 询问价格",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 7","Classroom Readers 第 7 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","may, neither, either",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 10","课堂活动第 10 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","subject, math, science, history, pass",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","I didn't pass my history test. Neither did I. I didn't, either.","I didn't pass my history test.（我历史考试没及格。）Neither did I. / I didn't, either.（我也没有。）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","chocolate bars lollipops fifty ( forty, twenty, thirty- five)",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","May I help you?","A",1],["d","No, thanks. I'm just taking a look.","B",1],["d","OK. Take your time.","A",1],["p","N:(Two minutes later.)","N：（两分钟后。）",1],["d","How much are these lollipops?","B",1],["d","They are five for fifty dollars.","A",1],["d","Pretty cheap! Are they on sale?","B",1],["d","Yes, but just for a while.","A",1],["d","OK. I'll take them.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Quickly review the last lesson.","(1) 快速复习上一课。",0],["li","(2) Quiz:","(2) 小测验：",0],["p","Have the students combine the two sentences read by you, you can refer to 9.5. For example:","让学生把你念的两个句子合并，可以参考 9.5。例如：",0],["p","There are a lot of sandwiches. Ten of them are big.","There are a lot of sandwiches. Ten of them are big.（有很多三明治，其中十个很大。）",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Ten of the sandwiches are big.","Ten of the sandwiches are big.（其中十个三明治很大。）",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (15 mins) Lesson 7 We Won't Do It","课堂读本（15 分钟）第 7 课 We Won't Do It",0],["h2","Again!","Again!（我们不会再这样做了！）",0],["li","(1) Introduce the story to the students:","(1) 向学生介绍故事：",0],["p","Sarah and Kiku were saved by the police and it was not a good experience being caught by bad guys. Let's listen what they would say.","Sarah 和 Kiku 被警察救了，被坏人抓住可不是什么好经验。我们来听听他们会说什么。",0],["li","(2) Show them the story using the touchscreen all-in-one, ask the students some questions from the story.","(2) 用触控一体机给他们看故事，问学生一些故事中的问题。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 10 We're Not Very","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 10 课 We're Not Very",0],["h2","Good Students","Good Students（我们不是很好的学生）",0],["h3","10.1",null,0],["li","(1) After learning about the subjects either from the book or the touchscreen all-in-one, tell the students something else about the subjects. For example: social study, music, art, P.E. (physical Education), biology...,etc.","(1) 从课本或触控一体机学过科目后，再告诉学生其他科目，例如：social study（社会）、music（音乐）、art（美术）、P.E.（体育）、biology（生物）等。",0],["li","(2) Have them say something about the subjects they are taking, such as the subjects they like and dislike.","(2) 让他们谈谈自己在上的科目，例如喜欢和不喜欢的科目。",0],["h3","10.2",null,0],["li","(1) Review \"too;\" we use it while agreeing with the positive statements. For example: I went to school by bike yesterday. He did, too.","(1) 复习 \"too\"，同意肯定的叙述时使用。例如：I went to school by bike yesterday. He did, too.",0],["li","(2) Show the students the first picture and let them know the sentence pattern that \"agrees with the negative statements.\"","(2) 给学生看第一张图，让他们知道“同意否定叙述”的句型。",0],["li","(3) Click the \"hand\" right up the square so that the sentence pattern can be dragged to hide; let the students try to make their own sentence using \"neither\" and \"either.\"","(3) 点方格右上方的“手”，把句型拖动隐藏起来，让学生试着用 \"neither\" 和 \"either\" 自己造句。",0],["li","(3) Check the answers after each try.","(3) 每次尝试后核对答案。",0],["h3","10.3",null,0],["li","(1) Have the students do this practice themselves.","(1) 让学生自己做这个练习。",0],["li","(2) Pick some students to read their sentences; don't correct them right away.","(2) 挑几位学生念出他们的句子，不要马上纠正。",0],["li","(3) Check the answers on the touchscreen all-in-one and explain the mistakes they made.","(3) 在触控一体机上核对答案，解释他们犯的错误。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 5 When Were You","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 5 课 When Were You",0],["h2","There?","There?（你什么时候在那里？）",0],["h3","10.4",null,0],["li","(1) Have the students read after the touchscreen all-in-one first and then see the following blanks which need to be filled.","(1) 让学生先跟着触控一体机念，再看接下来需要填写的空格。",0],["li","(2) After each question, let the students fill in the blanks themselves in the books.","(2) 每题结束后，让学生自己在书上填空。",0],["h3","10.5",null,0],["li","(1) Play the touchscreen all-in-one, let all the students listen to the two sentences and make two new sentences using \"either\" and \"neither\" for the first time.","(1) 播放触控一体机，让所有学生听两个句子，第一次先用 \"either\" 和 \"neither\" 造两个新句子。",0],["li","(2) Pair the students up, and have all of them listen to the questions (Remember to let the answers be hidden.) then write down the two new sentences.","(2) 让学生两两一组，听题目（记得把答案隐藏起来），再写下两个新句子。",0],["li","(3) Have the students hand in the answers and then check the answers to the class using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(3) 让学生交出答案，再用触控一体机向全班核对答案。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Second Class","第二节课",0],["p","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","To start the class","开始上课",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Kevin is at the convenience store. He is buying some food. Listen carefully and fill in","Kevin 在便利店买一些食物。仔细听并",0],["h3","the blanks.","填空。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","We can buy many different things from a convenience store such as candy, drinks and many household items. What do you usually buy at the convenience store? Please turn to page 18. Let's Check. Kevin is at the convenience store. He is buying some food. Listen carefully and fill in the blanks.","在便利店可以买到很多不同的东西，例如糖果、饮料和许多家用品。你通常在便利店买什么？请翻到第 18 页。Let's Check。Kevin 在便利店买一些食物。仔细听并填空。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["li","- Review / point out the key words to the class in the listening exercise.","- 向全班复习／指出听力练习中的关键字。",0],["li","- Explain the exercise to the students and make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","- 向学生说明练习方式，确定说明够清楚，让学生能一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lesson by reading Classroom Activities 10.4.","(1) 念课堂活动 10.4 复习课程。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that students have learned today using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","(1) Take this time to preview their homework. Pick some examples for the students to practice.","(1) 利用这段时间预习家庭作业，挑一些例子让学生练习。",0],["li","(2) Explain the mistakes they've made","(2) 解释他们犯的错误。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning/homework items on the board and have students to write down on their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check the progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[30,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V"]],[30,["Book 9","Classroom Activiti","Lesson 10"]],[87,["● Follow the steps","above"]]],"tp":["We Won't Do It","We're Not Very","When Were You"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 14 课","t":"Class 14","k":"class","p":[54,55,56],"b":[["h2","Review Day 2","复习日 2",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","C.R./C.A. Review Quiz 2, Listening Lab 2","课堂读本／课堂活动　复习　第 2 次小测验、第 2 次听力测验",0],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 4","EEC 5 第 4 课",0],["li","- Offering a helping hand","- 主动提供帮忙",0],["li","- Refusing a helping hand politely","- 有礼貌地拒绝帮忙",0],["li","- Asking prices","- 询问价格",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","The digital equipment, a world map","数字设备、一张世界地图",0],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 5-7","课堂读本第 5–7 课",0],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 6-10","课堂活动第 6–10 课",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","pretty (very, really, quite) lollipops fifty ( forty, twenty, thirty- five) chocolate bars",null,0],["h3","Dialogue","对话",0],["d","May I help you?","A",0],["d","No, thanks. I'm just taking a look.","B",0],["d","OK. Take your time.","A",0],["p","N:(Two minutes later.)","N：（两分钟后。）",0],["d","How much are these lollipops?","B",0],["d","They are five for fifty dollars.","A",0],["d","Pretty cheap! Are they on sale?","B",0],["d","Yes, but just for a while.","A",0],["d","OK. I'll take them.","B",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Review (20 mins)","复习 Review（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use the digital teaching to review the lessons that the students have learned from Class 6 to Class 10.","(1) 用数字教学复习学生第 6 堂到第 10 堂课学过的课程。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to spell the vocabulary and answer some questions to review the sentence patterns. Lead the students to read C.A. 9.4 to reinforce this sentence pattern.","(2) 请学生拼单词并回答一些问题来复习句型。带学生念课堂活动 9.4 加强这个句型。",0],["h2","Quiz (25 mins)","小测验 Quiz（25 mins）",0],["p","Hand out the quiz; explain to the students if they have questions about the instructions.","发下小测验卷，如果学生对说明有疑问就向他们解释。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Listening Lab (10 mins)","听力测验（10 分钟）",0],["p","Play the listening tape to the students; have them answer the questions according to the tape. For part 1, please pause 10 seconds between each question.","为学生播放听力录音带，让他们依录音回答问题。第 1 部分每题之间请暂停 10 秒。",0],["h2","Talking About The Story (30 mins)","谈论故事（30 分钟）",0],["li","(1) Give the Activity Sheet 7 back to the students and have the same groups as the last class sit together.","(1) 把活动单 7 发还给学生，让和上堂课同样的组坐在一起。",0],["li","(2) Let every group prepare 10 minutes to present their sheet.","(2) 让每组准备 10 分钟来发表他们的单子。",0],["li","(3) Each group makes a presentation to the class.","(3) 每组向全班发表。",0],["li","(4) The Teacher makes comments to the whole class after each story.","(4) 每个故事结束后，老师向全班讲评。",0],["li","(5) Help the students correct their stories.","(5) 帮学生修改他们的故事。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Third Class","第三堂课",0],["p","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation. Note Please refer to the appendix for the MP3 script and answers of \"Let's Check\" section.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。注意：“Let's Check”部分的 MP3 对话稿和答案请参考附录。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Have the students write the review items on the board.","(1) 让学生把复习项目写在白板上。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their discussion and report today.","(2) 逐一检查进度报告本，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依学生今天的讨论和报告给予反馈的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students there is going to be a test next time.","(3) 提醒学生下次要考试。",0],["li","(4) Remind them today is telephone teaching day and quickly preview the questions.","(4) 提醒他们今天是电话教学日，快速预习问题。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 7","电话教学教材 7",0],["li","1. What is your favorite subject?","1. What is your favorite subject?（你最喜欢哪个科目？）",0],["li","2. When is Christmas? 3.What was yesterday's date?","2. When is Christmas?（圣诞节是什么时候？）3. What was yesterday's date?（昨天是几月几号？）",0],["li","4. Is there anybody else in your home?","4. Is there anybody else in your home?（你家里还有其他人吗？）",0],["li","5. Make a sentence with \"Each of.\"","5. 用 \"Each of\" 造一个句子。",0]],"g":[[25,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Readers","/Classroom Activiti"]],[39,["● Follow the same steps","above"]],[49,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":110},{"z":"第 15 课","t":"Class 15","k":"class","p":[57,58],"b":[["h2","Test Day 2","测验日 2",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","C.R./C.A. Review Test 2","课堂读本／课堂活动　复习　第 2 次考试",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",0],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 5-7","课堂读本第 5–7 课",0],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 6-10","课堂活动第 6–10 课",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Review (15 mins)","复习 Review（15 mins）",0],["p","Write the mistakes students made in Quiz 2 on the board and pick some students to correct the mistakes. Use the digital teaching to reinforce the vocabulary or the sentence patterns. Have the students view the context on the touchscreen all-in-one to understand the use of the vocabulary and the structures.","把学生在第 2 次小测验犯的错误写在白板上，挑几位学生改正。用数字教学加强单词或句型，让学生在触控一体机上看上下文，理解单词和结构的用法。",0],["h2","Test (40 min)","考试（40 分钟）",0],["p","Hand out the test; explain to the students if they have questions about the instructions. Because it is a little bit different from Quiz 2, please pay attention to their writing, in case they get confused by the questions. Let the students choose either one topic to talk to you later on at Oral Test, have them pick a topic one by one after finishing the test.","发下考卷，如果学生对说明有疑问就向他们解释。因为和第 2 次小测验有点不同，请注意他们的作答，以免被题目搞混。让学生选一个主题，等一下口试时和你谈，考完后让他们一个一个选主题。",0],["h2","Oral Test (25 mins)","口试（25 分钟）",0],["p","The Teacher should have two topics for students to prepare for five minutes. Here are the suggestions: (1) Classroom Activities 8.4 No. 2, No. 6 and 9.1 No.1-No.3. (2) Classroom Readers Lesson 7.Conduct the following oral test outside the classroom, individually, with the students. Each question is worth four points, one each for question comprehension, grammar, pronunciation and fluency. Give students the opportunity to correct their own mistakes first. Assign a classroom leader to monitor students' behavior while you are out of the classroom or position your-self so you can observe the class through a window. The oral test is worth 20% of the first test total.","老师应准备两个主题让学生准备五分钟。建议如下：(1) 课堂活动 8.4 第 2、6 题和 9.1 第 1–3 题。(2) 课堂读本第 7 课。在教室外与学生个别进行下面的口试。每题 4 分，理解问题、语法、发音和流畅度各 1 分。先给学生自己改正错误的机会。你离开教室时指派一位班长维持秩序，或站在能从窗户看到教室的位置。口试占考试总分的 20%。",0],["h2","Oral Test Questions:","口试题目：",0],["h2","Have the students pick either one (1) or (2):","让学生选 (1) 或 (2)：",0],["h3","(1) Classroom Activities","(1) 课堂活动",0],["h3","8.4",null,0],["li","1. Do you think there is anything in the box?","1. Do you think there is anything in the box?（你觉得盒子里有东西吗？）",0],["li","2. Do you think Kiku went somewhere this morning?","2. Do you think Kiku went somewhere this morning?（你觉得 Kiku 今天早上去了什么地方吗？）",0],["h3","9.1",null,0],["li","1. Please make a sentence about the picture. 2.Did each of them sing songs?","1. 请针对图片造一个句子。2. Did each of them sing songs?（他们每个人都唱歌了吗？）",0],["li","3. What color are the balloons?","3. What color are the balloons?（气球是什么颜色？）",0],["h3","(2) Classroom Readers","(2) 课堂读本",0],["li","1. Who went to help Kiku and Sarah?","1. Who went to help Kiku and Sarah?（谁去帮 Kiku 和 Sarah？）",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","2. Did Kiku or Sarah tell anything to the bad men?","2. Did Kiku or Sarah tell anything to the bad men?（Kiku 或 Sarah 有告诉坏人什么吗？）",0],["li","3. Did the policemen catch the bad men?","3. Did the policemen catch the bad men?（警察抓到坏人了吗？）",0],["li","4. Was Masumba angry at Kiku and Sarah?","4. Was Masumba angry at Kiku and Sarah?（Masumba 生 Kiku 和 Sarah 的气吗？）",0],["li","5. Were the bad men afraid of the policemen?","5. Were the bad men afraid of the policemen?（坏人怕警察吗？）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (30 mins)","加强（30 分钟）",0],["h2","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Have the students write the review items in the book.","(1) 让学生把复习项目写在书上。",0],["li","(2) Check the progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","(1) Tell the students that there is going to be a flea market for the next class and have them think about what they can bring to the class for the sale.","(1) 告诉学生下堂课要办跳蚤市场，让他们想想可以带什么来卖。",0],["li","(2) Divide the students into several groups and give each group a suggestion about an article that they can sell. Let them prepare for the flea market after class.","(2) 把学生分成几组，给每组一个可以卖的物品建议，让他们课后准备跳蚤市场。",0]],"g":[[8,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Readers","/Classroom Activiti"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":110},{"z":"第 16 课","t":"Class 16","k":"class","p":[59,60],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 2","活动日 2",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","C.R./C.A. Review","课堂读本／课堂活动　复习",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","The digital equipment, stuff for selling in the flea market, fake money (paper)","数字设备、跳蚤市场要卖的东西、假钱（纸做的）",0],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 5- 7","课堂读本第 5–7 课",0],["p","Review","复习",0],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 6- 10","课堂活动第 6–10 课",0],["p","Review","复习",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Warm Up (20 mins)","热身 Warm Up（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Quickly review the mistakes in Test 2.","(1) 快速复习第 2 次考试的错误。",0],["li","(2) Digital Teaching is a quick way to reinforce the learning points..","(2) 数字教学是加强学习重点的快速方式。",0],["h2","Flea Market (80 mins)","跳蚤市场（80 分钟）",0],["li","(1) Help the students arrange the classroom then have them show their stuff for sale with the price tags. (The price is counted by hundreds: 100, 200, ...1000)","(1) 帮学生布置教室，让他们展示要卖的东西并贴上价格标签。（价格以百计：100、200……1000）",0],["li","(2) They can sell the real things or fake ones (toys, drawing on the paper)","(2) 他们可以卖真的东西或假的（玩具、画在纸上的东西）。",0],["li","(3) Let each one make ten pieces of fake money; each one valued at 100 dollars.","(3) 让每人做十张假钞，每张面额 100 元。",0],["li","(4) Starting the activity, have each group introduce their \"best product\" to the class as following:","(4) 活动开始时，让每组依下列方式向全班介绍他们的“最佳商品”：",0],["p","I. What country is it from? II. When can I use it? III. Does it have the same function as the other groups' products? IV. What is the most outstanding feature of other groups' products? V. How can we use it?","I. 它来自哪个国家？II. 什么时候可以用？III. 它和其他组的商品功能一样吗？IV. 其他组商品最突出的特色是什么？V. 要怎么使用？",0],["li","(1) After introducing, let the students buy any products using their fake money in ten minutes and encourage the students to talk to each other.","(1) 介绍完后，让学生在十分钟内用假钱购买任何商品，鼓励学生互相交谈。",0],["li","(2) Pick several students to say what they've bought in the flea market then give out","(2) 挑几位学生说出他们在跳蚤市场买了什么，再发下",0],["h3","Activity Sheet 8.","活动单 8。",0],["li","(3) While they are completing the Activity Sheet, have the students return the things to the persons they \"bought\" it from.","(3) 学生填写活动单时，让他们把东西还给“卖”给他们的人。",0],["li","(4) Tell the students not to throw out the old things without thinking; they can give the old things away or sell them in the flea market. It's a good way to share with other people.","(4) 告诉学生不要不加思考就丢掉旧东西，可以送人或拿到跳蚤市场卖，这是和别人分享的好方法。",0],["li","(5) Have the students ask the Teacher anything about \"flea market\" or any topic related to today's activity in English and the Teacher has to reply to their questions in English as well immediately or later on in the next class.","(5) 让学生用英语问老师任何关于“跳蚤市场”或今天活动相关主题的问题，老师也要用英语立刻回答，或在下一堂课回答。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down on their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students that today is telephone teaching day and preview some questions.","(3) 提醒学生今天是电话教学日，预习一些问题。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 8","电话教学教材 8",0],["li","1. What subject do you like?","1. What subject do you like?（你喜欢什么科目？）",0],["li","2. What subject don't you like?","2. What subject don't you like?（你不喜欢什么科目？）",0],["li","3. What is today's date?","3. What is today's date?（今天几月几号？）",0],["li","4. What is your favorite holiday?","4. What is your favorite holiday?（你最喜欢哪个节日？）",0],["li","5. When is that holiday?","5. When is that holiday?（那个节日是什么时候？）",0]],"g":[[10,["大儿童学习区","Big Kid","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Reader","L5-L7","Classroom Activiti","L6-L10"]],[26,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":110},{"z":"第 17 课","t":"Class 17","k":"class","p":[61,62,63,64],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A. To discuss school subjects To express agreement","课堂读本／课堂活动：讨论学校科目；表达同意",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 5","EEC 5 第 5 课",1],["li","- Asking about bus itinerary","- 询问公交车路线",1],["li","- Asking driver's help Looking for some places","- 请司机帮忙　寻找一些地点",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 8","Classroom Readers 第 8 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Edge, set, kind(s)",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 11","课堂活动第 11 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","geography, interesting, fail, report card, boring",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","I am a good student. So am I/ I am, too.","I am a good student.（我是好学生。）So am I. / I am, too.（我也是。）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","main station (Cityl Hall, National Centre for the Performing Arts ) road (street, avenue, boulevard) hotel (KTV, studio, building) Tai mall (Sogo Department Store, Takashimaia Department Store ) Miss (ma'am, lady)",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Excuse me, sir. Where does this bus go?","A",1],["d","It goes to Beijing Railway Station.","B",1],["d","It intersects Ding Zhou road, doesn't it?","A",1],["d","Yes, but this road is too long.","B",1],["p","Where do you want to go, Miss?","Where do you want to go, Miss?（小姐，你要去哪里？）",1],["d","I'm searching for the Star Hotel.","A",1],["d","Hmmm... you have to get off after the Tai Mall.","B",1],["d","Is it far from here?","A",1],["d","No. Not too far. I'll call you when we get there.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Pop quiz:","(1) 随堂测验：",0],["p","Have the students write down what the Teacher reads.","让学生写下老师念的内容。",0],["li","(2) Vocabulary for quiz: subject, math, science, history After handing in the quiz, let the students open Classroom Activities to page 36 and do 11.6, 11.7 themselves.","(2) 小测验单词：subject、math、science、history。交出小测验后，让学生打开课堂活动第 36 页，自己做 11.6、11.7。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (15 mins) Lesson 8 Thank You For","课堂读本（15 分钟）第 8 课 Thank You For",0],["h2","Helping Us","Helping Us（谢谢你们帮助我们）",0],["p","Recall the previous parts of this story by having the students talk about it or using the digital teaching since this is the last episode of the story. The Teacher can also tell the story according to what the students have learned:","这是故事的最后一集，让学生谈谈或用数字教学回顾前面的情节。老师也可以依学生学过的内容讲故事：",0],["p","The Taylor Family, Dr. Taylor, Joey and Sarah went to Africa for a vacation. They met new friends there, and Billy and Ann, the brave kid, Kiku, lead them to save the animals' lives. Now, let's see how they let those animals go back to their home. Lead the students to see the touchscreen all-in-one and read the story; remind them that protecting animals is everybody's responsibility.","Taylor 一家——Taylor 医生、Joey 和 Sarah——去非洲度假，在那里认识了新朋友，Billy 和 Ann，还有勇敢的孩子 Kiku 带领他们拯救动物的生命。现在我们来看看他们如何让那些动物回家。带学生看触控一体机念故事，提醒他们保护动物是每个人的责任。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 11 We're Very Good","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 11 课 We're Very Good",0],["h2","Students","Students（我们是很好的学生）",0],["h3","11.1",null,0],["li","(1) After introducing the new vocabulary in the book, have the students make sentences according to the pictures.","(1) 介绍书上的新单词后，让学生依图造句。",0],["li","(2) Divide the class into two teams, and pair them up.","(2) 把全班分成两队，再两两一组。",0],["li","(3) The Teacher say any words to the pairs and let one of the students click on them to make sentences and the other one write them on the board.","(3) 老师对各组说任一个字，让其中一位学生点击并造句，另一位写在白板上。",0],["li","(4) Each pair makes a sentence using different vocabulary and both the teams have the same number of words.","(4) 每组用不同的单词造一个句子，两队的字数相同。",0],["li","(5) See which team spends less time and can have the sentences right. Let them win two points.","(5) 看哪一队花的时间较少又句子正确，让他们得两分。",0],["h3","11.2",null,0],["li","(1) Before practicing this part, draw three students on the board with speech bubbles coming from their mouths and say, \"They are good students.\" Let's listen what they are saying. In the first student's speech bubble write, \"I'm a good student.\" In the second one's bubble write, \"I am, too.\" And the last one's write, \"So am I. \" Use the model to teach the students how to express agreement with others.","(1) 练习这部分之前，在白板上画三位学生，嘴边有对话框，说：\"They are good students.\" 我们来听听他们在说什么。在第一位学生的对话框写 \"I'm a good student.\"，第二位写 \"I am, too.\"，最后一位写 \"So am I.\"。用这个范例教学生如何表达同意别人。",0],["li","(2) Pair the students up, and have each group practice an expression of 11.2.","(2) 让学生两两一组，每组练习一个 11.2 的说法。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 11 We're Very Good","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 11 课 We're Very Good",0],["h2","Students","Students（我们是很好的学生）",0],["h3","11.3",null,0],["li","(1) Let the students check the touchscreen all-in-one once, then explain to the students that it is necessary to pay careful attention to the verb tense in the first statement to determine the tense of the verbs in the two following statements. If a verb is in the simple past tense, we use \"did.\" Give some examples:","(1) 让学生看一次触控一体机，再向学生解释，要仔细注意第一句叙述的动词时态，以决定后面两句的动词时态。如果动词是简单过去时，我们用 \"did\"。举一些例子：",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","--Billy failed most of his tests. --So did Sarah.","--Billy failed most of his tests.（Billy 大部分考试都没及格。）--So did Sarah.（Sarah 也是。）",0],["li","(2) Let the students complete the sentence below to see if they get the idea. Billy . Sarah does, too.","(2) 让学生完成下面的句子，看看他们懂不懂：Billy .... Sarah does, too.",0],["li","(3) Have the students complete the questions in the book and present one to the class.","(3) 让学生完成书上的题目，并向全班发表一题。",0],["h3","11.4",null,0],["li","(1) Have the students choose the right answer in the book.","(1) 让学生在书上选出正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Let the same pairs talk about why they didn't choose the other words and correct them.","(2) 让同组讨论为什么没选其他字，并加以改正。",0],["li","(3) The Teacher walks around the pairs and gives them instructions.","(3) 老师在各组之间走动并给予指导。",0],["h3","11.5",null,0],["p","Show the class the first one on the touchscreen all-in-one to be an example. Have the students listen to the two descriptions and then write down another two sentences on the paper according to the example.","在触控一体机上给全班看第一题作为范例。让学生听两段描述，再照范例在纸上写出另外两个句子。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["h3","Context Introduction","情境介绍",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monolog of \"Let's See and Say\" section in lesson five. Teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See And Say:","老师让学生听第 5 课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See And Say 独白：",0],["p","The girl wants to go to the Star Hotel but she doesn't know where it is. The bus driver is helping her. Let's listen to what they are talking about.","女孩想去 Star 饭店，但不知道在哪里，公交车司机正在帮她。我们来听听他们在说什么。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that's related to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced with the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the","结合学生练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再向全班介绍一次本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确定所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和别人",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","进行对话。在这个阶段，老师也应告诉学生在现实生活中可以运用这类对话的情境。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","1. Have the students write the review items on the board.","1. 让学生把复习项目写在白板上。",0],["li","2. Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their discussion and report today.","2. 逐一检查进度报告本，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依学生今天的讨论和报告给予反馈的好时机。",0],["li","3. Remind the students there is going to be a test next time.","3. 提醒学生下次要考试。",0],["li","4. Remind them today is telephone teaching day and quickly preview the questions.","4. 提醒他们今天是电话教学日，快速预习问题。",0]],"g":[[38,["大儿童学习区","Big Kid","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activiti","11.6/11.7"]],[49,["大儿童学习区","Big Kid","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activiti","11.3/11.4"]],[62,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Thank You For","We're Very Good"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 18 课","t":"Class 18","k":"class","p":[65,66,67],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["h3","C.A.",null,1],["p","To express inability to understand something To express encouragement","表达无法理解某事；表达鼓励",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 5","EEC 5 第 5 课",1],["li","- Asking about bus routes","- 询问公交车路线",1],["li","- Asking for the driver's help Looking for some places","- 请司机帮忙　寻找一些地点",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","ten blank sentence cards (size: length: 60 cm * width: 20 cm)","十张空白句子卡（尺寸：长 60 厘米 × 宽 20 厘米）",1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 12","课堂活动第 12 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","What's the matter?, give up, hard, easy, problem, thousand, try",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Some of the subjects are easy. My favorite subject is science.","Some of the subjects are easy.（有些科目很简单。）My favorite subject is science.（我最喜欢的科目是自然科学。）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","main station (City Hall, National Centre for the Performing Arts ) road (street, avenue, boulevard) hotel (KTV, studio, building) Tai mall (Sogo Department Store, Takashimaia Department Store ) Miss (ma'am, lady)",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Excuse me, sir. Where does this bus go?","A",1],["d","It goes to Beijing Railway Station.","B",1],["d","It intersects Ding Zhou road, doesn't it?","A",1],["d","Yes, but this road is too long.","B",1],["p","Where do you want to go, Miss?","Where do you want to go, Miss?（小姐，你要去哪里？）",1],["d","I'm searching for the Star Hotel.","A",1],["d","Hmmm... you have to get off after the Tai Mall.","B",1],["d","Is it far from here?","A",1],["d","No. Not too far. I'll call you when we get there.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Read the news to the class and have the students make sentences to express agreement or disagreement. For example:","(1) 向全班念新闻，让学生造句表达同意或不同意。例如：",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["d","Mr. Mayor went hiking on May 25th.","News",0],["d","Ms. Lee did, too. (So did Ms. Lee.)","S1",0],["li","(2) Pop quiz:","(2) 随堂测验：",0],["p","Have the students make one sentence for expressing agreement and one for disagreement using present and past tense.","让学生用现在时和过去时各造一个表达同意和不同意的句子。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 12 Try It Again","课堂活动（35 分钟）第 12 课 Try It Again（再试一次）",0],["h3","12.1",null,0],["p","Introduce the vocabulary to the students and then have them make the sentences according to each picture.","向学生介绍单词，再让他们依每张图造句。",0],["h3","12.2",null,0],["li","(1) Divide the class into six groups; let each group think of a sentence for a picture.","(1) 把全班分成六组，让每组为一张图想一个句子。",0],["li","(2) Have the groups take turns saying their sentences and try to connect the sentences to those of the previous groups.","(2) 让各组轮流说出句子，并试着和前面几组的句子连接起来。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 12 Try It Again","课堂活动（35 分钟）第 12 课 Try It Again（再试一次）",0],["h3","12.3",null,0],["li","(1) Have each of the ten students write a sentence on a card and let everybody read the card once.","(1) 让十位学生各在一张卡上写一个句子，让大家都念一次卡片。",0],["li","(2) Ask the class to put the sentence cards in the right order.","(2) 请全班把句子卡排成正确的顺序。",0],["li","(3) Let the students complete the order themselves.","(3) 让学生自己完成排序。",0],["h3","12.4",null,0],["li","(1) Let the students read the passage individually.","(1) 让学生个别念短文。",0],["li","(2) Lead the students to discuss the school subjects: Chinese, English, math, nature, society, art and P.E. Let them talk about what subjects they like and what they don't like with the reasons.","(2) 带学生讨论学校科目：语文、英语、数学、科学、社会、美术和体育。让他们谈谈喜欢和不喜欢哪些科目以及原因。",0],["li","(4) Hand out the Activity Sheet 9, have the students fill in the blanks and talk with their friends about the school subjects.","(4) 发下活动单 9，让学生填空，并和朋友谈论学校科目。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","Let's Check Monolog Of Let's Check:","Let's Check　Let's Check 独白：",0],["h3","To start the class","开始上课",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Mrs. Lee and Carol are on the bus. Mrs. Lee is showing Carol around. What do","李太太和 Carol 在公交车上，李太太带 Carol 四处看看。她们看到了什么？",0],["h3","they see? Listen carefully and write down the five places on the map.","仔细听，在地图上写出五个地点。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","The bus is very convenient. We can take it to many places such as the post office, park","公交车非常方便，我们可以搭公交车去很多地方，例如邮局、公园",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","and supermarket. Please turn to page 22. Let's Check. Mrs. Lee and Carol are on the bus. Mrs. Lee is showing Carol around. What do they see? Listen carefully and write down the five places on the map.","和超市。请翻到第 22 页。Let's Check。李太太和 Carol 在公交车上，李太太带 Carol 四处看看。她们看到了什么？仔细听，在地图上写出五个地点。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["li","- Review / point out the key words to the class in the listening exercise.","- 向全班复习／指出听力练习中的关键字。",0],["li","- Explain the exercise to the students and make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","- 向学生说明练习方式，确定说明够清楚，让学生能一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the corrections by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["li","●",null,0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons by reading the passage of 12.3, Classroom Activities B.","(1) 念课堂活动 B 册 12.3 的短文复习课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","(1) Take this time to preview their homework. Pick some examples for the students to practice.","(1) 利用这段时间预习家庭作业，挑一些例子让学生练习。",0],["li","(2) Explain the mistakes they've made last time.","(2) 解释他们上次犯的错误。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning/homework items on the board and have students to write down on their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progresses report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 9","电话教学教材 9",0],["li","1. Sally doesn't like math. Using \"either\" to express that you don't like math.","1. Sally doesn't like math.（Sally 不喜欢数学。）用 \"either\" 表达你也不喜欢数学。",0],["li","2. Nancy won't go anywhere. Using \"neither\" to express that Ann won't go to any places. 3.How many subjects do you have on Thursday? 4.Do you think all the subjects are easy for you?","2. Nancy won't go anywhere.（Nancy 哪里都不去。）用 \"neither\" 表达 Ann 也哪里都不去。3. How many subjects do you have on Thursday?（你星期四有几个科目？）4. Do you think all the subjects are easy for you?（你觉得所有科目对你来说都很简单吗？）",0],["li","5. Tell me about one of your friends' favorite subjects.","5. 告诉我你一位朋友最喜欢的科目。",0]],"g":[[27,["None"]],[34,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson IV","Book 9","Classroom Activities","Lesson","Part 1","12.1","Part 2","12.2","12.2 A","12.2 B","Part 3","12.3","Part 4","12.4"]],[71,["Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Try It Again"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 19 课","t":"Class 19","k":"class","p":[68,69,70],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["h3","C.A.",null,1],["p","Review","复习",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 5","EEC 5 第 5 课",1],["li","- Asking about bus route","- 询问公交车路线",1],["li","- Asking driver's help Looking for some places","- 请司机帮忙　寻找一些地点",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 13","课堂活动第 13 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","None","无",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","None","无",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","main station (City Hall, National Centre for the Performing Arts ) road (street, avenue, boulevard) hotel (KTV, studio, building) Tai mall (Sogo Department Store, Takashimaia Department Store ) Miss (ma'am, lady)",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Excuse me, sir. Where does this bus go?","A",1],["d","It goes to Beijing Railway Station.","B",1],["d","It intersects Ding Zhou road, doesn't it?","A",1],["d","Yes, but this road is too long.","B",1],["p","Where do you want to go, Miss?","Where do you want to go, Miss?（小姐，你要去哪里？）",1],["d","I'm searching for the Star Hotel.","A",1],["d","Hmmm... you have to get off after the Tai Mall.","B",1],["d","Is it far from here?","A",1],["d","No. Not too far. I'll call you when we get there.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Have the students spell some vocabulary that they couldn't do well in during the previous classes.","(1) 让学生拼一些之前几堂课拼得不好的单词。",0],["li","(2) Pop quiz:","(2) 随堂测验：",0],["p","Have the students write down the subjects they like and dislike.","让学生写下他们喜欢和不喜欢的科目。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 13 Yesterday Was Sunday","课堂活动第 13 课 Yesterday Was Sunday（昨天是星期日）",0],["h3","(35 mins)","（35 分钟）",0],["h3","13.1",null,0],["li","(1) The first exercise reviews \"some / any\" words. Write the following words on the board and review them with the students; anywhere, somewhere, anything, something, anyone, someone.","(1) 第一个练习复习 \"some / any\" 的字。把下列字写在白板上和学生复习：anywhere、somewhere、anything、something、anyone、someone。",0],["li","(2) Then erase them from the board and fill in with the students. You call out one of the words and they must yell out the opposite. Repeat going faster and faster.","(2) 然后擦掉，和学生一起填。你喊出其中一个字，他们要喊出相对的字，重复并越来越快。",0],["li","(3) Go over the exercise chorally, reading the answer together and then calling on individuals to make the answers. After oral practice, give the students some time to finish the exercise individually. Then pair them up and have them practice asking/ answering the questions with each other.","(3) 齐声做一遍练习，一起念答案，再叫个别学生回答。口头练习后，给学生一些时间各自完成练习，再让他们两两一组互相练习问答。",0],["h3","13.2",null,0],["li","(1) Review the phrases \"both of,\" \"most of,\" \"all of,\" \"a lot of,\" \"each of,\" \"none of,\" \"some of\" and \"one of\" with the students by writing them on the board.","(1) 把 \"both of\"、\"most of\"、\"all of\"、\"a lot of\"、\"each of\"、\"none of\"、\"some of\" 和 \"one of\" 写在白板上和学生复习。",0],["li","(2) The Teacher points to any words and have the students make a sentence with the phrase by pointing to the picture in the book.","(2) 老师指任一个短语，让学生指着书上的图用这个短语造句。",0],["h3","13.3",null,0],["p","Go over the example with the students and then pair them up to complete the exercise together. Have them assume the roles of the character on the left or the character on the right. Have them switch roles when they're finished. Monitor them for accuracy and pronunciation.","和学生一起看例子，再让他们两两一组完成练习。让他们扮演左边或右边的角色，完成后交换角色。注意他们的正确性和发音。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 13 Yesterday Was Sunday","课堂活动第 13 课 Yesterday Was Sunday（昨天是星期日）",0],["h3","( 35 mins)","（35 分钟）",0],["h3","13.4",null,0],["p","This is a fill-in-the-blank activity also. Give the students a few minutes to complete the exercise. Read through it as a class after they're finished and then have each individual read two or three sentences. Have some additional sentences prepared using these words. Write the sentences on the board and follow-up this exercise with an oral fill-in-the-blank activity.","这也是填空活动。给学生几分钟完成练习，完成后全班一起念一遍，再让每人念两三句。准备一些用这些字的额外句子写在白板上，接着做口头填空活动作为后续练习。",0],["h3","13.5",null,0],["p","The fifth part is a verb chart. Read through it chorally first, then working on pronunciation. Before the class, photocopy the page and cut out all of the verbs in present tense. Put them in a bag and mix them up. Have them all draw one verb out of the bag and give them a few minutes to write down three sentences, one in each of the three tenses. Then have them stand up one at a time and have them read the sentences to the rest of the class. Walk around,and check the grammar during the writing practice. Pay attention to their pronunciation when they read.","第五部分是动词表。先齐声念一遍，再加强发音。上课前复印这一页，把所有现在时动词剪下来放进袋子混在一起。让每人从袋子抽一个动词，给几分钟写三个句子，三种时态各一句。然后让他们一个个站起来向全班念句子。书写练习时在教室里走动检查语法，念的时候注意发音。",0],["h3","13.6",null,0],["p","Explain the meaning of the song and work on pronunciation for some of the tricky vocabulary. Sing it a few times with the touchscreen all-in-one.","解释歌曲的意思，练习一些较难单词的发音，跟着触控一体机唱几遍。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start","用 MP3 播放对话作为快速复习和听力加强，",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","today's class.","开始今天的课程。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Homework Exercises","1- 家庭作业",0],["li","(1) Take this time to preview their homework. Pick some examples for the students to Practice answering.","(1) 利用这段时间预习家庭作业，挑一些例子让学生练习回答。",0],["li","(2) Explain the mistakes they've made last time.","(2) 解释他们上次犯的错误。",0],["h2","2-Progress Report Book","2. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning/homework items on the board and have students to write down on their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check the progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback accrding to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind them today is telephone teaching day, quickly preview the questions.","(3) 提醒他们今天是电话教学日，快速预习问题。",0],["h2","3-P.T.A Preparation","3- 家长会准备",0],["p","Give the play of Class 24 to the students and have them read first. Decide the roles for the next class.","把第 24 堂课的剧本发给学生，让他们先念一遍，决定下堂课的角色。",0]],"g":[[27,["None"]],[32,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activities","Lesson 13"]],[43,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activities","Lesson 13","13.3","13.3A"]],[61,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Yesterday Was Sunday"],"bd":"","m":35},{"z":"第 20 课","t":"Class 20","k":"class","p":[71,72,73,74],"b":[["p","GoalGoals:","目标：",1],["p","C.R./C.A. To describe types of weather in all tenses","课堂读本／课堂活动：用各种时态描述天气",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 6","EEC 5 第 6 课",1],["li","- Asking where the restroom is","- 询问洗手间在哪里",1],["li","- Showing the correct direction Giving information","- 指出正确的方向　提供信息",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 9","Classroom Readers 第 9 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","during, except, carry, weather, leaf, leaves",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 14","课堂活动第 14 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","rainy, snowy, cloudy, windy, warm, cool",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","How is the weather in summer? What was the weather like yesterday?","How is the weather in summer?（夏天天气怎么样？）What was the weather like yesterday?（昨天天气如何？）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","tired( bored, sleepy, starved) someone ( somebody, that gentleman, that person) restroom ( toilet, bathroom ) hall ( sidewalk )",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["h3","Dialogue 1","对话 1",1],["d","Mom, I can't stand walking like this.","A",1],["d","Why, dear? Are you tired?","B",1],["d","No, I need to go to the restroom.","A",1],["d","Let's ask someone where it is.","B",1],["d","Excuse me, sir.","A",1],["p","How can I get to the restroom, please?","How can I get to the restroom, please?（请问洗手间怎么走？）",1],["d","That's easy. Go straight ahead.","B",1],["d","You mean it's at the end of this hall?","A",1],["d","Yeah. It's on the left hand side.","B",1],["d","Thanks for your help.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up- P.T.A Preparation (10 mins)","热身——家长会准备（10 分钟）",0],["li","(1) Decide the roles of the two plays. Let all the students have roles to play.","(1) 决定两出短剧的角色，让所有学生都有角色可以演。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the plots to the students and lead them to read once.","(2) 向学生介绍剧情，带他们念一遍。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to practice during the break.","(3) 提醒学生下课时间练习。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (15 mins) Lesson 9 Tomorrow,","课堂读本（15 分钟）第 9 课 Tomorrow,",0],["h2","Tomorrow, I'll Do It Tomorrow","Tomorrow, I'll Do It Tomorrow（明天，明天，我明天再做）",0],["li","(1) Introduce the story to the students:","(1) 向学生介绍故事：",0],["li","(2) Let the students take a look at the picture first and lead them to say something about the picture.","(2) 让学生先看图，带他们针对图片说一些话。",0],["li","(3) Play the story on the touchscreen all-in-one and let the students tell the story in their words.","(3) 在触控一体机上播放故事，让学生用自己的话讲故事。",0],["li","(4) Ask them about the story. (See page 46. )","(4) 问他们关于故事的问题。（见第 46 页）",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 14","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 14 课",0],["h2","The Weather Report","The Weather Report（天气预报）",0],["h3","14.1",null,0],["p","Explain the vocabulary by making sentences so that the students will know it quickly. For example:","用造句解释单词，让学生快速理解。例如：",0],["p","--It is rainy, the mouse uses the lotus leaf as an umbrella. --It is snowy, the rabbit feels cold. --It is cloudy, the duck likes the weather. --It is windy, the wind is to strong for the dog to open his umbrella. --Because of the fire, the mouse feels warm. --The bear feels cool in front of the fan.","--It is rainy, the mouse uses the lotus leaf as an umbrella.（下雨了，老鼠把荷叶当雨伞。）--It is snowy, the rabbit feels cold.（下雪了，兔子觉得冷。）--It is cloudy, the duck likes the weather.（阴天，鸭子喜欢这种天气。）--It is windy, the wind is too strong for the dog to open his umbrella.（风很大，大到狗打不开伞。）--Because of the fire, the mouse feels warm.（因为有火，老鼠觉得温暖。）--The bear feels cool in front of the fan.（熊在电扇前觉得凉爽。）",0],["h3","14.2",null,0],["li","(1) Lead the students to see the touchscreen all-in-one and practice describing the weather.","(1) 带学生看触控一体机练习描述天气。",0],["li","(2) Let the students try to be weather reporters; have them write down the lines and present it to the class. Here are the lines for reference:","(2) 让学生试着当气象主播，写下台词并向全班报告。以下台词供参考：",0],["p","Good evening, this is Jordan's Weather Report; I am Janet Chang. Let's take a look at the weather. Today, it is cloudy and warm, pretty good. Do you remember the weather last winter? It was snowy and cold. But yesterday it was sunny and hot. How about tomorrow? It will be windy and warm and will be a good day for flying a kite and having a picnic. The good weather will be fine until next week, and then it is going to be rainy and cool. Thanks for watching Jordan's Weather Report.","晚安，这里是乔登气象报告，我是 Janet Chang。我们来看看天气。今天多云温暖，相当不错。你还记得去年冬天的天气吗？下雪又寒冷。但昨天晴朗炎热。明天呢？会有风、温暖，是放风筝和野餐的好日子。好天气会持续到下周，之后会下雨、变凉。感谢收看乔登气象报告。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 14","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 14 课",0],["h2","The Weather Report","The Weather Report（天气预报）",0],["h3","14.3",null,0],["p","After 3 to 4 weather reports, the teacher plays the touchscreen all-in-one and let the students see the picture and write down the answer in page 54.","3 到 4 位学生报告天气后，老师播放触控一体机，让学生看图并在第 54 页写下答案。",0],["h3","14.4",null,0],["p","The teacher asks the class about the questions of this part. Let the students write after answering orally. Get to the touchscreen all-in-one to see the answer for reference.","老师问全班这部分的问题，让学生口头回答后再写，到触控一体机上看答案作为参考。",0],["h3","14.5",null,0],["p","Divide the students into four groups and have one group read a sentence each time without writing. See the touchscreen all-in-one for answers.","把学生分成四组，每次让一组不写、直接念一句。看触控一体机核对答案。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["h3","Context Introduction","情境介绍",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monologue of Let's See and Say section in lesson six. Teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See And Say:","老师让学生听第 6 课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See And Say 独白：",0],["p","The boy is looking for the restroom in the shopping mall. He asks a man where it is. Let's listen to how he asks for directions.","男孩在购物中心找洗手间，他问一位男士洗手间在哪里。我们来听听他怎么问路。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced with the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons by reading Classroom Readers Lesson 9.","(1) 念课堂读本第 9 课复习课程。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","(1) Take this time to preview their homework. Pick some examples for the students to practice.","(1) 利用这段时间预习家庭作业，挑一些例子让学生练习。",0],["li","(2) Explain the mistakes they've made last time.","(2) 解释他们上次犯的错误。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning/homework items on the board and have students to write down on their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check the progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students that there is a telephone teaching today and preview the questions with them.","(3) 提醒学生今天有电话教学，和他们预习问题。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 10","电话教学教材 10",0],["p","1.How's the weather today? 2.Is it raining now? 3.What kind of weather do you like? 4.Did it snow last winter in Japan? 5.Do you like windy days?","1. How's the weather today?（今天天气怎么样？）2. Is it raining now?（现在在下雨吗？）3. What kind of weather do you like?（你喜欢什么样的天气？）4. Did it snow last winter in Japan?（日本去年冬天有下雪吗？）5. Do you like windy days?（你喜欢刮风的日子吗？）",0]],"g":[[31,["None"]],[37,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9 Reader","lesson 9","Learning＆ Play"]],[43,["New Words","大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Activiti","14.2","14.3","14.4","14.5"]],[77,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Tomorrow,"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 21 课","t":"Class 21","k":"class","p":[75,76,77],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A. To be able to ask/ answer questions about adverbs of frequency in all tenses","课堂读本／课堂活动：能用各种时态问答频率副词的问题",1],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 6","EEC 5 第 6 课",1],["li","- Asking where the restroom is - showing the correct direction Giving information","- 询问洗手间在哪里　- 指出正确的方向　提供信息",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 10","Classroom Readers 第 10 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","stomach, empty, wise, owl, embarrassed",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 15","课堂活动第 15 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","once, twice",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","How often does the bird take a shower? He takes a shower once a day.","How often does the bird take a shower?（鸟多久洗一次澡？）He takes a shower once a day.（它一天洗一次。）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","tired( bored, sleepy, starved) someone ( somebody, that gentleman, that person) restroom ( toilet, bathroom ) hall ( sidewalk )",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["h3","Dialogue 1","对话 1",1],["d","Mom, I can't stand walking like this.","A",1],["d","Why, dear? Are you tired?","B",1],["d","No, I need to go to the restroom.","A",1],["d","Let's ask someone where it is.","B",1],["d","Excuse me, sir.","A",1],["p","How can I get to the restroom, please?","How can I get to the restroom, please?（请问洗手间怎么走？）",1],["d","That's easy. Go straight ahead.","B",1],["d","You mean it's at the end of this hall?","A",1],["d","Yeah. It's on the left hand side.","B",1],["d","Thanks for your help.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (20 mins)","热身 Warm Up（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Ask the students how the weather is that day or before that day.","(1) 问学生当天或前一天的天气如何。",0],["li","(2) Get into the touchscreen all-in-one website and show them the pictures of 14.5: No.3, No.4, No.5, No.7 and No.8; let the students complete the sentences in the notebook.","(2) 进入触控一体机网站，给他们看 14.5 第 3、4、5、7、8 题的图，让学生在笔记本上完成句子。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (15 mins) Lesson 10","课堂读本（15 分钟）第 10 课",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Tomorrow, Tomorrow, I'll Do It Tomorrow","Tomorrow, Tomorrow, I'll Do It Tomorrow（明天，明天，我明天再做）",0],["li","(1) Continue the lazy rabbit's story:","(1) 继续懒兔子的故事：",0],["p","Because the rabbit was lazy to keep the food for winter, he was very hungry when winter came. The wise old owl gave the food to the rabbit and told him, \"Don't put off to tomorrow what you can do today.\"","因为兔子懒得储存冬天的食物，冬天来时它非常饿。睿智的老猫头鹰把食物给兔子，并告诉它：\"Don't put off to tomorrow what you can do today.\"（今日事今日毕。）",0],["li","(2) Tell the students the proverb \"Don't put off to tomorrow what you can do today.\" by the way.","(2) 顺便告诉学生这句谚语：\"Don't put off to tomorrow what you can do today.\"",0],["li","(3) Let the students read the story from the touchscreen all-in-one and answer some questions:","(3) 让学生在触控一体机上念故事并回答一些问题：",0],["p","--What did the rabbit always answer? --Did the animals give the rabbit food? --What do you think the old owl gave to the rabbit? --What did the rabbit and we learn from the lesson?","--What did the rabbit always answer?（兔子总是怎么回答？）--Did the animals give the rabbit food?（动物们有给兔子食物吗？）--What do you think the old owl gave to the rabbit?（你认为老猫头鹰给了兔子什么？）--What did the rabbit and we learn from the lesson?（兔子和我们从这课学到什么？）",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 15","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 15 课",0],["p","How Often Do They Do It?","How Often Do They Do It?（他们多久做一次？）",0],["h3","15.1",null,0],["p","Introduce the phrases using the touchscreen all-in-one. Have the students make sentences for the pictures.","用触控一体机介绍短语，让学生为图片造句。",0],["h3","15.2",null,0],["p","Let the students role play the phrases:","让学生用角色扮演演出这些短语：",0],["p","For example:","例如：",0],["d","I take a bath, one per day.","Bird",0],["h3","15.3",null,0],["p","After the role-play, have the students fill in the blanks in 15.3 in 1 minute. Divide the class into two groups; the groups take turns letting one student finish the blanks on the touchscreen all-in-one and the teacher counts the time. The student that can finish the blanks in 30 seconds and get it all right will win a point for his/ her team.","角色扮演后，让学生在 1 分钟内填好 15.3 的空格。把全班分成两组，各组轮流派一位学生在触控一体机上填空，老师计时。在 30 秒内全部填对的学生为队伍得一分。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 15","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 15 课",0],["p","How Often Do They Do It?","How Often Do They Do It?（他们多久做一次？）",0],["h3","15.4",null,0],["p","Have the students do the multiple choices themselves for the first time in two minutes. Play the questions on the touchscreen all-in-one and have the students answer the teacher.","第一次让学生在两分钟内自己做选择题。在触控一体机上播放题目，让学生回答老师。",0],["h3","15.5",null,0],["p","Let the students see the touchscreen all-in-one and make questions according to the answers. After answering together, pick one student to come to the front and choose the correct answer on the touchscreen all-in-one. Give the students who click the right answers applauds.","让学生看触控一体机，依答案提出问题。一起回答后，挑一位学生到前面在触控一体机上选出正确答案，为点对答案的学生鼓掌。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Second Class","第二节课",0],["p","Let's Check To start the class:","Let's Check　开始上课：",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Listening Comprehension:","听力理解：",0],["p","Bob and Ann are looking for some places. Listen and use a line to show how they get there.","Bob 和 Ann 在找一些地方。听一听，用线画出他们怎么到达。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","How can we ask people for directions? Would you use \"excuse me\" or \"could you please tell me where it is?\" to ask? Please turn to page 26. Let's Check. Bob and Ann are looking for some places. Listen and use a line to show how they get there.","我们要怎么向别人问路？你会用 \"excuse me\" 还是 \"could you please tell me where it is?\" 来问？请翻到第 26 页。Let's Check。Bob 和 Ann 在找一些地方。听一听，用线画出他们怎么到达。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["li","- Review / point out the key words to the class in the listening exercise.","- 向全班复习／指出听力练习中的关键字。",0],["li","- Explain the exercise to the students and make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","- 向学生说明练习方式，确定说明够清楚，让学生能一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons by reading Classroom Readers L10.","(1) 念课堂读本第 10 课复习课程。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that students have learned today using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","(1) Take this time to preview their homework. Pick some examples for the students to practice.","(1) 利用这段时间预习家庭作业，挑一些例子让学生练习。",0],["li","(2) Explain the mistakes they've made last time.","(2) 解释他们上次犯的错误。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning/homework items on the board and have students to write down on their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check the progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[30,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9"]],[33,["Classroom Reades","Lesson 10","leaning"]],[41,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book9","Classroom Activities","Lesson 15","15.1","15.2A","15.3-15.5"]],[77,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":120},{"z":"第 22 课","t":"Class 22","k":"class","p":[78,79,80],"b":[["h2","Review Day 3","复习日 3",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","C.R./C.A. Review Quiz 3, Listening Lab 3","课堂读本／课堂活动　复习　第 3 次小测验、第 3 次听力测验",0],["h3","EEC 5 lesson 6","EEC 5 第 6 课",0],["li","- Asking where the restroom is - showing the correc directiont Giving information","- 询问洗手间在哪里　- 指出正确的方向　提供信息",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","The digital equipment Classroom Readers Lesson 8-10 Classroom Activities Lesson 11-15","数字设备　课堂读本第 8–10 课　课堂活动第 11–15 课",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","tired( bored, sleepy, starved) someone ( somebody, that gentleman, that person) restroom ( toilet, bathroom ) hall ( sidewalk )",null,0],["h3","Dialogue","对话",0],["d","Mom, I can't stand walking like this.","A",0],["d","Why, dear? Are you tired?","B",0],["d","No, I need to go to the restroom.","A",0],["d","Let's ask someone where it is.","B",0],["d","Excuse me, sir.","A",0],["p","How can I get to the restroom, please?","How can I get to the restroom, please?（请问洗手间怎么走？）",0],["d","That's easy. Go straight ahead.","B",0],["d","You mean it's at the end of this hall?","A",0],["d","Yeah. It's on the left hand side.","B",0],["d","Thanks for your help.","A",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Review (20 mins)","复习 Review（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use the digital teaching to review the lessons that the students have learned from Class 10 to Class 15.","(1) 用数字教学复习学生第 10 堂到第 15 堂课学过的课程。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to spell some vocabulary and answer some questions to review the sentence patterns.","(2) 请学生拼一些单词并回答一些问题来复习句型。",0],["li","(3) Have the students read the sentences in Classroom Activities 11.3 to be more familiar with the sentence pattern.","(3) 让学生念课堂活动 11.3 的句子，更熟悉句型。",0],["h2","Quiz (20 mins)","小测验（20 分钟）",0],["p","Hand out the quiz; explain to the students if they have questions about the instructions.","发下小测验卷，如果学生对说明有疑问就向他们解释。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Listening Lab (10 mins)","听力测验（10 分钟）",0],["p","Play the listening tape to the students; have them answer the questions according to the tape. For part 1, please pause 10 seconds between each question.","为学生播放听力录音带，让他们依录音回答问题。第 1 部分每题之间请暂停 10 秒。",0],["h2","Interview Time (20 mins)","访问时间（20 分钟）",0],["li","(1) Review the sentence pattern: \"How often...\" in C.A. (B) 15.5.","(1) 复习课堂活动（B）15.5 的句型：\"How often...\"。",0],["li","(2) Give the students Activity Sheet 10.","(2) 发给学生活动单 10。",0],["li","(3) Let the students make three different \"How often\" questions and write them down on the sheet.","(3) 让学生想出三个不同的 \"How often\" 问题写在单子上。",0],["li","(4) Have the students write down the partners' answers in the blanks and then write an essay about the interview, named \"My Friends' Habits.\"","(4) 让学生把伙伴的答案写在空格里，再写一篇关于这次访问的短文，题目是“我朋友的习惯”。",0],["li","(5) Help the students with their Q&A or writing.","(5) 协助学生问答或写作。",0],["li","(6) Have them hand in the Activity Sheet when they are finished.","(6) 完成后让他们交出活动单。",0],["h2","P.T.A Preparation (15 mins)","家长会准备（15 分钟）",0],["li","(1) Let the characters of the two plays come to the front to perform.","(1) 让两出短剧的角色到前面演出。",0],["li","(2) Remind the students about pronunciation, fluency and the costume.","(2) 提醒学生注意发音、流畅度和服装。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Have the students write the review items in the book.","(1) 让学生把复习项目写在书上。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their interview and today's lesson.","(2) 逐一检查进度报告本，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依学生的访问和今天的课程给予反馈的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students there is going to be a test next time.","(3) 提醒学生下次要考试。",0],["li","(4) Remind them today is telephone teaching day and quickly preview the questions","(4) 提醒他们今天是电话教学日，快速预习问题。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 11","电话教学教材 11",0],["li","1. Is it hot in August?","1. Is it hot in August?（八月热吗？）",0],["li","2. What was the weather like last winter?","2. What was the weather like last winter?（去年冬天天气如何？）",0],["li","3. How often do you go to the supermarket?","3. How often do you go to the supermarket?（你多久去一次超市？）",0],["li","4. How often do you go to the movies?","4. How often do you go to the movies?（你多久看一次电影？）",0],["li","5. Do you brush your teeth twice a day?","5. Do you brush your teeth twice a day?（你一天刷两次牙吗？）",0]],"g":[[22,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 9","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11- Lesson 15"]],[29,["Book 9","Classroom Readers","Lesson 9- Lesson 10"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":110},{"z":"第 23 课","t":"Class 23","k":"class","p":[81],"b":[["h2","Test Day 3","测验日 3",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","C.R./C.A. Review Test 3","课堂读本／课堂活动　复习　第 3 次考试",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",0],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 8-10","课堂读本第 8–10 课",0],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 11-15","课堂活动第 11–15 课",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Review (30 mins)","复习 Review（30 mins）",0],["p","Write the mistakes students made in Quiz 3 on the board and pick some students to correct the mistakes. Use the digital teaching to reinforce the vocabulary or the sentence patterns. Have the students read the context on the touchscreen all-in-one to understand the use of the vocabulary and the structures.","把学生在第 3 次小测验犯的错误写在白板上，挑几位学生改正。用数字教学加强单词或句型，让学生在触控一体机上念上下文，理解单词和结构的用法。",0],["h2","Test (40 min)","考试（40 分钟）",0],["p","Hand out the test; explain to the students if they have questions about the instructions. Because it is a little bit different with Test 3, please pay attention to their writing, in case they get confused by the questions.","发下考卷，如果学生对说明有疑问就向他们解释。因为和第 3 次小测验有点不同，请注意他们的作答，以免被题目搞混。",0],["h2","Oral Test (30 mins)","口试（30 分钟）",0],["li","(1) After the test, let the student choose a topic either \"My favorite subject\" or \"My favorite season\" and have them prepare for ten minutes. The students have to tell the Teacher:","(1) 考完后，让学生选一个主题：“我最喜欢的科目”或“我最喜欢的季节”，给他们十分钟准备。学生要告诉老师：",0],["p","--The reason for liking a season. --The best feature of that \"subject\" or \"season.\" The Teacher has to ask the students:","--喜欢某个季节的理由。--那个“科目”或“季节”最棒的特色。老师要问学生：",0],["p","--Any other subjects or seasons they like. --Any other students who have the same opinions.","--还喜欢哪些科目或季节。--有没有其他同学也有同样的看法。",0],["li","(2) The oral test is valued 20 % in total; following is the reference for giving points:","(2) 口试占总分 20%，以下是给分参考：",0],["p","Vocabulary: 5%","单词：5%",0],["d","5%","Fluency",0],["d","5%","Pronunciation",0],["d","5%","Content",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Have the students write the review items on the board.","(1) 让学生把复习项目写在白板上。",0],["li","(2) Check the progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。",0]],"g":[[8,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Reader/","Classroom Activities"]],[22,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":110},{"z":"第 24 课","t":"Class 24","k":"class","p":[82,83,84],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 3","活动日 3",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","C.R./C.A. Correct Test 1 Review P.T.A","课堂读本／课堂活动　订正第 1 次考试　复习　家长会",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",0],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 8-10","课堂读本第 8–10 课",0],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 11-15","课堂活动第 11–15 课",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Test Correction (10 mins)","订正测验 Test Correction（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Hand out the test paper, have the students correct the mistakes by themselves.","(1) 发还考卷，让学生自己订正错误。",0],["li","(2) Play the touchscreen all-in-one to show the students the vocabulary or the sentences that they are not very familiar with and let them repeat.","(2) 用触控一体机给学生看他们不太熟悉的单词或句子，让他们跟着念。",0],["li","(3) Write the questions that the students didn't do well in on the board. Have the class answer the questions together.","(3) 把学生做得不好的题目写在白板上，让全班一起回答。",0],["h2","Performance (50 mins)","演出（50 分钟）",0],["h3","1. What will you be when you grow up?(25 mins)","1. What will you be when you grow up?（你长大后要做什么？）（25 分钟）",0],["d","Amy, John, Jennifer and Nancy are good friends. It is five thirty on Monday afternoon; they are on the way home.","Narrator",0],["d","Amy, you did very well in yesterday's race. You got the second place.","John",0],["d","Yeah, I like to watch you run. You were so fast!","Jennifer",0],["d","The race was so exciting; you almost could run beyond the winner.","Nancy",0],["d","Thank you for your praising, I was happy until I told my mom that I want to be an athlete.","Amy",0],["d","Why? Your mom didn't agree with you?","Nancy",0],["d","No, she wants me to be a teacher.","Amy",0],["d","I know, my mom and dad always tell me, \"Study hard, and you'll be a lawyer like your brother.\" But I don't want to be a lawyer at all.","John",0],["d","So, what will you be when you grow up?","Jennifer",0],["d","I will be an astronaut.","John",0],["d","Wow, it is a very big wish.","Amy",0],["d","That's why I always pay attention to the science class.","John",0],["d","So do I, but I don't want to be a woman astronaut; I want to be a science teacher.","Nancy",0],["d","I am not interested in science.","Jennifer",0],["d","Neither am I. Hey, Jennifer, what do you want to be when you grow up?","Amy",0],["d","Actually, I don't know what to do. Do you guys have any advice?","Jennifer",0],["d","I have an idea. You like to read books. I think you can be a librarian.","John",0],["d","Thank you. That's a good idea. I think working in a library would be fun because I can read whatever books I want.","Jennifer",0],["d","Listen, I know what Amy can be when she grow up.","Nancy",0],["p","Amy, John, Jennifer: What?","Amy、John、Jennifer：What?（什么？）",0],["d","Amy wants to be an athlete and her parents want her to be a teacher..","Nancy",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["d","I know what you'll suggest me.","Amy",0],["p","John, Jennifer, Nancy: what?","John、Jennifer、Nancy：What?（什么？）",0],["d","A P.E teacher, right?","Amy",0],["d","Bingo! How smart you are!","Nancy",0],["d","What do you want to be when you grow up? You can talk to your mom, dad, teacher or friends, they will help you to find out the answer!","Narrator",0],["h3","2. What's your favorite holiday? (20 mins)","2. What's your favorite holiday?（你最喜欢哪个节日？）（20 分钟）",0],["p","Brother (look at the calendar): Today is August 10th of the lunar calendar.","哥哥（看着月历）：Today is August 10th of the lunar calendar.（今天是农历八月十日。）",0],["d","You mean the Mid Autumn Festival is coming?","Sister",0],["d","That's right. I like the Moon Festival.","Brother",0],["d","Same here. Why do you like it?","Sister",0],["d","I like it because I can eat a lot of moon cakes.","Brother",0],["d","Besides, we can have barbecue and watch the moon.","Sister",0],["d","What are you talking about?","Mother",0],["d","We are talking about the Moon Festival.","Sister",0],["d","I liked the Moon Festival since I was a child.","Mother",0],["d","I do, too. That's my favorite holiday. Sis, what's your favorite holiday?","Brother",0],["d","Speak of my favorite holiday, I like Christmas best.","Sister",0],["d","Why do you like Christmas? Do you know why the foreigners have Christmas?","Father",0],["d","I don't know exactly, but I've learned it is a Christian holiday and it is time to send regards to the relatives and friends.","Sister",0],["d","Good girl. Not only at Christmas, we send our greetings to people we like anytime.","Father",0],["d","Daddy, do you like Valentine's Day?","Mother",0],["d","Of course I like it and it is an important day for us, right, honey?","Father",0],["d","Good for you. Do you remember we met on February 14th, 1975?","Mother",0],["d","Dad always remember it, because mom always throws hints to dad when Valentine's Day is around the corner.","Brother",0],["d","And dad always says, \"I love you\" that day.","Sister",0],["p","Father, Mother: Are you jealous of us? Sister, Brother: Yes, we envy you!","爸爸、妈妈：Are you jealous of us?（你们羡慕我们吗？）姐姐、哥哥：Yes, we envy you!（是啊，我们好羡慕你们！）",0],["d","Stop laughing at us, you two. It time for bed.","Mother",0],["d","Good night.","Father",0],["p","Brother, Sister: Nighty- night.","哥哥、姐姐：Nighty-night.（晚安。）",0],["h2","Ceremony (10 mins)","典礼（10 分钟）",0],["li","(1) Give out the certificates of completing this term and tell the parents the lessons their kids will have next term.","(1) 颁发本学期结业证书，并告诉家长孩子下学期要上的课程。",0],["li","(2) Talk to the parents about the kids' performance during this term.","(2) 和家长谈谈孩子本学期的表现。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Have the students write the review items in the book. Check the progress report books individually and also give each student some","(1) 让学生把复习项目写在书上。逐一检查进度报告本，并给每位学生一些",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students feedback according to their performance today.","评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依学生今天的表现给予反馈的好时机。",0],["li","(2) Remind them today is telephone teaching day and quickly preview the questions.","(2) 提醒他们今天是电话教学日，快速预习问题。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 12","电话教学教材 12",0],["li","1. I like to study English. How about you? (Ask them to answer with \"So do I \" if they like to study English as well)","1. I like to study English. How about you?（我喜欢学英语，你呢？）（如果他们也喜欢学英语，请他们用 \"So do I.\" 回答）",0],["li","2. I didn't like the weather yesterday. How about you? (Ask them to answer with \"I didn't, either.\" if they didn't like the weather yesterday, either)","2. I didn't like the weather yesterday. How about you?（我不喜欢昨天的天气，你呢？）（如果他们也不喜欢昨天的天气，请他们用 \"I didn't, either.\" 回答）",0],["li","3. How often do you eat in a fast food restaurant?","3. How often do you eat in a fast food restaurant?（你多久在快餐店吃一次？）",0],["li","4. What is your favorite book?","4. What is your favorite book?（你最喜欢哪本书？）",0],["li","5. How often does your father read the newspaper?","5. How often does your father read the newspaper?（你爸爸多久看一次报纸？）",0]],"g":[[8,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 9","Classroom Reader","L8-L10","Classroom Activities","L11-L15"]],[12,["None"]],[12,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":80},{"z":"作业本解答","t":"Homework Exercises Answers","k":"img","p":[85,86,87,88,89,90,91,92],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"语法总整理","t":"Grammar Summaries","k":"img","p":[93,94],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"EEC“Let's Check”解答","t":"EEC \"Let's Check\" Answers","k":"img","p":[95,96],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0}];